tyle=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 | \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0| \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator |\u00a0<strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/\" title=\"\">Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/a>\u00a0|\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 | \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><br><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><\/span><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010\" title=\"\">Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178,34,34);\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com\" title=\"External link\">ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"trisha@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171991700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpg?_r=1452788764","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79852,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a60f939c2aae1cf41a8634e4527bf74","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The only ones I can think of are country songs! lol Sorry about that. Tim McGraw does one that&#039;s pretty special and some people don&#039;t consider him to be totally country....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What about \"Butterfly Kisses\" by Bob Carlisle&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t think that&#039;s a country song.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!. Let us know what you finally decide!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909413,"PostDate":1452721168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The only ones I can think of are country songs! lol Sorry about that. Tim McGraw does one that's pretty special and some people don't consider him to be totally country....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What about \"Butterfly Kisses\" by Bob Carlisle\u00a0 I don't think that's a country song.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!. Let us know what you finally decide!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79852","Title":"Father Daughter Dance","LastPostDate":1452721168},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
