anning, ladies! I got married at IRHS this past June. Happy to answer any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908117,"PostDate":1449241292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Happy planning, ladies! I got married at IRHS this past June. Happy to answer any questions!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.226.74.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"481b61e4fedae8332d8697777920eb0b","RawContent":"Hey all! I&#039;m a 6\/28\/16 Suites bride :) Curious if anyone visited the site beforehand?","Attachments":[],"Id":1908329,"PostDate":1450033615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey all! I'm a 6\/28\/16 Suites bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Curious if anyone visited the site beforehand?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinfarrell89@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.160.45.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423570105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kristin18","Id":282068,"Name":"Kristin18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05d07827242ff0f116d74b2ba12608f5","RawContent":"I did not! But nothing to worry about. It is gorgeous and we had no complaints with the resort! I was just fantasizing about finding a last minute deal to go back :)\n[quote name=\"Kristin18\" post=\"1908329\" timestamp=\"1450051615\"]\nHey all! I&#039;m a 6\/28\/16 Suites bride :) Curious if anyone visited the site beforehand?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1908343,"PostDate":1450101514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did not! But nothing to worry about. It is gorgeous and we had no complaints with the resort! I was just fantasizing about finding a last minute deal to go back <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kristin18, on 13 December 2015 - 07:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey all! I'm a 6\/28\/16 Suites bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Curious if anyone visited the site beforehand?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403098087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.226.74.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"453e7ad801fb9dff3f05f8c8b9b17290","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1908343\" timestamp=\"1450119514\"]\nI did not! But nothing to worry about. It is gorgeous and we had no complaints with the resort! I was just fantasizing about finding a last minute deal to go back :)[\/quote]\nI&#039;m not worried about it being gorgeous! I&#039;m a bit stressed about picking the locations for everything. Its hard for me to picture where everything will happen after the beach ceremony. We&#039;re leaning towards having the reception at the beach bonfire (we will probably have 25-30 guests), but the weather makes me nervous. But I also havent heard a lot about having the reception at the resorts club. Basically I&#039;m just struggling to plan without really seeing it! Do we pick our locations for everything when we arrive or is that something that needs to be chosen with the coordinators beforehand?","Attachments":[],"Id":1908345,"PostDate":1450117201,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 14 December 2015 - 01:58 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I did not! But nothing to worry about. It is gorgeous and we had no complaints with the resort! I was just fantasizing about finding a last minute deal to go back <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'm not worried about it being gorgeous! I'm a bit stressed about picking the locations for everything. Its hard for me to picture where everything will happen after the beach ceremony. We're leaning towards having the reception at the beach bonfire (we will probably have 25-30 guests), but the weather makes me nervous. But I also havent heard a lot about having the reception at the resorts club. Basically I'm just struggling to plan without really seeing it! Do we pick our locations for everything when we arrive or is that something that needs to be chosen with the coordinators beforehand?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinfarrell89@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.160.45.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423570105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kristin18","Id":282068,"Name":"Kristin18","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79715","Title":"2016 Iberostar Rose Hall Suites Brides","LastPostDate":1453740196},"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
