> User Kyla0808 (285471)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.236.194.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7672c9f9aa91e4950adb8f05a664547","RawContent":"\n\nCongrats to all ladies!!\n\n\nI&#039;m also getting married at the Suites on 16-Nov-2016! \n\nI&#039;m so excited!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908390,"PostDate":1450215550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br>\nCongrats to all ladies!!<br><br>\nI'm also getting married at the Suites on 16-Nov-2016! <br>\nI'm so excited!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daylenwendywedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.236.194.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450213860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"wgoodyear1","Id":285601,"Name":"wgoodyear1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.75.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95a3268ef2c049dc9ded225511b3eed5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kristin18\" post=\"1908345\" timestamp=\"1450135201\"]\nI&#039;m not worried about it being gorgeous! I&#039;m a bit stressed about picking the locations for everything. Its hard for me to picture where everything will happen after the beach ceremony. We&#039;re leaning towards having the reception at the beach bonfire (we will probably have 25-30 guests), but the weather makes me nervous. But I also havent heard a lot about having the reception at the resorts club. Basically I&#039;m just struggling to plan without really seeing it! Do we pick our locations for everything when we arrive or is that something that needs to be chosen with the coordinators beforehand?[\/quote]We did a site visit during a Montego bay vacation and we&#039;re able to see the locations in advance but I also know that since there is only 1 wedding per day, you can choose in your meeting with the coordinator the day or 2 before your wedding. Given the amount of people you expect, a location I liked (but would be too small for our group) was the 2nd floor balcony behind the staircase that looks out over the resort and ocean. It&#039;s beautiful. Sorry  I can&#039;t remember the name of it off-hand. We visited the disco which is available for private rental before I think 10:30 but we really liked the Music Bar that is also available prior to 10:30 when it then open to the rest of the resort. \n\nHappy to help if there are any other questions you had. I know there are a few former brides from the Suites on here as well that cn also chime in. \n\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908651,"PostDate":1450881444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kristin18, on 14 December 2015 - 06:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm not worried about it being gorgeous! I'm a bit stressed about picking the locations for everything. Its hard for me to picture where everything will happen after the beach ceremony. We're leaning towards having the reception at the beach bonfire (we will probably have 25-30 guests), but the weather makes me nervous. But I also havent heard a lot about having the reception at the resorts club. Basically I'm just struggling to plan without really seeing it! Do we pick our locations for everything when we arrive or is that something that needs to be chosen with the coordinators beforehand?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWe did a site visit during a Montego bay vacation and we're able to see the locations in advance but I also know that since there is only 1 wedding per day, you can choose in your meeting with the coordinator the day or 2 before your wedding. Given the amount of people you expect, a location I liked (but would be too small for our group) was the 2nd floor balcony behind the staircase that looks out over the resort and ocean. It's beautiful. Sorry  I can't remember the name of it off-hand. We visited the disco which is available for private rental before I think 10:30 but we really liked the Music Bar that is also available prior to 10:30 when it then open to the rest of the resort. <br><br>\nHappy to help if there are any other questions you had. I know there are a few former brides from the Suites on here as well that cn also chime in. <br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eden.hurd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.196.249.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427733234,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Moni240","Id":282584,"Name":"Moni240","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.147.115.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"313d7e13bb848b2306c4a97a75ec1ece","RawContent":"Starting to look around for a videographer, any recommendations out there? We booked Mischa Earle for our photographer.","Attachments":[],"Id":1909681,"PostDate":1453127083,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Starting to look around for a videographer, any recommendations out there? We booked Mischa Earle for our photographer.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinfarrell89@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.160.45.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423570105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kristin18","Id":282068,"Name":"Kristin18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.29.97.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79715,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc8c517d3df8d7952b2f04665d8e4b37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married Sept 10th 2016 :)&amp;nbsp; :) .&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I actually got the option to visit the resort in Dec. &amp;nbsp;The resort is beautiful! I&#039;m having my wedding at the Grand, ceremony (on the beach) and reception (Port Maria restaurant). Based on reviews, I&#039;ve decided not to use their DJ, photographer\/videographer. &amp;nbsp;I decided to use Lenox Photography(videographer and photographer included), anyone heard of them or used them before? My DJ will be DJ Vaun from JamaicanWeddingDJ company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Only real concern I have so far is with Tai Flora as I heard really bad reviews with them and their our only florist option :angry:&amp;nbsp;. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m starting to make my floral arrangements with them now and already I&#039;m having a hard time.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910020,"PostDate":1453740196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married Sept 10th 2016 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> .\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I actually got the option to visit the resort in Dec. \u00a0The resort is beautiful! I'm having my wedding at the Grand, ceremony (on the beach) and reception (Port Maria restaurant). Based on reviews, I've decided not to use their DJ, photographer\/videographer. \u00a0I decided to use Lenox Photography(videographer and photographer included), anyone heard of them or used them before? My DJ will be DJ Vaun from JamaicanWeddingDJ company.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Only real concern I have so far is with Tai Flora as I heard really bad reviews with them and their our only florist option <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/angry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':angry:' \/>\u00a0. \u00a0I'm starting to make my floral arrangements with them now and already I'm having a hard time.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tremaniab@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.87.234.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453324735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tremania","Id":285976,"Name":"tremania","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
