me cheap but i didnt want o pay fo rit&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849858,"PostDate":1399879368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>im using wedding.com, was orginally using weddingwire but i would like music.. callme cheap but i didnt want o pay fo rit<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#00b0f0;\"><span style=\"font-family:amienne;\">The real act of marriage takes place in the heart, not in the ballroom or church or synagogue. It's a choice you make - not just on your wedding day, but over and over again - and that choice is reflected in the way you treat your husband or wife.<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#00b0f0;\"><span style=\"font-family:amienne;\">Barbara de Angelis<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"nadikamorgan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.189.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399866228,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277925.jpg?_r=1400290290","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Nadika","Id":277925,"Name":"Nadika","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.54.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c425abce6c1831dbc8bb8aa93b35f35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m using mywedding.com also and love it!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850677,"PostDate":1400247763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm using mywedding.com also and love it!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hot_choclate68@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.239.188.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390954670,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"keezy","Id":276385,"Name":"keezy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.77.254.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27560da7665896bac08e5de163f2f0cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did weddingwire.com and it was awesome!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851382,"PostDate":1400584053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did weddingwire.com and it was awesome!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>me and the fiance + 61 guests + 1 week in Cabo while getting married = 1 happy girl <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/>","Email":"cassie.trudeau@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.66.33","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1398898102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277793.jpg?_r=1398917495","PhotoWidth":144,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cassie06","Id":277793,"Name":"cassie06","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.245.167.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4ede95aaa2c0dcbf6f054ed2cb5f09f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We used the knot. I love how it turned out and it was super easy. The music on page sounds cool though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851393,"PostDate":1400587977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We used the knot. I love how it turned out and it was super easy. The music on page sounds cool though.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrswithclass@aol.com","IpAddress":"96.227.248.106","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376872503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1BeachBride","Id":272718,"Name":"1BeachBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.209.112.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dadd5047e4da4128213d3f194ca8c984","RawContent":"Why has everyone got a wedding website? What&#039;s the need in having this? I&#039;m confused","Attachments":[],"Id":1851407,"PostDate":1400590137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Why has everyone got a wedding website? What's the need in having this? I'm confused \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390379854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.245.167.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1400590857,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e17ebd3f0df43979365c9f02e1ea63ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Pablou\"] It gives guests all the information about your wedding... (so questions are answered and they aren&#039;t bugging you while you are trying to plan).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You could include how you met, your engagement, info about your resort, travel info, how to book, travel agent info, pictures, reception info, rsvp details, etc...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mine has kept my guests informed about everything thus far! I keep it updated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You would just include your url on your invitation (probably at the bottom).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851411,"PostDate":1400590819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> It gives guests all the information about your wedding... (so questions are answered and they aren't bugging you while you are trying to plan).<\/p>\n<p>You could include how you met, your engagement, info about your resort, travel info, how to book, travel agent info, pictures, reception info, rsvp details, etc...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mine has kept my guests informed about everything thus far! I keep it updated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You would just include your url on your invitation (probably at the bottom).<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrswithclass@aol.com","IpAddress":"96.227.248.106","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376872503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1BeachBride","Id":272718,"Name":"1BeachBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.209.112.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9cb74a550266882e3284be07b2b9b2a","RawContent":"@[member=\"1BeachBride\"]. I see. That sounds really helpful. Which site did u use and is it free? X\nThanks for helping me get to 150[emoji16]","Attachments":[],"Id":1851415,"PostDate":1400591470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272718\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272718-1beachbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">1BeachBride<\/span><\/a>. I see. That sounds really helpful. Which site did u use and is it free? X<br \/>Thanks for helping me get to 150[emoji16]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390379854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.248.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b55aabc83dd296cfd40f9aa6e8fc85b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Pablou\"] I used &lt;em&gt;The Knot&lt;\/em&gt;. It is free and you probably will like it a lot. It&#039;s very simple to set up since you weren&#039;t too sure about the whole website thing. You just choose a design and go from there! Check it out... theknot.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on reaching 150 posts! No problem...glad to be of assistance!! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851487,"PostDate":1400624009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> I used <em>The Knot<\/em>. It is free and you probably will like it a lot. It's very simple to set up since you weren't too sure about the whole website thing. You just choose a design and go from there! Check it out... theknot.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on reaching 150 posts! No problem...glad to be of assistance!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrswithclass@aol.com","IpAddress":"96.227.248.106","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376872503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1BeachBride","Id":272718,"Name":"1BeachBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.209.112.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5ecde2867996e318b590db133332500","RawContent":"I&#039;ll go on now and have a look see what I&#039;m doing with this web page thing. Do u just forward the web page address to every one who wants to know the info? \nIs it the knot wedding planner?","Attachments":[],"Id":1851508,"PostDate":1400637441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\