{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":208,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1909810,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285832,"Name":"4thelongHALL","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285832.jpg?_r=1453769371","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1453347591,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1909860,"PostDate":1453429664,"PostContent":"Welcome to our forum community 4thelongHALL and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You've come to th...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.153.166","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1cf4c4fe8cc20db2fdd9d683c3d78b0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;Hey guys, I am a newbie that&#039;s for sure!!!! lol I originally was going to get married at the Grand Palladium Jamaica Lady Hamilton but some of my guests thought that the $1887 deal for 5 nights was too expensive so now I am looking at places in Mexico to get married. I would really love some advice on where to book! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;My group for the wedding is only 16 total (with my fiance and me) and we are have a pretty tight budget. I am not having bridesmaids and anyone standing beside us at the ceremony. I would love a beach wedding with a cute pergola with some Tiffany Blue decorations (we can bring decorations I am pretty DIY savy) so any suggestions on that to save money would be greatly appreciated. My guests are looking to stay around $1500-$1700 for 4 or 5 days. I would like to spend less than $4500 total (including photographer) which I think I&#039;ve found! I&#039;m liking PlayaWeddings ( &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/playaweddings.com\/WP\/blog\/%C2%A0)&#039;&gt;http:\/\/playaweddings.com\/WP\/blog\/&amp;nbsp;)&lt;\/a&gt;( &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/playaweddings.com\/WP\/playaweddings-photography-pricing-2014-15\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/playaweddings.com\/WP\/playaweddings-photography-pricing-2014-15\/&lt;\/a&gt; ) and her pricing for the quality is the best I&#039;ve found. I honestly don&#039;t know if I will need more than 3 hours, but I am hoping that I don&#039;t. My friends are doing my hair and makeup and my dress is going to be as simple as I can get. I was just going to wear white lace pants but they told me \"No\" lol! Shouldn&#039;t take me long to get ready (I don&#039;t wear makeup on a daily basis) shouldn&#039;t be too fancy! She can do 3.5 hours of photography for $1,400. I am a little worried about vendor fees though. I really don&#039;t want to be in Cancun but maybe somewhere not far from there. I am wanting something a little less crowded.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;I would also like some input on the weather in Mexico. I am wanting to get married on June 15, 2016 around 4PM and I am nervous about it being too hot. I really don&#039;t need a fancy reception but I would like to cut a cake and maybe have cocktails... So maybe I can do some quick pictures maybe a short \"trash the dress\" before the sun goes down the same day as my wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;I would love any and all feedback!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;Thanks in advance!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Pictures of \"my vision\", these pictures make up what would be my perfect wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/6f\/67\/35\/6f67357b371ca68c749ddc0721837b82.jpg\" alt=\"6f67357b371ca68c749ddc0721837b82.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;I am also all for something in the background! Ex: mountains, rocks, trees... anything pretty!!!! ;P&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/b6\/fa\/71\/b6fa71f20645a42d262eff100886485c.jpg\" alt=\"b6fa71f20645a42d262eff100886485c.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;My friends and sisters have all agreed to wear the same color, that way if I cant get as much blue decor as I hope for, I will still get blue because of their dresses! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/78\/d2\/a6\/78d2a637d27b0ae135a266e9a73656ac.jpg\" alt=\"78d2a637d27b0ae135a266e9a73656ac.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#40e0d0;\"&gt;I am also not wanting to wear shoes and I think something like this would be beautiful!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know some suggestions or tell me where you got married and what your budget was!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Once again, thank you in advance!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;PS - I&#039;m not sure if I will get a notification on here if anyone replies but I will check back frequently!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909810,"PostDate":1453347591,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rotanhammerchick@aim.com","IpAddress":"24.32.153.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452402663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285832.jpg?_r=1453769371","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"4thelongHALL","Id":285832,"Name":"4thelongHALL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.31.83.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by snswedding2016, 20 January 2016 - 08:29 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1453350586,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"696691258aa1ed7ad46ce5a298a850b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"4thelongHALL\"] Congrats on your engagement and upcoming wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where are you travelling from? US...Canada...somewhere else? I just got back from my wedding at Azul Fives just 15 min from Playa del Carmen! Our guests who flew from Toronto (flight &amp;amp; taxes included) for 7 days paid $1630. I&#039;m not sure what the price would be now with the dollar being low (that is IF you are Canadian) but you would get a better rate in June than in January for sure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is your $4500 budget just for the wedding itself at the resort or does that include travel costs, wardrobe, gifts etc? To give you an idea about our wedding we paid just under $3000 (USD) for the wedding including the outside vendor fee for our photographer but this doesn&#039;t include the cost for photography itself or other things like my dress, gifts, decor we brought from home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also if you don&#039;t have one already I would get a great Travel Agent working with you. They will be your guide to finding the perfect resort for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;P.S. the Tiffany blue will look amazing by the ocean!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909813,"PostDate":1453350524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285832\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285832-4thelonghall\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">4thelongHALL<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your engagement and upcoming wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you travelling from? US...Canada...somewhere else? I just got back from my wedding at Azul Fives just 15 min from Playa del Carmen! Our guests who flew from Toronto (flight & taxes included) for 7 days paid $1630. I'm not sure what the price would be now with the dollar being low (that is IF you are Canadian) but you would get a better rate in June than in January for sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is your $4500 budget just for the wedding itself at the resort or does that include travel costs, wardrobe, gifts etc? To give you an idea about our wedding we paid just under $3000 (USD) for the wedding including the outside vendor fee for our photographer but this doesn't include the cost for photography itself or other things like my dress, gifts, decor we brought from home.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also if you don't have one already I would get a great Travel Agent working with you. They will be your guide to finding the perfect resort for you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>P.S. the Tiffany blue will look amazing by the ocean!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe6d6d1bfc94cb67c29753e07135c64e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"4thelongHALL\"] welcome to the forum, you definitely want to get a TA on board. One that specialized in Destination Wedding like the owner of this page. they can guide you based on what you are looking for. there are some good deals that may work for sure&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In case June has prices that you feel are high, you might consider the low season is between August until 15th Dec. &amp;nbsp;that also include hurricane season. you might want to go for Nov to 15 DEC. which has better weather.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can find the bare feet jewelry on many site, check etsy.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909815,"PostDate":1453351356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285832\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285832-4thelonghall\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">4thelongHALL<\/span><\/a> welcome to the forum, you definitely want to get a TA on board. One that specialized in Destination Wedding like the owner of this page. they can guide you based on what you are looking for. there are some good deals that may work for sure<\/p>\n<p>In case June has prices that you feel are high, you might consider the low season is between August until 15th Dec. \u00a0that also include hurricane season. you might want to go for Nov to 15 DEC. which has better weather.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can find the bare feet jewelry on many site, check etsy.com\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.153.166","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f77f5b3450d023df7a30fea67555d03","RawContent":"[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;][color=#40e0d0]I am from Texas (U.S.) I am hoping the $4500 will cover everything. I think we have decided to get married here in the U.S. legally so we wont have to do the blood test and pay extra. So the $4500 I am hoping will pay for the flight, hotel, photographer, vendor fee... everything. I am pretty crafty so I think if I decide to do my own decor I think I can do it very cheap! The photographer I am interested in would be $1400 + flight\/hotel $1600 + wedding (hopefully I can find a simple free one, but if not the Grand Oasis Tulum has one for $650). I think that leaves me about $1000. [\/color][\/font]\n[quote name=\"dreamweddings\" post=\"1909815\" timestamp=\"1453351356\"]\n@[member=\"4thelongHALL\"] welcome to the forum, you definitely want to get a TA on board. One that specialized in Destination Wedding like the owner of this page. they can guide you based on what you are looking for. there are some good deals that may work for sure\nIn case June has prices that you feel are high, you might consider the low season is between August until 15th Dec.  that also include hurricane season. you might want to go for Nov to 15 DEC. which has better weather.\n\n\n\nYou can find the bare feet jewelry on many site, check etsy.com \n\nHappy Planning![\/quote][font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;][color=#40e0d0]My fiance and over half of my group are all coaches\/teachers here in Texas and their only off month is June :( and even then they have summer workouts for their football players!!! I am really nervous about the heat though! :\/ [\/color][\/font]\n\n@snswedding2016 [font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;][color=#40e0d0]I would LOVE pictures if you have any to share! Of the ceremony and the reception!!! Thanks! [\/color][\/font]","Attachments":[],"Id":1909816,"PostDate":1453352696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span  style=\"color:#40e0d0\">I am from Texas (U.S.) I am hoping the $4500 will cover everything. I think we have decided to get married here in the U.S. legally so we wont have to do the blood test and pay extra. So the $4500 I am hoping will pay for the flight, hotel, photographer, vendor fee... everything. I am pretty crafty so I think if I decide to do my own decor I think I can do it very cheap! The photographer I am interested in would be $1400 + flight\/hotel $1600 + wedding (hopefully I can find a simple free one, but if not the Grand Oasis Tulum has one for $650). I think that leaves me about $1000.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dreamweddings, on 20 January 2016 - 08:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285832\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285832-4thelonghall\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">4thelongHALL<\/span><\/a> welcome to the forum, you definitely want to get a TA on board. One that specialized in Destination Wedding like the owner of this page. they can guide you based on what you are looking for. there are some good deals that may work for sure<\/p>\n<p>In case June has prices that you feel are high, you might consider the low season is between August until 15th Dec. \u00a0that also include hurricane season. you might want to go for Nov to 15 DEC. which has better weather.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can find the bare feet jewelry on many site, check etsy.com\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span  style=\"color:#40e0d0\">My fiance and over half of my group are all coaches\/teachers here in Texas and their only off month is June <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> and even then they have summer workouts for their football players!!! I am really nervous about the heat though! :\/\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p><br \/><p>@snswedding2016\u00a0<span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span  style=\"color:#40e0d0\">I would LOVE pictures if you have any to share! Of the ceremony and the reception!!! Thanks!\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rotanhammerchick@aim.com","IpAddress":"24.32.153.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452402663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285832.jpg?_r=1453769371","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"4thelongHALL","Id":285832,"Name":"4thelongHALL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc07e84a8f8b2bb95873c86a75c3d954","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community 4thelongHALL and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great ideas, suggestions, advice and support from everyone here, so well done on a great start already!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to our webpage telling you weather and sunset times for Mexico in June: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!weather-sunset\/cggz&#039;&gt;Weather \/ sunset &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;On June 15, the sun sets at 7:31pm, so that gives you time after the ceremony for a newlywed photo session that would capture the GOLDen light that&#039;s so beautiful right before sunset!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It actually slots in perfectly with our suggested timeline - that you can see at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!faqs\/c1m9m&#039;&gt;FAQs&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul Fives is a very picturesque wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there recently.....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Azul Fives Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12087274_10153681637999487_921566260327431168_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087274_10153681637999487_9215662603274\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/12120111_10153681638509487_5318691576908311068_o.jpg\" alt=\"12120111_10153681638509487_5318691576908\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11224348_10153681639504487_358800014038396685_o.jpg\" alt=\"11224348_10153681639504487_3588000140383\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtl1\/t31.0-8\/12068422_10153681641079487_8016697710294099699_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068422_10153681641079487_8016697710294\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and that you find the perfect answers that work best for You!!! cheers, team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909860,"PostDate":1453429664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community 4thelongHALL and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You've come to the right place for lots of great ideas, suggestions, advice and support from everyone here, so well done on a great start already!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to our webpage telling you weather and sunset times for Mexico in June: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!weather-sunset\/cggz' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Weather \/ sunset <\/a><\/p>\n<p>On June 15, the sun sets at 7:31pm, so that gives you time after the ceremony for a newlywed photo session that would capture the GOLDen light that's so beautiful right before sunset!<\/p>\n<p>It actually slots in perfectly with our suggested timeline - that you can see at this link: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!faqs\/c1m9m' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>FAQs<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul Fives is a very picturesque wedding venue - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there recently.....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12087274_10153681637999487_921566260327431168_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087274_10153681637999487_9215662603274\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/12120111_10153681638509487_5318691576908311068_o.jpg\" alt=\"12120111_10153681638509487_5318691576908\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11224348_10153681639504487_358800014038396685_o.jpg\" alt=\"11224348_10153681639504487_3588000140383\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtl1\/t31.0-8\/12068422_10153681641079487_8016697710294099699_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068422_10153681641079487_8016697710294\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and that you find the perfect answers that work best for You!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79881","Title":"June 15, 2016 - Mexico (Need All The Advice I Can Get)","LastPostDate":1453429664},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
