ble":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7156c690921679c7d69bdbf129970c3","RawContent":"&lt;font face=\"Book Antiqua\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"4\"&gt;Wow, Thope and Katrese....soo close!! I feel the excitement for you! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Thope - cake pics &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;6875&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;WEDDING CAKES.pdf&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:818.482421875,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pdf&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1017568,"PostDate":1264960670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Book Antiqua\"><font size=\"4\">Wow, Thope and Katrese....soo close!! I feel the excitement for you! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thope - cake pics <\/font><\/font><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"6875\",\"name\":\"WEDDING CAKES.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":818.482421875,\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2e719a0b539f2b896d6c38c8701817b","RawContent":"We honeymooned at EPM and it was everything we could have ever asked for. It is truly a romantic getaway and perfect for a wedding. If we&#039;d had a destination wedding, I would&#039;ve done it there in a heartbeat.\n \n We&#039;re from Florida, so our wedding was kind of a destination wedding for a good chunk of our guests anyway.\n \n I wrote a *very* detailed review of the property &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowUserReviews-g1229340-d649432-r28223055-Excellence_Playa_Mujeres-Playa_Mujeres_Yucatan_Peninsula.html\"&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt; on Trip Advisor if you&#039;d like to check it out.\n \n There are links in the review to TONS of pictures, but if you&#039;d just like to go straight to the pictures, you can do so &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/QueenBecca037\/TripAdvisorPics\"&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I&#039;ve convinced at least 6 or 7 other couples to go there (some of them complete strangers who just messaged me on Trip Advisor after reading the review) for their honeymoon because I rave about how wonderful it is.\n \n I&#039;m so happy for all of you who are getting married there. It really is a wonderful place and you&#039;ll be so thrilled you got married there!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1021482,"PostDate":1265192854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We honeymooned at EPM and it was everything we could have ever asked for. It is truly a romantic getaway and perfect for a wedding. If we'd had a destination wedding, I would've done it there in a heartbeat.<br \/> <br \/> We're from Florida, so our wedding was kind of a destination wedding for a good chunk of our guests anyway.<br \/> <br \/> I wrote a *very* detailed review of the property <a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowUserReviews-g1229340-d649432-r28223055-Excellence_Playa_Mujeres-Playa_Mujeres_Yucatan_Peninsula.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a> on Trip Advisor if you'd like to check it out.<br \/> <br \/> There are links in the review to TONS of pictures, but if you'd just like to go straight to the pictures, you can do so <a href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/QueenBecca037\/TripAdvisorPics' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I've convinced at least 6 or 7 other couples to go there (some of them complete strangers who just messaged me on Trip Advisor after reading the review) for their honeymoon because I rave about how wonderful it is.<br \/> <br \/> I'm so happy for all of you who are getting married there. It really is a wonderful place and you'll be so thrilled you got married there!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccalrosell@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1265153011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225272.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TheStudioBPhotography","Id":225272,"Name":"TheStudioBPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"611c0eaf7815cda96664f9434c6dc995","RawContent":"Hi Ladies!\n \n I know it has been quite awhile since I have posted anything, but that doesnt mean I havent been reading all the information you guys post! \n \n I had a question, if anyone has used a DJ from an outside vendor who did you use? I saw one recommendation for DJ Doremixx, but I was hoping to contact multiple GOOD (!) DJs. \n \n Thanks Ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":1021668,"PostDate":1265228888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies!<br \/> <br \/> I know it has been quite awhile since I have posted anything, but that doesnt mean I havent been reading all the information you guys post! <br \/> <br \/> I had a question, if anyone has used a DJ from an outside vendor who did you use? I saw one recommendation for DJ Doremixx, but I was hoping to contact multiple GOOD (!) DJs. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks Ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valeriefearns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1254520310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222240.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValerieandBrian2010","Id":222240,"Name":"ValerieandBrian2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6087a9eb202e2ccf7316e6ab20205346","RawContent":"Hi Ladies!\n I&#039;m only THIRTY days away from my EPM wedding!!! It&#039;s coming SO fast! : ) I can&#039;t wait to be down there!\n We&#039;ll be using DJ Dorremix and have had a great experience with him so far! He&#039;s been really responsive to emails and has sent over great recommendations and song lists!\n Any last many tips from anyone!? : )","Attachments":[],"Id":1021943,"PostDate":1265242768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies!<br \/> I'm only THIRTY days away from my EPM wedding!!! It's coming SO fast! : ) I can't wait to be down there!<br \/> We'll be using DJ Dorremix and have had a great experience with him so far! He's been really responsive to emails and has sent over great recommendations and song lists!<br \/> Any last many tips from anyone!? : )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rebecca and Clay<\/span><br><span>3-5-10<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.rebeccaandclay.com\">www.rebeccaandclay.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rah_3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257638541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223137.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":26,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rebecca030510","Id":223137,"Name":"Rebecca030510","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3dc669a22749c341c7e7ed1f04a50f6f","RawContent":"Hello EPM Brides!\n \n First, I just wanted to thank everyone for very very useful tips on planning a wedding in EPM. Yamina&#039;s 2 day response times were starting to drive me crazy (i&#039;m just so spoiled with a few hour response time in US!), but after reading through the thread I realized, that she is quite busy and maybe her niceties in the emails are sincere. \n \n Our ceremony will be at the beach and I&#039;m trying to figure out the best design for the beach set-up. I don&#039;t think I&#039;m a fan of the seashells, but maybe... What are the choices that you made? I wonder if there are pictures of any additional arch designs. Also does anyone have an attachment for the choices of available flower bouquets? \n \n I also was wondering about the hair and make-up professionals at the hotel.. are they good?... Does anyone have any feedback?\n \n I&#039;m very excited - the resort is lovely - we were there last summer and really enjoying being a little further from all the action in Cancun.\n \n Rebecca - I hope all goes better than you imagined!","Attachments":[],"Id":1027381,"PostDate":1265680692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello EPM Brides!<br \/> <br \/> First, I just wanted to thank everyone for very very useful tips on planning a wedding in EPM. Yamina's 2 day response times were starting to drive me crazy (i'm just so spoiled with a few hour response time in US!), but after reading through the thread I realized, that she is quite busy and maybe her niceties in the emails are sincere. <br \/> <br \/> Our ceremony will be at the beach and I'm trying to figure out the best design for the beach set-up. I don't think I'm a fan of the seashells, but maybe... What are the choices that you made? I wonder if there are pictures of any additional arch designs. Also does anyone have an attachment for the choices of available flower bouquets? <br \/> <br \/> I also was wondering about the hair and make-up professionals at the hotel.. are they good?... Does anyone have any feedback?<br \/> <br \/> I'm very excited - the resort is lovely - we were there last summer and really enjoying being a little further from all the action in Cancun.<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca - I hope all goes better than you imagined!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/2pEAm5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/2pEAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"renatasnapko@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264900784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225181.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":117,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rsnapko","Id":225181,"Name":"rsnapko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"657cf280106bf4cd8512bd1295076ab6","RawContent":"RE: my previous post - I just received the bouquet and centerpiece info from Yamina. Let me know if anyone needs it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1027396,"PostDate":1265680948,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                RE: my previous post - I just received the bouquet and centerpiece info from Yamina. Let me know if anyone needs it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/2pEAm5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/2pEAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"renatasnapko@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264900784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225181.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":117,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rsnapko","Id":225181,"Name":"rsnapko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0125b19183d9a8b1555d34245c06b6ba","RawContent":"Hello!\n Trying to make a decision on resort... quick question..\n Any thoughts on the beach at EPM? Is it sandy or lots of coral\/rocks?","Attachments":[],"Id":1027575,"PostDate":1265685166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello!<br \/> Trying to make a decision on resort... quick question..<br \/> Any thoughts on the beach at EPM? Is it sandy or lots of coral\/rocks?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristin.dziadosz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262595463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kdziadosz","Id":224294,"Name":"kdziadosz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63e004da63a3a507890ca3042fe61cdb","RawContent":"Hi, I havent read through all the posts, but is this resort actually in cancun? my FI doesn&#039;t want to go to Cancun because he has been there before, but I really like this resort, so I am just trying to figure out if it is actually in Cancun.please let me know. thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1028099,"PostDate":1265703637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, I havent read through all the posts, but is this resort actually in cancun? my FI doesn't want to go to Cancun because he has been there before, but I really like this resort, so I am just trying to figure out if it is actually in Cancun.please let me know. thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffani@josephinsurancegroup.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246308439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218912.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lovelytlc","Id":218912,"Name":"lovelytlc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d89482d646e9b1c052fa62c707ffc6a2","RawContent":"It is pretty sandy and there is a ton of sea grass, but other than that, it is lovely.\n \n Hope this helps some.\n \n Smiles,\n Shanna\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kdziadosz&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello!\n Trying to make a decision on resort... quick question..\n Any thoughts on the beach at EPM? Is it sandy or lots of coral\/rocks?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1028101,"PostDate":1265703729,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It is pretty sandy and there is a ton of sea grass, but other than that, it is lovely.<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps some.<br \/> <br \/> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kdziadosz<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello!<br \/> Trying to make a decision on resort... quick question..<br \/> Any thoughts on the beach at EPM? Is it sandy or lots of coral\/rocks?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62a40f92c3edebc7cff3f31e92954d97","RawContent":"All of you wonderful EPM Brides...are any of you having a local reception when you get back for everyone that could not make it to your wedding in Mexico. We are, but we are just doing something laid back. We are going to have a dinner at a local place. Just wondering what everyone else was doing.\n \n Let me know.\n \n Shanna","Attachments":[],"Id":1028107,"PostDate":1265703927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                All of you wonderful EPM Brides...are any of you having a local reception when you get back for everyone that could not make it to your wedding in Mexico. We are, but we are just doing something laid back. We are going to have a dinner at a local place. Just wondering what everyone else was doing.<br \/> <br \/> Let me know.<br \/> <br \/> Shanna\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"27268","Title":"Excellence Playa Mujeres Brides Post Here!","LastPostDate":1452215913},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":430,"NextPage":440,"PreviousPage":420,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
