e":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df70a3584a4dae7a3572fbfdccb9a226","RawContent":"Are any of you girls doing a brunch the next day? If so where are you having it? I wanted to do a brunch cruise sort of thing, but not for 4 hours.","Attachments":[],"Id":1028818,"PostDate":1265758118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Are any of you girls doing a brunch the next day? If so where are you having it? I wanted to do a brunch cruise sort of thing, but not for 4 hours.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be3dd142b395bdb6323a9c2be2176514","RawContent":"Hi Everyone!! My fiance and I are actually getting married at the other excellence resort in Mexico the Riviera Cancun. We were thinking about &amp;quot;honeymooning&amp;quot; at the Playa Mujeres resort, but my fiance does not know if he wants to deal with the hassle of packing up everything and moving to another location in the middle of our vacation. We have never been to the EPM so it is hard to know if it will be worth it. We were hoping to stay in one of the oceanfront rooftop terrace suites if we do move locations. Does anyone have any experience that they could share to help me with my decision? anything about the resort and\/or if the rooftop terrace is worth it would be very much appreciated. \n \n Thank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1030810,"PostDate":1265883081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone!! My fiance and I are actually getting married at the other excellence resort in Mexico the Riviera Cancun. We were thinking about \"honeymooning\" at the Playa Mujeres resort, but my fiance does not know if he wants to deal with the hassle of packing up everything and moving to another location in the middle of our vacation. We have never been to the EPM so it is hard to know if it will be worth it. We were hoping to stay in one of the oceanfront rooftop terrace suites if we do move locations. Does anyone have any experience that they could share to help me with my decision? anything about the resort and\/or if the rooftop terrace is worth it would be very much appreciated. <br \/> <br \/> Thank you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Treenbean99@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249376293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220151.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Treenbean2011","Id":220151,"Name":"Treenbean2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a3579fac92685763fea16b79224aba6","RawContent":"Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?","Attachments":[],"Id":1031368,"PostDate":1265930359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@myweddingcancun.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1265783263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225495.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RM Wedd helper","Id":225495,"Name":"RM Wedd helper","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e5796e9b57a2b7a58a9d1829b8efc53","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MSG518&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Are any of you girls doing a brunch the next day? If so where are you having it? I wanted to do a brunch cruise sort of thing, but not for 4 hours.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m doing brunch the at one of the resturants on the resort, we get married on Saturday and most people will be leaving Sunday so whomever is left at 11am the next day can join us. I did hear the cruises are awesome from another poster....","Attachments":[],"Id":1034841,"PostDate":1266212492,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MSG518<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Are any of you girls doing a brunch the next day? If so where are you having it? I wanted to do a brunch cruise sort of thing, but not for 4 hours.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm doing brunch the at one of the resturants on the resort, we get married on Saturday and most people will be leaving Sunday so whomever is left at 11am the next day can join us. I did hear the cruises are awesome from another poster....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52847043a48d0b61908733c7d1f23f2e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;RM Wedd helper&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Wow this place looks amazing I just read a great review of it on trip advisor...I dont think they offer it as an option or at least I wasnt told about it. From what I can tell you will have to provide everything if your group is bigger than about 15 people...","Attachments":[],"Id":1034849,"PostDate":1266213257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>RM Wedd helper<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Wow this place looks amazing I just read a great review of it on trip advisor...I dont think they offer it as an option or at least I wasnt told about it. From what I can tell you will have to provide everything if your group is bigger than about 15 people...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b98550bda013f7be83776cbfb807bfcd","RawContent":"If you wanted to rent it out and have your wedding there it certainly is possible! I believe it is a 3 day minimum but you can also have children come onsite for the wedding!\n \n \n \n \n UOTE=RM Wedd helper;1172908]Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?[\/QUOTE]","Attachments":[],"Id":1034932,"PostDate":1266220325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you wanted to rent it out and have your wedding there it certainly is possible! I believe it is a 3 day minimum but you can also have children come onsite for the wedding!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> UOTE=RM Wedd helper;1172908]Hi girls! I was wondering if any of you has seen the Villa located next to EPM? I think they call it Balam-Ha but it is beautifull! Do the girls at the hotel offer it as an option?[\/QUOTE]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1193117580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207874.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferSS","Id":207874,"Name":"JenniferSS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f16a395f4c7cece254fffabccda0c25d","RawContent":"This is one resort I am considering for our weddingmoon. I too do not have enough points to open up all of the valuable information you wonderful people post on here. I hope to be able to check out some important links in the near future.","Attachments":[],"Id":1039981,"PostDate":1266470302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is one resort I am considering for our weddingmoon. I too do not have enough points to open up all of the valuable information you wonderful people post on here. I hope to be able to check out some important links in the near future.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/meredithandjedd.com\">My Planning Site<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wqxRY9P\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...Y9P\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/jk46iybq93.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/jk46iybq93.png<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"meredithhaley@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1264190210,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224948.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":73,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mere","Id":224948,"Name":"Mere","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43a191f0104709cc423fae42e7769ad3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;rsnapko&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello EPM Brides!\n \n First, I just wanted to thank everyone for very very useful tips on planning a wedding in EPM. Yamina&#039;s 2 day response times were starting to drive me crazy (i&#039;m just so spoiled with a few hour response time in US!), but after reading through the thread I realized, that she is quite busy and maybe her niceties in the emails are sincere. \n \n Our ceremony will be at the beach and I&#039;m trying to figure out the best design for the beach set-up. I don&#039;t think I&#039;m a fan of the seashells, but maybe... What are the choices that you made? I wonder if there are pictures of any additional arch designs. Also does anyone have an attachment for the choices of available flower bouquets? \n \n I also was wondering about the hair and make-up professionals at the hotel.. are they good?... Does anyone have any feedback?\n \n I&#039;m very excited - the resort is lovely - we were there last summer and really enjoying being a little further from all the action in Cancun.\n \n Rebecca - I hope all goes better than you imagined!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It looks like we will be at EPM at the same time! Our wedding is June 15 and we are staying through the 21st... \n \n We are getting married on the beach as well. After seeing several pictures (on here and in Yamina&#039;s emails) I think I am going to keep it simple and go without the arch\/flowers, and just do a runner and chair sashes. There are only 14 people other than us and we are trying to keep it simple. Plus the flowers\/arch are an additional cost and being that we are both teachers and won&#039;t get paid again until late August it&#039;s best for us. I believe I have a file from Yamina of pictures of those options- let me know if you needed. \n \n Also, if you look back a couple pages, Jennifer put a link to her amazing pictures by Cecilia Dumas and there are some ceremony ones there plus her hair and make up. In her pp she said her hair and make up turned out much better than her picture\/she expected. So I think you can relax as far as that goes!","Attachments":[],"Id":1043345,"PostDate":1266647830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>rsnapko<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello EPM Brides!<br \/> <br \/> First, I just wanted to thank everyone for very very useful tips on planning a wedding in EPM. Yamina's 2 day response times were starting to drive me crazy (i'm just so spoiled with a few hour response time in US!), but after reading through the thread I realized, that she is quite busy and maybe her niceties in the emails are sincere. <br \/> <br \/> Our ceremony will be at the beach and I'm trying to figure out the best design for the beach set-up. I don't think I'm a fan of the seashells, but maybe... What are the choices that you made? I wonder if there are pictures of any additional arch designs. Also does anyone have an attachment for the choices of available flower bouquets? <br \/> <br \/> I also was wondering about the hair and make-up professionals at the hotel.. are they good?... Does anyone have any feedback?<br \/> <br \/> I'm very excited - the resort is lovely - we were there last summer and really enjoying being a little further from all the action in Cancun.<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca - I hope all goes better than you imagined!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It looks like we will be at EPM at the same time! Our wedding is June 15 and we are staying through the 21st... <br \/> <br \/> We are getting married on the beach as well. After seeing several pictures (on here and in Yamina's emails) I think I am going to keep it simple and go without the arch\/flowers, and just do a runner and chair sashes. There are only 14 people other than us and we are trying to keep it simple. Plus the flowers\/arch are an additional cost and being that we are both teachers and won't get paid again until late August it's best for us. I believe I have a file from Yamina of pictures of those options- let me know if you needed. <br \/> <br \/> Also, if you look back a couple pages, Jennifer put a link to her amazing pictures by Cecilia Dumas and there are some ceremony ones there plus her hair and make up. In her pp she said her hair and make up turned out much better than her picture\/she expected. So I think you can relax as far as that goes!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9378b69bf6a83661bf753de918ee39ef","RawContent":"This is such a great thread! Our EPM wedding is on 8\/9\/10. Our travel agent just confirmed the date so I haven&#039;t spoken with the wedding coordinator yet. Our ceremony (symbolic only) will be very small - just me, FI and possibly 6-8 guests. Any advice on questions I should ask the WC when we start the planning process? We are going with just the basic wedding package and adding a photo package. I would love to learn from everyone&#039;s experience!","Attachments":[],"Id":1049355,"PostDate":1267051830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is such a great thread! Our EPM wedding is on 8\/9\/10. Our travel agent just confirmed the date so I haven't spoken with the wedding coordinator yet. Our ceremony (symbolic only) will be very small - just me, FI and possibly 6-8 guests. Any advice on questions I should ask the WC when we start the planning process? We are going with just the basic wedding package and adding a photo package. I would love to learn from everyone's experience!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anandres@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1266628838,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225754.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anandres","Id":225754,"Name":"anandres","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":440,"NextPage":450,"PreviousPage":430,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
