> Time: 1453778840 / Tue, 26 Jan 2016 03:27:20 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=27268&start=490&SessionId=5044e21e2f320ff3d39914aabcaed5fc
> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fd5dadbf6572ffc435f93c9d2f4069b","RawContent":"Wow, I didn&#039;t even think about the dress code. Thank you for asking about that. I have to say that this website and all of your comments have made me so at ease with booking this location! I started out with Dreams at Maroma Beach but I have heard horrible things about their service. Yamina called me this week from Mexico and she seems very nice. I told her about this website and the nice things all of you have been saying and she didn&#039;t even know about it. She seems very sweet! I finally found my dress this weekend and can&#039;t wait to see it all put together with the veil and hair!! I also just ordered my save the date cards which will hopefully be here by the end of this coming week. I found the cutest cards on weddingpaperdivas.com. Next order of business is asking my friends to be in the wedding. I don&#039;t know why but I am nervous they will say no as it could be rather expensive as it is I am already asking them to go to Mexico! I was so excited to be able to book DJ Doremixx but found out that you can only use DJ Mannia which is totally fine but they are a bit more expensive and provide less then DJ Doremixx. Not happy about that! Does anyone have any experience with DJ Mannia that could tell me about?","Attachments":[],"Id":1100605,"PostDate":1270429570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow, I didn't even think about the dress code. Thank you for asking about that. I have to say that this website and all of your comments have made me so at ease with booking this location! I started out with Dreams at Maroma Beach but I have heard horrible things about their service. Yamina called me this week from Mexico and she seems very nice. I told her about this website and the nice things all of you have been saying and she didn't even know about it. She seems very sweet! I finally found my dress this weekend and can't wait to see it all put together with the veil and hair!! I also just ordered my save the date cards which will hopefully be here by the end of this coming week. I found the cutest cards on weddingpaperdivas.com. Next order of business is asking my friends to be in the wedding. I don't know why but I am nervous they will say no as it could be rather expensive as it is I am already asking them to go to Mexico! I was so excited to be able to book DJ Doremixx but found out that you can only use DJ Mannia which is totally fine but they are a bit more expensive and provide less then DJ Doremixx. Not happy about that! Does anyone have any experience with DJ Mannia that could tell me about?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather7877@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268724558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226485.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heather7877","Id":226485,"Name":"Heather7877","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"601072a4d1821bd497a16741eff8db98","RawContent":"Heather7877, I will be there just about a week before you!! :) \n \n To everyone else: Thanks for all the great tips on this forum, they have really helped me out! Just wanted to let you all know that I am also a Stella &amp;amp; Dot jewelry stylist! There are some great pieces in the current collection for your beach wedding - lots of starfish, turqoise or fun casual CZ pieces! Please check out my website (you can shop on line or PM me) at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose\"&gt;Sarah Rose - Stella &amp;amp; Dot Stylist&lt;\/a&gt;. Let me know if you have any questions!","Attachments":[],"Id":1101251,"PostDate":1270498291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Heather7877, I will be there just about a week before you!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> To everyone else: Thanks for all the great tips on this forum, they have really helped me out! Just wanted to let you all know that I am also a Stella & Dot jewelry stylist! There are some great pieces in the current collection for your beach wedding - lots of starfish, turqoise or fun casual CZ pieces! Please check out my website (you can shop on line or PM me) at <a href='http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sarah Rose - Stella & Dot Stylist<\/a>. Let me know if you have any questions!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c060e021540bc0eb58253fc9b0dc972","RawContent":"Hey Everyone...I&#039;ve been MIA for a while!! \n I&#039;m so excited for you Katrese and Thope on your upcomming weddings! I can&#039;t wait to hear all about them!\n \n Since I&#039;ve last been on here:\n I finally finished my STDs and got them all send out last week...took me several weeks to get them done but they turned out great!\n Also bought my dress...I absolutely love it. Nothing like I thought I wanted until I tried it on and fell in love!!\n \n Hope everyone is having fun planning!\n \n If anyone has questions about the resort - we vacationed there last March so I can help out!\n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1102095,"PostDate":1270535636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Everyone...I've been MIA for a while!! <br \/> I'm so excited for you Katrese and Thope on your upcomming weddings! I can't wait to hear all about them!<br \/> <br \/> Since I've last been on here:<br \/> I finally finished my STDs and got them all send out last week...took me several weeks to get them done but they turned out great!<br \/> Also bought my dress...I absolutely love it. Nothing like I thought I wanted until I tried it on and fell in love!!<br \/> <br \/> Hope everyone is having fun planning!<br \/> <br \/> If anyone has questions about the resort - we vacationed there last March so I can help out!<br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3034fdadefa1674f5746ccece55743fb","RawContent":"Thanks Ladies for the dress code info! I am booking DJ Mannia and will let you know the total cost soon..the dance floor is not included but lighting is. Also I&#039;m waiting to hear back on photo packages from Juan to compare with C R.\n ~Have you all done your OOT bags yet..I&#039;m a little behind and only have the actual bags and advil..so nervous I wont get everything done.. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1103845,"PostDate":1270633057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Ladies for the dress code info! I am booking DJ Mannia and will let you know the total cost soon..the dance floor is not included but lighting is. Also I'm waiting to hear back on photo packages from Juan to compare with C R.<br \/> ~Have you all done your OOT bags yet..I'm a little behind and only have the actual bags and advil..so nervous I wont get everything done.. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile43.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile43\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"