{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"117e1e5b8a5dd433bb12f24586e81d8b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ButterflyR12&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thope - Where did you get your actual OOT bags from?\n \n Rebecca&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;TARGET...my bags are just gift bags I&#039;m only putting small items in them. So far I have mini sun block, advil, pepto, bug spray(if I can find it), cd of our fav love songs. Whats every one else doing for bags..aside from beach towels..I dont want to pack them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1111020,"PostDate":1271138572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ButterflyR12<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thope - Where did you get your actual OOT bags from?<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>TARGET...my bags are just gift bags I'm only putting small items in them. So far I have mini sun block, advil, pepto, bug spray(if I can find it), cd of our fav love songs. Whats every one else doing for bags..aside from beach towels..I dont want to pack them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5142fb9f476d8364a47664a98a2e79b2","RawContent":"S_Katrese you must be in Playa Mujeres right now. Wishing you all the best! Looking forward to your update once you get back.","Attachments":[],"Id":1115826,"PostDate":1271424198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                S_Katrese you must be in Playa Mujeres right now. Wishing you all the best! Looking forward to your update once you get back.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04c2a4ccf8a2c74c7cf25ff1decfe2a2","RawContent":"Hi Ladies! Has anyone put together a welcome\/guest book for when the guests arrive at the resort? \n \n thope- I don&#039;t know what I&#039;m putting in my guest bag yet- but I will be sure to post when I do! I did NOT want to do towels either. I bought them from target and only 16 took up a lot of space and were super heavy. They weren&#039;t that great of a quality and I decided it wasn&#039;t worth it. I want to put a welcome\/guest book in each bag, but I haven&#039;t really gotten anything else. There is a thread on here about what people liked\/used and didn&#039;t- you might want to check that out. All I know is whatever I do- I have to keep it cheap! FI is upset right now because I ordered custom hand painted maracas and he does not like to spend money!!! As for the bags, I ordered a pink\/white beach bag for each the girls and a green pull-string backpack type bag for the guys. On the girls I will iron on my logo (below) but instead of our names I will put the girls name- I won&#039;t be doing this for the guys- I don&#039;t think they&#039;d like it. On my bag I&#039;m going to put &amp;quot;Mrs. D***&amp;quot; instead of &amp;quot;Jessica &amp;amp; Adam.&amp;quot;","Attachments":[],"Id":1117189,"PostDate":1271507456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies! Has anyone put together a welcome\/guest book for when the guests arrive at the resort? <br \/> <br \/> thope- I don't know what I'm putting in my guest bag yet- but I will be sure to post when I do! I did NOT want to do towels either. I bought them from target and only 16 took up a lot of space and were super heavy. They weren't that great of a quality and I decided it wasn't worth it. I want to put a welcome\/guest book in each bag, but I haven't really gotten anything else. There is a thread on here about what people liked\/used and didn't- you might want to check that out. All I know is whatever I do- I have to keep it cheap! FI is upset right now because I ordered custom hand painted maracas and he does not like to spend money!!! As for the bags, I ordered a pink\/white beach bag for each the girls and a green pull-string backpack type bag for the guys. On the girls I will iron on my logo (below) but instead of our names I will put the girls name- I won't be doing this for the guys- I don't think they'd like it. On my bag I'm going to put \"Mrs. D***\" instead of \"Jessica & Adam.\"\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9207f59b63a4f1f55b2524a6406eee77","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;scrose&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Heather7877, I will be there just about a week before you!! :) \n \n To everyone else: Thanks for all the great tips on this forum, they have really helped me out! Just wanted to let you all know that I am also a Stella &amp;amp; Dot jewelry stylist! There are some great pieces in the current collection for your beach wedding - lots of starfish, turqoise or fun casual CZ pieces! Please check out my website (you can shop on line or PM me) at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose\"&gt;Sarah Rose - Stella &amp;amp; Dot Stylist&lt;\/a&gt;. Let me know if you have any questions!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;How exciting! Love your website and jewelery. I will have to take some more time and check it all out. Good luck with your wedding planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1117501,"PostDate":1271534425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>scrose<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Heather7877, I will be there just about a week before you!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> To everyone else: Thanks for all the great tips on this forum, they have really helped me out! Just wanted to let you all know that I am also a Stella & Dot jewelry stylist! There are some great pieces in the current collection for your beach wedding - lots of starfish, turqoise or fun casual CZ pieces! Please check out my website (you can shop on line or PM me) at <a href='http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sarah Rose - Stella & Dot Stylist<\/a>. Let me know if you have any questions!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>How exciting! Love your website and jewelery. I will have to take some more time and check it all out. Good luck with your wedding planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heather7877@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268724558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226485.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Heather7877","Id":226485,"Name":"Heather7877","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73ae067cbf9e401d4915471d8786a106","RawContent":"Hey girls,\n \n It&#039;s been a while since I&#039;ve been on. A LOT going on in my life right now (looking for a new job and buying a house)! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n It took me about a day to catch up on all the new posts and THANKS for all the useful information! I&#039;ve been wondering about the cake flavors.\n \n Congrats THOPE!! You must be having an amazing time!! Can&#039;t wait to hear all about it! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n I&#039;ve heard great things about DJ Mannia..there was a great review on this forum. Also if you booked in February they were having a sale - 30% off!! So I&#039;m sure they will be running other discounts, just keep an eye out.\n \n I&#039;ve been stressing most about the Welcome\/Rehearsal Dinner and the OOT bags!! \n Rebecca, you calmed my nerves about the Welcome Dinner...The Spice Lounge terrace sounds great. I know a past bride had her reception there and it turned out beautifully!\n \n As for the OOT bags...I ordered my actually bags on VISTAPRINT and decided not to use my monogram. I used a beach scene that they had and our date. They didn&#039;t turn out as nicely as I imagined, but they are still cute. I&#039;m also stressing on what to put in them. I&#039;m putting in the standard - advil, sunscreen, pepto, bug spray, etc. Towels seem like such a great idea, but where the heck do you pack them?? \n \n As for the dress code, we put that info in our passport invitations under a &amp;quot;Travel Tips&amp;quot; page. We got the info straight from the EPM website so our guests will know what to pack. Hopefully they will actually read them &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Anyways, good luck to all you girls! I know we stress out before hand, but &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;EVERY&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; EPM bride says everything turns out GREAT so try not to stress and enjoy! Happy Planning! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheers\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1118142,"PostDate":1271608888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls,<br \/> <br \/> It's been a while since I've been on. A LOT going on in my life right now (looking for a new job and buying a house)! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> It took me about a day to catch up on all the new posts and THANKS for all the useful information! I've been wondering about the cake flavors.<br \/> <br \/> Congrats THOPE!! You must be having an amazing time!! Can't wait to hear all about it! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I've heard great things about DJ Mannia..there was a great review on this forum. Also if you booked in February they were having a sale - 30% off!! So I'm sure they will be running other discounts, just keep an eye out.<br \/> <br \/> I've been stressing most about the Welcome\/Rehearsal Dinner and the OOT bags!! <br \/> Rebecca, you calmed my nerves about the Welcome Dinner...The Spice Lounge terrace sounds great. I know a past bride had her reception there and it turned out beautifully!<br \/> <br \/> As for the OOT bags...I ordered my actually bags on VISTAPRINT and decided not to use my monogram. I used a beach scene that they had and our date. They didn't turn out as nicely as I imagined, but they are still cute. I'm also stressing on what to put in them. I'm putting in the standard - advil, sunscreen, pepto, bug spray, etc. Towels seem like such a great idea, but where the heck do you pack them?? <br \/> <br \/> As for the dress code, we put that info in our passport invitations under a \"Travel Tips\" page. We got the info straight from the EPM website so our guests will know what to pack. Hopefully they will actually read them <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Anyways, good luck to all you girls! I know we stress out before hand, but <strong><u>EVERY<\/u><\/strong> EPM bride says everything turns out GREAT so try not to stress and enjoy! Happy Planning! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheers\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cde2df03caee9f28f97a7701047d00b2","RawContent":"I just saw Katrese&#039;s TTD wedding photos on Juan Navarro&#039;s site. Just beautiful!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1122827,"PostDate":1271880745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just saw Katrese's TTD wedding photos on Juan Navarro's site. Just beautiful!!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f59283ff092f2ede1900424af6ec8fa2","RawContent":"Ladies what&#039;s your plan for hair and makeup at the resort? Are you using the resort spa? Any recommendations. This is just one of the many things I&#039;ve just thought about.","Attachments":[],"Id":1128264,"PostDate":1272293598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies what's your plan for hair and makeup at the resort? Are you using the resort spa? Any recommendations. This is just one of the many things I've just thought about.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91129f90e3995eeedf206a3ff86eb7a6","RawContent":"I am using the resort spa. My hair and makeup is included in my gold package. I figure if I don&#039;t like what they do I can fix it up myself in the end as my hair is not really going to be an issue. This does not really worry me as I have seen previous pics of hair done by them and they were all nice.","Attachments":[],"Id":1129201,"PostDate":1272326616,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am using the resort spa. My hair and makeup is included in my gold package. I figure if I don't like what they do I can fix it up myself in the end as my hair is not really going to be an issue. This does not really worry me as I have seen previous pics of hair done by them and they were all nice.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fd7a25cbd5baf47192a2bf714579cbe","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;thope&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Karana &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome3.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Welcome3\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I just email her...it takes between 24 and 48 hrs to get a response so I try to compile a few questions at a time.. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:weddings.xpm@excellence-resorts.com\"&gt;weddings.xpm@excellence-resorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;thanks she can take so long to get back to me sometimes it makes me crazy. omg your day is comeing soo soon","Attachments":[],"Id":1132135,"PostDate":1272510178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>thope<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Karana <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome3.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Welcome3\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I just email her...it takes between 24 and 48 hrs to get a response so I try to compile a few questions at a time.. <a href='mailto:weddings.xpm@excellence-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings.xpm@excellence-resorts.com<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>thanks she can take so long to get back to me sometimes it makes me crazy. omg your day is comeing soo soon\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karen_arana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268799147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"karana","Id":226512,"Name":"karana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"680c519f076d7c52e4ade3102c70af40","RawContent":"Hi I am new to this forum and have set a date for April 8th at EPM. I am so exicted, but like everyone else I have several questions. I have read through most of your posts and feel more confindent with each one I read that I made a good choice in EPM. I would like any information you have regarding the reception....such as cake choices, food choices, reception areas, etc. I am unable to open up any attatchments so if you could email me any information, I would greatly appreciate it. Also any save the date letters or examples you have would be wonderful as well. Thanks to all of you for your information....it is greatly appreciated. My email address is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:eaustin@liberty.k12.mo.us\"&gt;eaustin@liberty.k12.mo.us&lt;\/a&gt;\n Thanks again for all your help with such a BIG day.","Attachments":[],"Id":1133694,"PostDate":1272605029,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi I am new to this forum and have set a date for April 8th at EPM. I am so exicted, but like everyone else I have several questions. I have read through most of your posts and feel more confindent with each one I read that I made a good choice in EPM. I would like any information you have regarding the reception....such as cake choices, food choices, reception areas, etc. I am unable to open up any attatchments so if you could email me any information, I would greatly appreciate it. Also any save the date letters or examples you have would be wonderful as well. Thanks to all of you for your information....it is greatly appreciated. My email address is <a href='mailto:eaustin@liberty.k12.mo.us' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>eaustin@liberty.k12.mo.us<\/a><br \/> Thanks again for all your help with such a BIG day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eaustin@liberty.k12.mo.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1272594255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227763.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eaustin","Id":227763,"Name":"eaustin","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":500,"NextPage":510,"PreviousPage":490,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
