ble cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>thope<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey Ladies, <br \/> Lee and I are back from the most wonderful experience of our lives!!! I'll post more later....but rest assured everything will be perfect even if it rains..as it did on our wedding day!!! Juan has posted photos of almost our entire event on his blog.. <a href='http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/blog\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Juan Navarros Blog Blog<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Oh wow THope. Love your photos. Absolutely love you dress! I can't wait...61 more days to go. Yamina still looks as cute as ever.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cac2c8ed87281ebb7442d82d8f79d5a2","RawContent":"Thope- your pictures are absolutely beautiful!!! Congratulations! :)\n \n Question- were the chairs included or did you pay an upgrade for them? (Normally I see the white plastic chairs and I don&#039;t like them, I would much rather have the chiavari (sp?) chairs like you did!)","Attachments":[],"Id":1168357,"PostDate":1275361903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thope- your pictures are absolutely beautiful!!! Congratulations! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> Question- were the chairs included or did you pay an upgrade for them? (Normally I see the white plastic chairs and I don't like them, I would much rather have the chiavari (sp?) chairs like you did!)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"022e5f218f0950fb40be3e010df184ef","RawContent":"Thanks ladies..\n jbrodhead I got the chairs and some extra decor through Rafaelle Pata of Mayan Hospitatlity he works with Yamina a lot, but I think if you just want the chairs she can get them for you. They can have every color I saw a wedding the day before ours with gold chairs... I also saw a wedding with the white plastic ones...they dont look bad as long as everything else is decorated.","Attachments":[],"Id":1169435,"PostDate":1275445363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks ladies..<br \/> jbrodhead I got the chairs and some extra decor through Rafaelle Pata of Mayan Hospitatlity he works with Yamina a lot, but I think if you just want the chairs she can get them for you. They can have every color I saw a wedding the day before ours with gold chairs... I also saw a wedding with the white plastic ones...they dont look bad as long as everything else is decorated.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf2bd51cefd8eadcfa62d733f896c28b","RawContent":"Everything looks AMAZING. The pictures looks so great, Juan seems like a great photographer and I love the dress, I bought a San Patrick too, looks very similar in shape! \n \n I had a couple questions, where did you guys have your reception at? I really want to do an outside space like yours, I was originally hoping for the Spice Terrace. \n \n What time of day did you guys get married? I am doing Feb of 2011 and getting married at 5pm, I was worried we may have to take pictures before the ceremony. \n \n Another other advice?! Everything looks great and Yamina looks so cute, I cant wait to meet her!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1170224,"PostDate":1275508311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Everything looks AMAZING. The pictures looks so great, Juan seems like a great photographer and I love the dress, I bought a San Patrick too, looks very similar in shape! <br \/> <br \/> I had a couple questions, where did you guys have your reception at? I really want to do an outside space like yours, I was originally hoping for the Spice Terrace. <br \/> <br \/> What time of day did you guys get married? I am doing Feb of 2011 and getting married at 5pm, I was worried we may have to take pictures before the ceremony. <br \/> <br \/> Another other advice?! Everything looks great and Yamina looks so cute, I cant wait to meet her!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valeriefearns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1254520310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222240.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValerieandBrian2010","Id":222240,"Name":"ValerieandBrian2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"175c71658d760c5aef973e08279900ac","RawContent":"Thanks Thope! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1170986,"PostDate":1275543874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Thope! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aef41cd908871eb5d042987d54c06470","RawContent":"THope thanks for sharing! Ladies how close to the wedding did you really start working on details with Yamina? Did you get everything sorted out once you arrived or did you start sending her photos? We&#039;re have a pretty large wedding (100 guests) so I&#039;m starting to think it&#039;s about time I get things rolling.","Attachments":[],"Id":1172475,"PostDate":1275658372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                THope thanks for sharing! Ladies how close to the wedding did you really start working on details with Yamina? Did you get everything sorted out once you arrived or did you start sending her photos? We're have a pretty large wedding (100 guests) so I'm starting to think it's about time I get things rolling.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d1b5649cfc7a2341c892029ca94016d","RawContent":"Hi ladies! I have a question for those of you who have been to EPM... Yamina confirmed by reception\/dinner will be held at Agave restaurant. For the cocktail hour I have the Agave terrace or Revive bar. Which do you think would be best? \n Thanks for your help! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1176658,"PostDate":1275983301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies! I have a question for those of you who have been to EPM... Yamina confirmed by reception\/dinner will be held at Agave restaurant. For the cocktail hour I have the Agave terrace or Revive bar. Which do you think would be best? <br \/> Thanks for your help! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4f2880964398fa895ed4084e471eeaa","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;affiwin&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;THope thanks for sharing! Ladies how close to the wedding did you really start working on details with Yamina? Did you get everything sorted out once you arrived or did you start sending her photos? We&#039;re have a pretty large wedding (100 guests) so I&#039;m starting to think it&#039;s about time I get things rolling.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I started emailing Yamina back in December, but that was only really for package options and such. I have been accumulating my questions\/pictures and emailing when I have a bunch or if I need to know so I can start working on a project (ie welcome booklets!) She has been pretty amazing and I meet with her Saturday when we arrive. \n \n Any how, if I were you I would email her pictures and such now, just to see if it is an actual possibility and then finalize everything there! :) \n \n HTH-Jess","Attachments":[],"Id":1176661,"PostDate":1275983490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>affiwin<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">THope thanks for sharing! Ladies how close to the wedding did you really start working on details with Yamina? Did you get everything sorted out once you arrived or did you start sending her photos? We're have a pretty large wedding (100 guests) so I'm starting to think it's about time I get things rolling.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I started emailing Yamina back in December, but that was only really for package options and such. I have been accumulating my questions\/pictures and emailing when I have a bunch or if I need to know so I can start working on a project (ie welcome booklets!) She has been pretty amazing and I meet with her Saturday when we arrive. <br \/> <br \/> Any how, if I were you I would email her pictures and such now, just to see if it is an actual possibility and then finalize everything there! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> HTH-Jess\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abcc2d12a2d5d3479f1d90cd4622a827","RawContent":"Jess - Thanks so much. I have been in touch with Yamina over the months as we were negotiating and finalizing the bigger ticket items with her. Actually just got an email with her today so we&#039;ll start sending her photos and ideas and finalize when we get there. You&#039;re wedding date is coming up fast. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1176741,"PostDate":1275998088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jess - Thanks so much. I have been in touch with Yamina over the months as we were negotiating and finalizing the bigger ticket items with her. Actually just got an email with her today so we'll start sending her photos and ideas and finalize when we get there. You're wedding date is coming up fast. Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40b3dd36d3f01b3ff6ca8926783cf07e","RawContent":"Hey everyone! My fiance and I just chose Excellence Playa Mujeres for our wedding destination for April 2011! After reading all of your posts about the resort we decided it is the perfect place for us. We are confirming our date with Yamina this week!!!!\n \n If any of you have already been married there, any suggestions or advice would be great!","Attachments":[],"Id":1178107,"PostDate":1276065986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone! My fiance and I just chose Excellence Playa Mujeres for our wedding destination for April 2011! After reading all of your posts about the resort we decided it is the perfect place for us. We are confirming our date with Yamina this week!!!!<br \/> <br \/> If any of you have already been married there, any suggestions or advice would be great!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marymobley1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1276033914,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228972.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marymobley","Id":228972,"Name":"marymobley","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":530,"NextPage":540,"PreviousPage":520,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
