{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77424cabbbfd381055033183e2ff389d","RawContent":"We went to EPM about 5-6 months after it opened and fell it love with it. Even at that point we were not engaged but said if we were to get married and do a destination wedding this would be the resort for sure. The water is blue but not as blue as some other beach areas of Mexico. It will still be great for pictures I am sure. \n \n I am getting so excited as it is basically 2 months away!!! I picked up my dress last week and am raring to go. \n \n One thing about this resort I can guarantee is the service. The staff go out of their way to treat everyone special and I know they will make my wedding day one of the best days of my life.","Attachments":[],"Id":1217584,"PostDate":1279224327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We went to EPM about 5-6 months after it opened and fell it love with it. Even at that point we were not engaged but said if we were to get married and do a destination wedding this would be the resort for sure. The water is blue but not as blue as some other beach areas of Mexico. It will still be great for pictures I am sure. <br \/> <br \/> I am getting so excited as it is basically 2 months away!!! I picked up my dress last week and am raring to go. <br \/> <br \/> One thing about this resort I can guarantee is the service. The staff go out of their way to treat everyone special and I know they will make my wedding day one of the best days of my life.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3347d6e869fd62e40943c6adc98d6928","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Snickers&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We went to EPM about 5-6 months after it opened and fell it love with it. Even at that point we were not engaged but said if we were to get married and do a destination wedding this would be the resort for sure. The water is blue but not as blue as some other beach areas of Mexico. It will still be great for pictures I am sure. \n \n I am getting so excited as it is basically 2 months away!!! I picked up my dress last week and am raring to go. \n \n One thing about this resort I can guarantee is the service. The staff go out of their way to treat everyone special and I know they will make my wedding day one of the best days of my life.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Everything I have read has said the service was TOP NOTCH! That&#039;s one of the reasons why I picked it. I am just a little bummed the beach won&#039;t look like a postcard. \n \n You will have to come back and tell us ALL about your wedding when you get back!! \n \n &lt;strong&gt;Speaking of...I want to see everyone&#039;s dresses please post!!&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n Here is mine in Diamond White (left).\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/images\/new-styles\/8526F.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/images\/new-styles\/8526B.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And my reception dress that I will change into...\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.lordandtaylor.com\/_static\/webUpload\/731\/141916_141916_100_6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1217598,"PostDate":1279224972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We went to EPM about 5-6 months after it opened and fell it love with it. Even at that point we were not engaged but said if we were to get married and do a destination wedding this would be the resort for sure. The water is blue but not as blue as some other beach areas of Mexico. It will still be great for pictures I am sure. <br \/> <br \/> I am getting so excited as it is basically 2 months away!!! I picked up my dress last week and am raring to go. <br \/> <br \/> One thing about this resort I can guarantee is the service. The staff go out of their way to treat everyone special and I know they will make my wedding day one of the best days of my life.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Everything I have read has said the service was TOP NOTCH! That's one of the reasons why I picked it. I am just a little bummed the beach won't look like a postcard. <br \/> <br \/> You will have to come back and tell us ALL about your wedding when you get back!! <br \/> <br \/> <strong>Speaking of...I want to see everyone's dresses please post!!<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> Here is mine in Diamond White (left).<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/images\/new-styles\/8526F.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/images\/new-styles\/8526B.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And my reception dress that I will change into...<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.lordandtaylor.com\/_static\/webUpload\/731\/141916_141916_100_6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=