":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"327d81fd5902cf4b44d691b6c929833b","RawContent":"Well, I certainly understand you buying from your friend!! :) \n \n Any other brides that are looking...there is a bridal boutique section as well. Some gorgeous pearl\/gold pieces came out in June and I am stalking the website to see what the new Fall items look like. \n \n If you are going with a beach-ier vibe (like I am) - there are tons of great turquoise pieces as well, several on sale because they are summer only items. \n \n If you have any questions let me know! \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose\"&gt;Sarah Rose - Stella &amp;amp; Dot Stylist&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1218097,"PostDate":1279247606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well, I certainly understand you buying from your friend!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> Any other brides that are looking...there is a bridal boutique section as well. Some gorgeous pearl\/gold pieces came out in June and I am stalking the website to see what the new Fall items look like. <br \/> <br \/> If you are going with a beach-ier vibe (like I am) - there are tons of great turquoise pieces as well, several on sale because they are summer only items. <br \/> <br \/> If you have any questions let me know! <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.stelladot.com\/sarahrose' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sarah Rose - Stella & Dot Stylist<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a0e0b0c858cac7075e06c0d82ea1ba6","RawContent":"PS, great dresses for you both!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1218101,"PostDate":1279247739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                PS, great dresses for you both!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"Curr