 am thinking about getting one for the reception because I want to be able to get my groove on since we are getting a DJ!! Hope you all are doing well. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/jomygoodness.typepad.com\/.a\/6a00e554645f2588340115714fa075970c-500wi\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That is GORGEOUS!! \n \n I have a reception dress for sale if you need one. I got an extra and Jessica McClintock has a funky return policy so I am stuck with it. I got the wrong size.","Attachments":[],"Id":1218696,"PostDate":1279306836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ValerieandBrian2010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey Ladies! I knwo its been awhile since I have been on, but here is my dress! All of your dresses look awesome, I am thinking about getting one for the reception because I want to be able to get my groove on since we are getting a DJ!! Hope you all are doing well. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/jomygoodness.typepad.com\/.a\/6a00e554645f2588340115714fa075970c-500wi\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That is GORGEOUS!! <br \/> <br \/> I have a reception dress for sale if you need one. I got an extra and Jessica McClintock has a funky return policy so I am stuck with it. I got the wrong size.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc70c4d983a71c2eaa87602e788f8904","RawContent":"Do you have a picture of it and what size it is? I am thinking I dont want to do the one shouldar look again at the reception just because that was what I did for the ceremony look. Not sure, I havent really started searching for it yet....","Attachments":[],"Id":1218705,"PostDate":1279307188,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;