eeeks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"184b8d4093be1373bac0dfbe1ce583b1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;affiwin&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;15 more days till the big day and 10 more days before arriving at EPM. Got lots to do but finally getting excited. We&#039;ve got 98 guests coming. Eeeeks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Holy cow!! 98 people!! I WANT FULL DETAILS! Have the time of your life!","Attachments":[],"Id":1219332,"PostDate":1279333446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>affiwin<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">15 more days till the big day and 10 more days before arriving at EPM. Got lots to do but finally getting excited. We've got 98 guests coming. Eeeeks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Holy cow!! 98 people!! I WANT FULL DETAILS! Have the time of your life!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9dba4eacf37bb740556228e86c991a66","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ncarolinadaisy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;It&#039;s a one shoulder dress &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Sorry...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I might be interested...can you post a picture or email it to me: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com\"&gt;rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; - what size is it?\n \n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1220428,"PostDate":1279493077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">It's a one shoulder dress <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Sorry...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I might be interested...can you post a picture or email it to me: <a href='mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com<\/a> - what size is it?<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61ff189caf26c55fde6c72edab3b30ab","RawContent":"Hi Everyone...I&#039;ve been off of here for a couple of months...got sidetracked with everything but wedding planning!!! Now I&#039;m back to getting things done for our wedding in December at EPM...so fun reading through everything I&#039;ve missed over the last couple months!\n \n Thope I loved your pics - you looked absolutely beautiful!!!\n \n Is everyone having their receiption at Spice Restaurant? I really wanted to have ours at the Lobster House \/ Grill...\n Did Yamina make you wait until you picked your receiption site until closer to the wedding? She said I can&#039;t pick mine yet that I have to wait until 2 months or so before the wedding...\n \n Hope you&#039;re all doing well...\n \n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1220434,"PostDate":1279493242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone...I've been off of here for a couple of months...got sidetracked with everything but wedding planning!!! Now I'm back to getting things done for our wedding in December at EPM...so fun reading through everything I've missed over the last couple months!<br \/> <br \/> Thope I loved your pics - you looked absolutely beautiful!!!<br \/> <br \/> Is everyone having their receiption at Spice Restaurant? I really wanted to have ours at the Lobster House \/ Grill...<br \/> Did Yamina make you wait until you picked your receiption site until closer to the wedding? She said I can't pick mine yet that I have to wait until 2 months or so before the wedding...<br \/> <br \/> Hope you're all doing well...<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"T