Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"442d6501c17ec4daa1caef99686b5b8a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ButterflyR12&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Is everyone having their reception at Spice Restaurant? I really wanted to have ours at the Lobster House \/ Grill...\n Did Yamina make you wait until you picked your reception site until closer to the wedding? She said I can&#039;t pick mine yet that I have to wait until 2 months or so before the wedding...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Rebecca, \n Welcome back to the planning action! Yamina said that she can&#039;t confirm the locations until a month ahead of time, but based on their current schedule, I am planning to have my cocktail hour at the X-Lounge (another choice was the Revive Bar) and the reception in either the Spice Restaurant or on the Spice Terrance. She had sent me photos of a few other options, but the minimalism and modern decor of Spice really suited my taste, more so than The Convention Center event terrace or Convention Center foyer. For Spice, Yamina said that when I arrive I could chose between the inside space or the terrace. I was hoping for Chez Isabelle but it&#039;s currently open Sundays...\n \n I&#039;ve heard that every space is stunning... can&#039;t go wrong no matter what!","Attachments":[],"Id":1220696,"PostDate":1279512961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ButterflyR12<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Is everyone having their reception at Spice Restaurant? I really wanted to have ours at the Lobster House \/ Grill...<br \/> Did Yamina make you wait until you picked your reception site until closer to the wedding? She said I can't pick mine yet that I have to wait until 2 months or so before the wedding...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Rebecca, <br \/> Welcome back to the planning action! Yamina said that she can't confirm the locations until a month ahead of time, but based on their current schedule, I am planning to have my cocktail hour at the X-Lounge (another choice was the Revive Bar) and the reception in either the Spice Restaurant or on the Spice Terrance. She had sent me photos of a few other options, but the minimalism and modern decor of Spice really suited my taste, more so than The Convention Center event terrace or Convention Center foyer. For Spice, Yamina said that when I arrive I could chose between the inside space or the terrace. I was hoping for Chez Isabelle but it's currently open Sundays...<br \/> <br \/> I've heard that every space is stunning... can't go wrong no matter what!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"109a4ccecd0f322771c6a78cc971393a","RawContent":"Do you mind forwarding me the pictures that Yamina sent you of the venues? I would love to see the options? Also, did she send you a schedule of when the venues were open &amp;amp; closed? \n \n Thanks!\n My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:valeriefearns@gmail.com\"&gt;valeriefearns@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Valerie","Attachments":[],"Id":1220940,"PostDate":1279557790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do you mind forwarding me the pictures that Yamina sent you of the venues? I would love to see the options? Also, did she send you a schedule of when the venues were open & closed? <br \/> <br \/> Thanks!<br \/> My email is <a href='mailto:valeriefearns@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>valeriefearns@gmail.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Valerie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valeriefearns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1254520310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222240.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValerieandBrian2010","Id":222240,"Name":"ValerieandBrian2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cd8a0bf8238738818b716478a96f5d8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ValerieandBrian2010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Do you mind forwarding me the pictures that Yamina sent you of the venues? I would love to see the options? Also, did she send you a schedule of when the venues were open &amp;amp; closed? \n \n Thanks!\n My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:valeriefearns@gmail.com\"&gt;valeriefearns@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Valerie&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Just sent the photos, please let me know if you don&#039;t get them. I didn&#039;t get a schedule from Yamina on which location was open when, I was just told that on Sunday (my wedding day) Spice\/Spice Terrace was usually closed, so I could use it for a private event. I gathered that one restaurant is closed each day so that&#039;s the space available for you on your wedding date.","Attachments":[],"Id":1221030,"PostDate":1279562077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ValerieandBrian2010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Do you mind forwarding me the pictures that Yamina sent you of the venues? I would love to see the options? Also, did she send you a schedule of when the venues were open & closed? <br \/> <br \/> Thanks!<br \/> My email is <a href='mailto:valeriefearns@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>valeriefearns@gmail.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Valerie<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Just sent the photos, please let me know if you don't get them. I didn't get a schedule from Yamina on which location was open when, I was just told that on Sunday (my wedding day) Spice\/Spice Terrace was usually closed, so I could use it for a private event. I gathered that one restaurant is closed each day so that's the space available for you on your wedding date.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"193a4a47aa7a71cd8617eea1c80f0335","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ButterflyR12&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I might be interested...can you post a picture or email it to me: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com\"&gt;rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; - what size is it?\n \n Rebecca&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I sent you an email with the dress Rebecca. Let me know if you got it. May have gone to your spam since I am not in your addy book.","Attachments":[],"Id":1222276,"PostDate":1279608962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ButterflyR12<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I might be interested...can you post a picture or email it to me: <a href='mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com<\/a> - what size is it?<br \/> <br \/> Rebecca<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I sent you an email with the dress Rebecca. Let me know if you got it. May have gone to your spam since I am not in your addy book.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9df59707b2a7382289785525d18c032","RawContent":"She had sent me photos of a few other options, but the minimalism and modern decor of Spice really suited my taste, more so than The Convention Center event terrace or Convention Center foyer. For Spice, Yamina said that when I arrive I could chose between the inside space or the terrace. I was hoping for Chez Isabelle but it&#039;s currently open Sundays...\n \n I&#039;ve heard that every space is stunning... can&#039;t go wrong no matter what![\/QUOTE]\n \n It&#039;s true every place there is stunning...it&#039;s one of the main reasons we decided to back there to get married after vacationing there last year!!\n \n The only problem is that the one place we didn&#039;t go to wa the Spice Terrace...would you mind sending me the pictures she sent you as well?!?!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com\"&gt;rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thank you!\n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1224085,"PostDate":1279692320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                She had sent me photos of a few other options, but the minimalism and modern decor of Spice really suited my taste, more so than The Convention Center event terrace or Convention Center foyer. For Spice, Yamina said that when I arrive I could chose between the inside space or the terrace. I was hoping for Chez Isabelle but it's currently open Sundays...<br \/> <br \/> I've heard that every space is stunning... can't go wrong no matter what![\/QUOTE]<br \/> <br \/> It's true every place there is stunning...it's one of the main reasons we decided to back there to get married after vacationing there last year!!<br \/> <br \/> The only problem is that the one place we didn't go to wa the Spice Terrace...would you mind sending me the pictures she sent you as well?!?!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thank you!<br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bd37693e69e52cc32abc008578d614b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ButterflyR12&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;It&#039;s true every place there is stunning...it&#039;s one of the main reasons we decided to back there to get married after vacationing there last year!!\n \n The only problem is that the one place we didn&#039;t go to wa the Spice Terrace...would you mind sending me the pictures she sent you as well?!?!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com\"&gt;rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thank you!\n Rebecca&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Rebecca,\n Just emailed you - please let me know if you don&#039;t receive it shortly. Can you please let me (and I&#039;m sure others on here know) why you aren&#039;t interested in Spice? I&#039;ve never been to the resort, so any suggestions\/advice a seasoned traveler can offer would be greatly appreciated. Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1224097,"PostDate":1279693213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ButterflyR12<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">It's true every place there is stunning...it's one of the main reasons we decided to back there to get married after vacationing there last year!!<br \/> <br \/> The only problem is that the one place we didn't go to wa the Spice Terrace...would you mind sending me the pictures she sent you as well?!?!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thank you!<br \/> Rebecca<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Rebecca,<br \/> Just emailed you - please let me know if you don't receive it shortly. Can you please let me (and I'm sure others on here know) why you aren't interested in Spice? I've never been to the resort, so any suggestions\/advice a seasoned traveler can offer would be greatly appreciated. Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3284d7119b5302536b3a81fce4070960","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;HoustonBride10\/31\/10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Rebecca,\n Just emailed you - please let me know if you don&#039;t receive it shortly. Can you please let me (and I&#039;m sure others on here know) why you aren&#039;t interested in Spice? I&#039;ve never been to the resort, so any suggestions\/advice a seasoned traveler can offer would be greatly appreciated. Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Okay - this wedding stuff is making me absolutely CRAZY! So sorry, I didn&#039;t read your post correctly... so glad that you never made it there, instead of disliking the place! Phew!","Attachments":[],"Id":1224100,"PostDate":1279693417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>HoustonBride10\/31\/10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Rebecca,<br \/> Just emailed you - please let me know if you don't receive it shortly. Can you please let me (and I'm sure others on here know) why you aren't interested in Spice? I've never been to the resort, so any suggestions\/advice a seasoned traveler can offer would be greatly appreciated. Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Okay - this wedding stuff is making me absolutely CRAZY! So sorry, I didn't read your post correctly... so glad that you never made it there, instead of disliking the place! Phew!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de416e42bf5a96a2e400a45f4579be5f","RawContent":"Spice Terrace is really nice. We saw it done up for a wedding when we were last there as it is covered and it is a good backup wedding venue. They really did a beautiful job in the decor of it. I am just hoping the rain holds off on my wedding day as I really want my gazebo wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":1225194,"PostDate":1279758983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Spice Terrace is really nice. We saw it done up for a wedding when we were last there as it is covered and it is a good backup wedding venue. They really did a beautiful job in the decor of it. I am just hoping the rain holds off on my wedding day as I really want my gazebo wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72aa3c87ba32773d6c9aa5741fe0ecf3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Snickers&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Spice Terrace is really nice. We saw it done up for a wedding when we were last there as it is covered and it is a good backup wedding venue. They really did a beautiful job in the decor of it. I am just hoping the rain holds off on my wedding day as I really want my gazebo wedding!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Rain is good luck... but I&#039;m hoping to avoid it as well! \n \n When you saw that wedding at Spice Terrace did the wedding party add decor of their own? Is anyone planning to bring anything other than stuff for the table? \n \n I am worried about bugs\/noise\/weather... I want the reception to feel really intimate and personal - I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not doing separate tables for the dinner, for example, putting us all together at one long one for that reason. Do you think that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s achievable in that spot? \n \n Did you ever have a problem with the bugs? I have horrible reactions to mosquitoes (bites blow up into huge welts... UGLY), and bug spray and my wedding day don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t really go together!","Attachments":[],"Id":1225239,"PostDate":1279760392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Spice Terrace is really nice. We saw it done up for a wedding when we were last there as it is covered and it is a good backup wedding venue. They really did a beautiful job in the decor of it. I am just hoping the rain holds off on my wedding day as I really want my gazebo wedding!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Rain is good luck... but I'm hoping to avoid it as well! <br \/> <br \/> When you saw that wedding at Spice Terrace did the wedding party add decor of their own? Is anyone planning to bring anything other than stuff for the table? <br \/> <br \/> I am worried about bugs\/noise\/weather... I want the reception to feel really intimate and personal - I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not doing separate tables for the dinner, for example, putting us all together at one long one for that reason. Do you think that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s achievable in that spot? <br \/> <br \/> Did you ever have a problem with the bugs? I have horrible reactions to mosquitoes (bites blow up into huge welts... UGLY), and bug spray and my wedding day don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t really go together!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c6ae3560c6a2777b631c48380878721","RawContent":"I believe the decor was that of the hotel. We will be doing a long table as well and that terrace is huge by the way so no problems there. I don&#039;t think noise would be an issue as well due to the way it faces.\n \n I never got bit when we went. If you don&#039;t want to wear repellant, which I won&#039;t be doing either, pin a dryer sheet on you somewhere as that keeps the buggies away!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1225358,"PostDate":1279764700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I believe the decor was that of the hotel. We will be doing a long table as well and that terrace is huge by the way so no problems there. I don't think noise would be an issue as well due to the way it faces.<br \/> <br \/> I never got bit when we went. If you don't want to wear repellant, which I won't be doing either, pin a dryer sheet on you somewhere as that keeps the buggies away!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":640,"NextPage":650,"PreviousPage":630,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
