> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71c80eb30a163c1218afe22d314cfed1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Snickers&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I believe the decor was that of the hotel. We will be doing a long table as well and that terrace is huge by the way so no problems there. I don&#039;t think noise would be an issue as well due to the way it faces.\n \n I never got bit when we went. If you don&#039;t want to wear repellant, which I won&#039;t be doing either, pin a dryer sheet on you somewhere as that keeps the buggies away!!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Great suggestion -- that works? I&#039;ll throw one inside of my dress somewhere!","Attachments":[],"Id":1225374,"PostDate":1279765290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I believe the decor was that of the hotel. We will be doing a long table as well and that terrace is huge by the way so no problems there. I don't think noise would be an issue as well due to the way it faces.<br \/> <br \/> I never got bit when we went. If you don't want to wear repellant, which I won't be doing either, pin a dryer sheet on you somewhere as that keeps the buggies away!!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Great suggestion -- that works? I'll throw one inside of my dress somewhere!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6711ebf3c3458c60532abd3a4ea5047","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;HoustonBride10\/31\/10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Okay - this wedding stuff is making me absolutely CRAZY! So sorry, I didn&#039;t read your post correctly... so glad that you never made it there, instead of disliking the place! Phew!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ha ha...Yes no worries it&#039;s not that I didn&#039;t like it...just for some reason we didn&#039;t get a chance to get to Spice. I think it&#039;s because the Lobster house was so amazing that we ate there as often as we could!\n \n We didn&#039;t have any problems with bugs...in fact we didn&#039;t even see one mesquito. Although we were there in March so I&#039;m not sure about other times of the year...\n \n Has anyone received quotes from the DJ? I&#039;m not sure how much he is, or the lighted dance floor (which I love) - I&#039;d love it if anyone can help show me the DJ prices...\n \n Thank you!!\n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1227321,"PostDate":1279862241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>HoustonBride10\/31\/10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Okay - this wedding stuff is making me absolutely CRAZY! So sorry, I didn't read your post correctly... so glad that you never made it there, instead of disliking the place! Phew!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ha ha...Yes no worries it's not that I didn't like it...just for some reason we didn't get a chance to get to Spice. I think it's because the Lobster house was so amazing that we ate there as often as we could!<br \/> <br \/> We didn't have any problems with bugs...in fact we didn't even see one mesquito. Although we were there in March so I'm not sure about other times of the year...<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone received quotes from the DJ? I'm not sure how much he is, or the lighted dance floor (which I love) - I'd love it if anyone can help show me the DJ prices...<br \/> <br \/> Thank you!!<br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72a9cee7365191190cf5011002fb4182","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ncarolinadaisy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Holy cow!! 98 people!! I WANT FULL DETAILS! Have the time of your life!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yes 98 from as far as Australia and Abu Dhabi. I&#039;ve been stressed out and panicking like mad. Only just sorted our rings today. Geez! We rented out the the villa next to the EPM for the ceremony and reception, but the welcome dinner and other activities will be a the EPM. We were there for Xmas and met with Yamina, she&#039;s so fab and so is the resort. Didn&#039;t want to leave! I will be meeting her early next week to sort out details, details. I&#039;ll provide a full run down when I get back. Days to go. Yikes!","Attachments":[],"Id":1227550,"PostDate":1279871830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Holy cow!! 98 people!! I WANT FULL DETAILS! Have the time of your life!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yes 98 from as far as Australia and Abu Dhabi. I've been stressed out and panicking like mad. Only just sorted our rings today. Geez! We rented out the the villa next to the EPM for the ceremony and reception, but the welcome dinner and other activities will be a the EPM. We were there for Xmas and met with Yamina, she's so fab and so is the resort. Didn't want to leave! I will be meeting her early next week to sort out details, details. I'll provide a full run down when I get back. Days to go. Yikes!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05d8617e43a462f93e2993a336315d29","RawContent":"Hi Rebecca-\n \n We are going with DJ Mannia for our wedding. He is the &amp;quot;in house&amp;quot; DJ at EPM. Yamina qouted me $930 for 4 hours of service, microphones, MC, and lights. We are also getting the light up dance floor and she qouted me $550. I also orginally asked about using DJ Doremixx (heard about him on this forum) but Yamins kept saying she cant confirm his services and that I would need to pay for him and any assistants he brings...which could be an extra $200 on top of their service fee. So, I read good reviews about DJ Mannia and I will just be giving him a HUGE list of DNPs (Do Not Plays) and Must Play songs. I am also meeting with him when I get down to the resort prior to the wedding. \n \n Hope this helps! \n Valerie","Attachments":[],"Id":1227780,"PostDate":1279904467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Rebecca-<br \/> <br \/> We are going with DJ Mannia for our wedding. He is the \"in house\" DJ at EPM. Yamina qouted me $930 for 4 hours of service, microphones, MC, and lights. We are also getting the light up dance floor and she qouted me $550. I also orginally asked about using DJ Doremixx (heard about him on this forum) but Yamins kept saying she cant confirm his services and that I would need to pay for him and any assistants he brings...which could be an extra $200 on top of their service fee. So, I read good reviews about DJ Mannia and I will just be giving him a HUGE list of DNPs (Do Not Plays) and Must Play songs. I am also meeting with him when I get down to the resort prior to the wedding. <br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps! <br \/> Valerie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valeriefearns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1254520310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222240.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValerieandBrian2010","Id":222240,"Name":"ValerieandBrian2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab1c4ba07121efba0c4a2d87bbc176e8","RawContent":"Wow! I&#039;ll be lucky to have 20 people show up! Our was so last minute though. Invites have not even gone out yet and I am 3 months away!","Attachments":[],"Id":1227908,"PostDate":1279909909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow! I'll be lucky to have 20 people show up! Our was so last minute though. Invites have not even gone out yet and I am 3 months away!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfba7f62b0e0e74e9165ad23ce9a1b2f","RawContent":"For any of you ladies that have been there (or for anyone who has paid more attention to the info online)...\n \n Are any of the resort bars fun, party, dance-y bars? I am just wondering what we are going to do after dinner, etc. the wedding night. We are just doing an a la carte cocktail hour and then I was going to make a reservation for the group for dinner (we will only have about 15 people)...then what?","Attachments":[],"Id":1229337,"PostDate":1279989501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For any of you ladies that have been there (or for anyone who has paid more attention to the info online)...<br \/> <br \/> Are any of the resort bars fun, party, dance-y bars? I am just wondering what we are going to do after dinner, etc. the wedding night. We are just doing an a la carte cocktail hour and then I was going to make a reservation for the group for dinner (we will only have about 15 people)...then what?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10a6a3300161755db1b5c7ae68857b6c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;scrose&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;For any of you ladies that have been there (or for anyone who has paid more attention to the info online)...\n \n Are any of the resort bars fun, party, dance-y bars? I am just wondering what we are going to do after dinner, etc. the wedding night. We are just doing an a la carte cocktail hour and then I was going to make a reservation for the group for dinner (we will only have about 15 people)...then what?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I am doing the same thing! I will only have about 20 or so. What day are you getting married? I am getting married on a Thursday and I know that is the night of the Michael Jackson show! Everyone raves about it on Trip Advisor ( if you are into that sort of thing). \n \n I know there is also a piano bar and one other club. Maybe you should email Yamina and see what the entertainment schedule looks like?","Attachments":[],"Id":1229350,"PostDate":1279992281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>scrose<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">For any of you ladies that have been there (or for anyone who has paid more attention to the info online)...<br \/> <br \/> Are any of the resort bars fun, party, dance-y bars? I am just wondering what we are going to do after dinner, etc. the wedding night. We are just doing an a la carte cocktail hour and then I was going to make a reservation for the group for dinner (we will only have about 15 people)...then what?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am doing the same thing! I will only have about 20 or so. What day are you getting married? I am getting married on a Thursday and I know that is the night of the Michael Jackson show! Everyone raves about it on Trip Advisor ( if you are into that sort of thing). <br \/> <br \/> I know there is also a piano bar and one other club. Maybe you should email Yamina and see what the entertainment schedule looks like?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignatu