{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44a43d268e097efdf6638ec40ffd9d9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, we are considering EPM for our wedding in Aug 2011, can anyone&amp;nbsp;send me pics of the reception areas?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If anyone&amp;nbsp;has any&amp;nbsp;cocktail options or dinner option menus please send them my way&amp;nbsp;that would be great...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are trying to decide which hotel works best for us...its so stressful...thank you so much, I am new to this site....happy planning everyone!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you in advance!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lisa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1243430,"PostDate":1280956915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, we are considering EPM for our wedding in Aug 2011, can anyone\u00a0send me pics of the reception areas?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If anyone\u00a0has any\u00a0cocktail options or dinner option menus please send them my way\u00a0that would be great...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are trying to decide which hotel works best for us...its so stressful...thank you so much, I am new to this site....happy planning everyone!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you in advance!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Lisa<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bae72c4accdc382a8b83aea0a178d2ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are seriously considering EPM for our destination wedding next August 2011.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are waiting on our travel agent for pricing and then probably going to book it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I called the hotel and emailed them and waiting for them to send me information, it seems that everyone has trouble corresponding with them.  Is this what I should expect during the whole process?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please if anyone has any pictures of reception areas, flowers, etc. or menus from the Excellence Playa Mujeres, please send them my way.&amp;nbsp; I am new to this website and still trying to figure out how to navigate it. lol&amp;nbsp; I posted something yesterday but forgot to put my email.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:lmarsetti@hotmail.com\"&gt;lmarsetti@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much in advance and Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lisa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1243959,"PostDate":1281015212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are seriously considering EPM for our destination wedding next August 2011.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are waiting on our travel agent for pricing and then probably going to book it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I called the hotel and emailed them and waiting for them to send me information, it seems that everyone has trouble corresponding with them.\u00a0\u00a0Is this what I should expect during the whole process?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please if anyone has any pictures of reception areas, flowers, etc. or menus from the Excellence Playa Mujeres, please send them my way.\u00a0 I am new to this website and still trying to figure out how to navigate it. lol\u00a0 I posted something yesterday but forgot to put my email.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='mailto:lmarsetti@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>lmarsetti@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much in advance and Happy Planning!<\/p> <p> Lisa<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8541f2eb607583fb91dc5189c446d7d0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Lisa:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You will LOVE EPM!!!! The service is amazing, very romantic.&amp;nbsp; We were there in August of &#039;09, that is were we got engaged, so I was able to check out everything in case we came back to get married there.&amp;nbsp; We will be married there on 9.3.10, it was so great, we just had to get married there. Yamina is the Wedding Coordinator and she is amazing, I can not wait to meet her in person. I have emailed her so many times during the planning and she normally emails me back that evening, if not, the next day.&amp;nbsp; I have never had an issue and I have been in contact with her since Nov &#039;09. So do not worry, she has made the planning so easy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have most of the things you were asking about, so I will email them to your email above. Also, if you don&#039;t see anything you like, they will do what ever you want, they just need a picture to go by.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope this helps you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Smiles,\n Shanna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1244347,"PostDate":1281031704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Lisa:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You will LOVE EPM!!!! The service is amazing, very romantic.\u00a0 We were there in August of '09, that is were we got engaged, so I was able to check out everything in case we came back to get married there.\u00a0 We will be married there on 9.3.10, it was so great, we just had to get married there. Yamina is the Wedding Coordinator and she is amazing, I can not wait to meet her in person. I have emailed her so many times during the planning and she normally emails me back that evening, if not, the next day.\u00a0 I have never had an issue and I have been in contact with her since Nov '09. So do not worry, she has made the planning so easy.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have most of the things you were asking about, so I will email them to your email above. Also, if you don't see anything you like, they will do what ever you want, they just need a picture to go by.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this helps you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"882c50d514f678deac20daef016e2227","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Shanna,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You were very helpful!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lisa :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1244392,"PostDate":1281034107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Shanna,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You were very helpful!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Lisa :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e1cd9b34e0bc822b03d02e6dea05599","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies - Just got back from Playa and we had an absolutely amazing time. Yamina is the absolute best and you have NOTHING to worry about. She is a professional in every respect and she loves what she does so no need to stress about anything. We had over 80 guests and although we held most activities at the EPM we had our wedding ceremony and reception at the Villa next door. I&#039;ll try to write a review soon. In the meantime, all the best with your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1244547,"PostDate":1281041671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies - Just got back from Playa and we had an absolutely amazing time. Yamina is the absolute best and you have NOTHING to worry about. She is a professional in every respect and she loves what she does so no need to stress about anything. We had over 80 guests and although we held most activities at the EPM we had our wedding ceremony and reception at the Villa next door. I'll try to write a review soon. In the meantime, all the best with your planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcd96f091240ccb25a8c61401b4b313a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]affiwin[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Ladies - Just got back from Playa and we had an absolutely amazing time. Yamina is the absolute best and you have NOTHING to worry about. She is a professional in every respect and she loves what she does so no need to stress about anything. We had over 80 guests and although we held most activities at the EPM we had our wedding ceremony and reception at the Villa next door. I&#039;ll try to write a review soon. In the meantime, all the best with your planning![\/quote] \n \n \n Sounds awesome! Congratulations!!  Cant wait for your review and pics! \n Thanks for the info about Yamina, looking forward to booking my wedding at EPM.. \n \n Lisa","Attachments":[],"Id":1244905,"PostDate":1281100304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>affiwin<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Ladies - Just got back from Playa and we had an absolutely amazing time. Yamina is the absolute best and you have NOTHING to worry about. She is a professional in every respect and she loves what she does so no need to stress about anything. We had over 80 guests and although we held most activities at the EPM we had our wedding ceremony and reception at the Villa next door. I'll try to write a review soon. In the meantime, all the best with your planning!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Sounds awesome! Congratulations!!\u00a0 Cant wait for your review and pics!<\/p> <p> Thanks for the info about Yamina, looking forward to booking my wedding at EPM..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Lisa<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a46781d15f03327ea4541edfa175f1cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi there my name is Mike, hope you don&#039;t mind a guy in here!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyways I stumbled across this great thread and it helped us decide that we should get married at EPM next year, we couldn&#039;t choose between this and SMB.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have a few questions if you could help me with?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re from the UK so it will just be the two of us due to the costs involved so the basic wedding package is fine for us with maybe just a few extras.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We thought we might as well get a better room and get the wedding for free but we cant decide what room to go for.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s basically between the rooftop terrace or the club junior suite.&amp;nbsp; Can any of you who have been give me your opinions?&amp;nbsp; Is the club package worth it?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, we&#039;re not sure whether to go for the beach option or the gazebo, do any of you have some pics of the two areas, I&#039;ve found a few on the website but it&#039;s hard to get a proper feel of the area.&amp;nbsp; We were also a bit worried about how private they are, do a lot of other guests intrude?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; thanks in advance I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll have a lot more questions!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mike&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1245096,"PostDate":1281108679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi there my name is Mike, hope you don't mind a guy in here!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyways I stumbled across this great thread and it helped us decide that we should get married at EPM next year, we couldn't choose between this and SMB.<\/p> <p> I have a few questions if you could help me with?<\/p> <p> We're from the UK so it will just be the two of us due to the costs involved so the basic wedding package is fine for us with maybe just a few extras.\u00a0<\/p> <p> We thought we might as well get a better room and get the wedding for free but we cant decide what room to go for.\u00a0 It's basically between the rooftop terrace or the club junior suite.\u00a0 Can any of you who have been give me your opinions?\u00a0 Is the club package worth it?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, we're not sure whether to go for the beach option or the gazebo, do any of you have some pics of the two areas, I've found a few on the website but it's hard to get a proper feel of the area.\u00a0 We were also a bit worried about how private they are, do a lot of other guests intrude?<\/p> <p> thanks in advance I'm sure I'll have a lot more questions!<\/p> <p> Mike<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mikey1armstrong@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275490225,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228773.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikey1armstrong","Id":228773,"Name":"mikey1armstrong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99b8cc6da6a390d12627083a0900f2de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Personally I would go for the rooftop terrace depending on when you are going.&amp;nbsp; They are installing heaters for the winter months.&amp;nbsp; We chose this room option for our wedding trip this Sept.&amp;nbsp; Club is nice but not really worth it to me and I have done it before.&amp;nbsp; Remember you&amp;nbsp;are still getting the same room as&amp;nbsp;everyone but with just some extra perks.&amp;nbsp; The booze in your room ( you can order room service and have glasses of this delivered),&amp;nbsp;a few extra things on the room service menu( not that many more), nicer toiletries (the regular ones are really nice anyways),&amp;nbsp;club access (snacks during&amp;nbsp;the day and use of computer (you will&amp;nbsp;never go hungry at this resort with 24hr room service and the 8 restaurant options,&amp;nbsp;plus extra food down by the beach)(they have other computers for everyone else to use too and we have never had a&amp;nbsp;problem waiting hours for them).&amp;nbsp; The only upside that they just started policing on was a seperate pool area and beach area but really it is next door and you don&#039;t really get that much better service there then the regular people.   You are treated like a king and queen no matter if you are club or not, so no worries there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For great pictures I would go to tripadvisor as you really get what real people&#039;s pictures look like.&amp;nbsp; The gazebo is at the far end of the property.&amp;nbsp; I chose this option as I wanted overhead coverage for my guests in the heat.&amp;nbsp; The beach area would be fine too, but you might have a few people walk by.&amp;nbsp; The gazebo is very private on the otherhand I found.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats and I hope I helped somewhat in making your decision easier.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1245342,"PostDate":1281118493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Personally I would go for the rooftop terrace depending on when you are going.\u00a0 They are installing heaters for the winter months.\u00a0 We chose this room option for our wedding trip this Sept.\u00a0 Club is nice but not really worth it to me and I have done it before.\u00a0 Remember you\u00a0are still getting the same room as\u00a0everyone but with just some extra perks.\u00a0 The booze in your room ( you can order room service and have glasses of this delivered),\u00a0a few extra things on the room service menu( not that many more), nicer toiletries (the regular ones are really nice anyways),\u00a0club access (snacks during\u00a0the day and use of computer (you will\u00a0never go hungry at this resort with 24hr room service and the 8 restaurant options,\u00a0plus extra food down by the beach)(they have other computers for everyone else to use too and we have never had a\u00a0problem waiting hours for them).\u00a0 The only upside that they just started policing on was a seperate pool area and beach area but really it is next door and you don't really get that much better service there then the regular people.\u00a0\u00a0 You are treated like a king and queen no matter if you are club or not, so no worries there.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For great pictures I would go to tripadvisor as you really get what real people's pictures look like.\u00a0 The gazebo is at the far end of the property.\u00a0 I chose this option as I wanted overhead coverage for my guests in the heat.\u00a0 The beach area would be fine too, but you might have a few people walk by.\u00a0 The gazebo is very private on the otherhand I found.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats and I hope I helped somewhat in making your decision easier.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b63bcff1f626f4c839de2b7da8f1d0f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; New to the site :)&amp;nbsp; Getting married at EPM on November 13th and I am so excited.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I cant wait to find out where the reception will be though....we have 42 people so far!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope everyone else&#039;s plans are going well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1245347,"PostDate":1281118710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> New to the site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Getting married at EPM on November 13th and I am so excited.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I cant wait to find out where the reception will be though....we have 42 people so far!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope everyone else's plans are going well.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marseydoo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281111441,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231093.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarlaBride12","Id":231093,"Name":"MarlaBride12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e91e5d9ed6ed1be9c0335aa89010ac2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; On a side note for anyone wanting a super lengthy review on the hotel property and what it has to offer with pictures.. Go to Tripadvisor and seek out a gentleman who posts under the name Flipflopman.&amp;nbsp; He has travelled extensively to many resorts and favors Excellence Group.&amp;nbsp; He usually goes at least 3 times a year and reviews each time.&amp;nbsp; His reviews are very detailed and his pictures are just the same.&amp;nbsp; He has it in&amp;nbsp;with the management very good and gets all the details prior to any release to the public it seems such as if there is going to be a new restaurant being added (which there is at the end of the year (Indian food).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1245349,"PostDate":1281118821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> On a side note for anyone wanting a super lengthy review on the hotel property and what it has to offer with pictures.. Go to Tripadvisor and seek out a gentleman who posts under the name Flipflopman.\u00a0 He has travelled extensively to many resorts and favors Excellence Group.\u00a0 He usually goes at least 3 times a year and reviews each time.\u00a0 His reviews are very detailed and his pictures are just the same.\u00a0 He has it in\u00a0with the management very good and gets all the details prior to any release to the public it seems such as if there is going to be a new restaurant being added (which there is at the end of the year (Indian food).<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":670,"NextPage":680,"PreviousPage":660,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
