> Time: 1453779256 / Tue, 26 Jan 2016 03:34:16 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=27268&start=680&SessionId=5044e21e2f320ff3d39914aabcaed5fc
> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"259f28a0ab69a1445b78923f4c4ff189","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; OMG ladies I&#039;ve just spent half of my day reading through all these posts! I stumbled upon this site a few times before when my fiance and me were less focused EPM. My fiance and I are planning a destination wedding in August 2011!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For some reason our travel agent really really discouraged us from booking the EPM and never really gave us that strong of reason why. Mostly she just said that it was quite the party scene and that their has been problems with rowdy guests in the past.... has anyone else heard this or had similar problems with their TA?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We really love the EPM so were trying to make it work! It&#039;s a great site and this forum is exactly what every destination bride needs. I have a few questions for you ladies though, does can anybody email me pictures of the various reception areas at the EPM? I can&#039;t seem to open the links to a lot of the pictures i guess it&#039;s because i&#039;m still new. My email is Cohen2be@gmail.com If anyone has pics of cakes and flowers, I&#039;d love to see those too.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also thought I saw a schedule for the resturants on an old post but now that I&#039;m looking for it i can&#039;t find it anywhere. Does anyone have a copy or know what days which resturants are closed?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks ladies, merry planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1246961,"PostDate":1281327267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> OMG ladies I've just spent half of my day reading through all these posts! I stumbled upon this site a few times before when my fiance and me were less focused EPM. My fiance and I are planning a destination wedding in August 2011!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For some reason our travel agent really really discouraged us from booking the EPM and never really gave us that strong of reason why. Mostly she just said that it was quite the party scene and that their has been problems with rowdy guests in the past.... has anyone else heard this or had similar problems with their TA?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We really love the EPM so were trying to make it work! It's a great site and this forum is exactly what every destination bride needs. I have a few questions for you ladies though, does can anybody email me pictures of the various reception areas at the EPM? I can't seem to open the links to a lot of the pictures i guess it's because i'm still new. My email is Cohen2be@gmail.com If anyone has pics of cakes and flowers, I'd love to see those too.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also thought I saw a schedule for the resturants on an old post but now that I'm looking for it i can't find it anywhere. Does anyone have a copy or know what days which resturants are closed?<\/p> <p> Thanks ladies, merry planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cohen2be@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281318074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231157.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":108,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cohen2be","Id":231157,"Name":"cohen2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad49341eddb2fbb03f2c73194a0ca71c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for the replies Snickers they were a great help :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1247043,"PostDate":1281355992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for the replies Snickers they were a great help :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mikey1armstrong@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275490225,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228773.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikey1armstrong","Id":228773,"Name":"mikey1armstrong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26aeef441c0ef1701e9c6c081abb4e55","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cohen2be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n OMG ladies I&#039;ve just spent half of my day reading through all these posts! I stumbled upon this site a few times before when my fiance and me were less focused EPM. My fiance and I are planning a destination wedding in August 2011! \n \n For some reason our travel agent really really discouraged us from booking the EPM and never really gave us that strong of reason why. Mostly she just said that it was quite the party scene and that their has been problems with rowdy guests in the past.... has anyone else heard this or had similar problems with their TA? \n \n We really love the EPM so were trying to make it work! It&#039;s a great site and this forum is exactly what every destination bride needs. I have a few questions for you ladies though, does can anybody email me pictures of the various reception areas at the EPM? I can&#039;t seem to open the links to a lot of the pictures i guess it&#039;s because i&#039;m still new. My email is Cohen2be@gmail.com If anyone has pics of cakes and flowers, I&#039;d love to see those too. \n \n I also thought I saw a schedule for the resturants on an old post but now that I&#039;m looking for it i can&#039;t find it anywhere. Does anyone have a copy or know what days which resturants are closed? \n Thanks ladies, merry planning![\/quote] \n \n Welcome!!  I have actually the opposite as far as a \"party scene\" goes.  If you read through the 1,000&#039;s of reviews on Trip Advisor like I have you will see that almost everyone says that there is hardly any nightlife at all.  Most everyone there are honeymooners or people celebrating anniversaries.  It&#039;s not the type of place you will find spring breakers.  It&#039;s too far away from Cancun.  Two of my best friends just went on their honeymoon last year and also said the same thing.  Everyone drinks by the pool all day in the sun, takes a nap, heads to dinner and by that time you are worn out!!!  Makes sense to me!  \n \n As far as reception places I don&#039;t have pictures of anything but the X-Lounge.  I am trying not to bother Yamina too much with my emails.  She does not let you reserve till about a month or so prior to your wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1247740,"PostDate":1281384588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cohen2be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> OMG ladies I've just spent half of my day reading through all these posts! I stumbled upon this site a few times before when my fiance and me were less focused EPM. My fiance and I are planning a destination wedding in August 2011!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For some reason our travel agent really really discouraged us from booking the EPM and never really gave us that strong of reason why. Mostly she just said that it was quite the party scene and that their has been problems with rowdy guests in the past.... has anyone else heard this or had similar problems with their TA?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We really love the EPM so were trying to make it work! It's a great site and this forum is exactly what every destination bride needs. I have a few questions for you ladies though, does can anybody email me pictures of the various reception areas at the EPM? I can't seem to open the links to a lot of the pictures i guess it's because i'm still new. My email is Cohen2be@gmail.com If anyone has pics of cakes and flowers, I'd love to see those too.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also thought I saw a schedule for the resturants on an old post but now that I'm looking for it i can't find it anywhere. Does anyone have a copy or know what days which resturants are closed?<\/p> <p> Thanks ladies, merry planning!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Welcome!!\u00a0 I have actually the opposite as far as a \"party scene\" goes.\u00a0 If you read through the 1,000's of reviews on Trip Advisor like I have you will see that almost everyone says that there is hardly any nightlife at all.\u00a0 Most everyone there are honeymooners or people celebrating anniversaries.\u00a0 It's not the type of place you will find spring breakers.\u00a0 It's too far away from Cancun.\u00a0 Two of my best friends just went on their honeymoon last year and also said the same thing.\u00a0 Everyone drinks by the pool all day in the sun, takes a nap, heads to dinner and by that time you are worn out!!!\u00a0 Makes sense to me!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as reception places I don't have pictures of anything but the X-Lounge.\u00a0 I am trying not to bother Yamina too much with my emails.\u00a0 She does not let you reserve till about a month or so prior to your wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61cf9d3d62de32eef68e8f60a6aa9adc","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Snickers[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n On a side note for anyone wanting a super lengthy review on the hotel property and what it has to offer with pictures.. Go to Tripadvisor and seek out a gentleman who posts under the name Flipflopman.  He has travelled extensively to many resorts and favors Excellence Group.  He usually goes at least 3 times a year and reviews each time.  His reviews are very detailed and his pictures are just the same.  He has it in with the management very good and gets all the details prior to any release to the public it seems such as if there is going to be a new restaurant being added (which there is at the end of the year (Indian food).[\/quote] \n \n \n Wow!! Thank you so much for your information on FlipFlopman...I&#039;m still going through his reviews but they are full of information, and even though I&#039;ve already been to EPM there&#039;s still a lot of useful information. \n I also really liked how they have a \"LIVE at EPM\" there people who are there write \/ review while they are there! Can&#039;t wait to keep reading his reviews! \n \n Thanks again! \n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1248061,"PostDate":1281403576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> On a side note for anyone wanting a super lengthy review on the hotel property and what it has to offer with pictures.. Go to Tripadvisor and seek out a gentleman who posts under the name Flipflopman.\u00a0 He has travelled extensively to many resorts and favors Excellence Group.\u00a0 He usually goes at least 3 times a year and reviews each time.\u00a0 His reviews are very detailed and his pictures are just the same.\u00a0 He has it in\u00a0with the management very good and gets all the details prior to any release to the public it seems such as if there is going to be a new restaurant being added (which there is at the end of the year (Indian food).<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> Wow!! Thank you so much for your information on FlipFlopman...I'm still going through his reviews but they are full of information, and even though I've already been to EPM there's still a lot of useful information.<\/p> <p> I also really liked how they have a \"LIVE at EPM\" there people who are there write \/ review while they are there! Can't wait to keep reading his reviews!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again!<\/p> <p> Rebecca<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73dd25e5a5368004f666ed5fd29b4e5e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I didn&#039;t have any problems whatsoever with there being too much of a &amp;quot;party scene&amp;quot; although I did see 2-3 topless, older European women soaking up the sun :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My dad was a little turned off my some canoodling by the pool - but come on, the place was SO romantic (and besides, I had too many other things to look at to really notice).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;really sorry&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; about anyone who has messaged me questions and requests for info - I was locked from my email account for a few months :(&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If anyone needs anything - please ask - I still have every tidbit of miscellaneous info that I gathered up before I got married last year (although I still cry when I look at any of the lists, pictures, forms, etc that I have - they all bring back such awesome memories!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My husband and I have booked a room at EPM to celebrate our 1 year anniversary next month (I swore I wouldn&#039;t be one of &amp;quot;those&amp;quot; people, but having been to Mexico a few times, I just don&#039;&#039;t want to take a chance and be disappointed on where I stay).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The swim-up rooms were just as cool to us as the suites with the private dip-pool upstairs (we split our 11 day stay into two rooms - one pre-wedding and one post-wedding) . Although I enjoyed upgrading to the &amp;quot;Excellence&amp;quot; club, it was really only because they have a special concierge-lobby area that had a little buffet of hors d&#039;oevres that you could walk in and grab a plate anytime without putting on clothes and sitting down and stuff (just lazy I guess).&amp;nbsp; We won&#039;t be upgrading this time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Word of advice, though, if you take a day-trip to Isla Mujares - be very careful!! They drive ridiculously and our experience was horrible; we totally felt like we were being harrassed or hustled.&amp;nbsp; On the other hand - downtown Cancun is really cool (as long as you don&#039;t mind saying &amp;quot;No thank you&amp;quot; every 2 minutes - which I don&#039;t) and make sure you try a homemade &amp;quot;michelada&amp;quot;! YUM!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats Everyone :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1248782,"PostDate":1281464451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I didn't have any problems whatsoever with there being too much of a \"party scene\" although I did see 2-3 topless, older European women soaking up the sun <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My dad was a little turned off my some canoodling by the pool - but come on, the place was SO romantic (and besides, I had too many other things to look at to really notice).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am <strong><em>really sorry<\/em><\/strong> about anyone who has messaged me questions and requests for info - I was locked from my email account for a few months <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If anyone needs anything - please ask - I still have every tidbit of miscellaneous info that I gathered up before I got married last year (although I still cry when I look at any of the lists, pictures, forms, etc that I have - they all bring back such awesome memories!)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My husband and I have booked a room at EPM to celebrate our 1 year anniversary next month (I swore I wouldn't be one of \"those\" people, but having been to Mexico a few times, I just don''t want to take a chance and be disappointed on where I stay).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The swim-up rooms were just as cool to us as the suites with the private dip-pool upstairs (we split our 11 day stay into two rooms - one pre-wedding and one post-wedding) . Although I enjoyed upgrading to the \"Excellence\" club, it was really only because they have a special concierge-lobby area that had a little buffet of hors d'oevres that you could walk in and grab a plate anytime without putting on clothes and sitting down and stuff (just lazy I guess).\u00a0 We won't be upgrading this time.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Word of advice, though, if you take a day-trip to Isla Mujares - be very careful!! They drive ridiculously and our experience was horrible; we totally felt like we were being harrassed or hustled.\u00a0 On the other hand - downtown Cancun is really cool (as long as you don't mind saying \"No thank you\" every 2 minutes - which I don't) and make sure you try a homemade \"michelada\"! YUM!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats Everyone <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfa0468bb086ecb7569a2001ed2e5351","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anybody know where at Excellence Playa Mujeres is a good spot for the reception? My fiance Joel and I are getting married November 4, 2010 and we would like to have an outdoors reception for about 30-35 people...any ideas from past brides or brides-to-be?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1249601,"PostDate":1281499191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anybody know where at Excellence Playa Mujeres is a good spot for the reception? My fiance Joel and I are getting married November 4, 2010 and we would like to have an outdoors reception for about 30-35 people...any ideas from past brides or brides-to-be?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akiselick07@alumni.uwosh.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281498905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231239.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kisela88","Id":231239,"Name":"kisela88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d73293d9106bd70e441be9a89f211f68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey girls,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What are you doing for the music for the ceremony? We would like to hire a violinist, but it&#039;s expensive. We were thinking of creating our own playlist, but I&#039;m not sure how that would work. Any ideas or advice?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mindy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1252250,"PostDate":1281661893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey girls,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you doing for the music for the ceremony? We would like to hire a violinist, but it's expensive. We were thinking of creating our own playlist, but I'm not sure how that would work. Any ideas or advice?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks,<\/p> <p> Mindy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de8649f189161b9bb67991d49be2f06a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was just going to bring an ipod with a designated playlist for ceremony and one for cocktail hour. &amp;nbsp;All the musicians for hire seem a little pricey for a 15 person wedding. &amp;nbsp;:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yamina told me we will have use of a sound system for the actual wedding, and I have heard of several people bringing their own ipod speakers for the cocktail hour or reception. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1252836,"PostDate":1281717604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was just going to bring an ipod with a designated playlist for ceremony and one for cocktail hour. \u00a0All the musicians for hire seem a little pricey for a 15 person wedding. \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yamina told me we will have use of a sound system for the actual wedding, and I have heard of several people bringing their own ipod speakers for the cocktail hour or reception. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91acecb08adf95ca0a362bf7076bb3b3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253610,"PostDate":1281765663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.kenney@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1281315541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231155.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"grandstreet11","Id":231155,"Name":"grandstreet11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8ad313e415fbcd98dcd2476f5d6102c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are trying to get married in May 2011.&amp;nbsp; I just wanted to say thanks for all the info!&amp;nbsp; The last thing - I am really concerned about getting the best rate for my guests.&amp;nbsp; Did you ladies get a discount\/etc for your stay?&amp;nbsp; We were thinking of staying for 14 days.&amp;nbsp; We probably have 30 rooms @ 3 days each for the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for any input!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253611,"PostDate":1281765845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are trying to get married in May 2011.\u00a0 I just wanted to say thanks for all the info!\u00a0 The last thing - I am really concerned about getting the best rate for my guests.\u00a0 Did you ladies get a discount\/etc for your stay?\u00a0 We were thinking of staying for 14 days.\u00a0 We probably have 30 rooms @ 3 days each for the wedding.\u00a0 Thanks for any input!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.kenney@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1281315541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231155.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"grandstreet11","Id":231155,"Name":"grandstreet11","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":680,"NextPage":690,"PreviousPage":670,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
