{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe2f27dc1d7ab1992f818131a84b0746","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oops repost.&amp;nbsp; Deleted.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1253696,"PostDate":1281796840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oops repost.\u00a0 Deleted.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.kenney@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1281315541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231155.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"grandstreet11","Id":231155,"Name":"grandstreet11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a31a142740536c986473d7d41f4dd95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are getting married on 12\/10\/10 and I was having the same issue about ceremony music. We don&#039;t want to spend too much extra money if we don&#039;t have to. I emailed Yamina about if we could provide our own music\/playlist. She said that we could bring a pre-mixed CD or ipod and they will provid the sound system for us. The only thing I am still unsure about is who will be manning the sound system during the cermony to que the right songs. I plan on sending her another email to get some more details. I hopes this helps to answer your question.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1254480,"PostDate":1281920455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are getting married on 12\/10\/10 and I was having the same issue about ceremony music. We don't want to spend too much extra money if we don't have to. I emailed Yamina about if we could provide our own music\/playlist. She said that we could bring a pre-mixed CD or ipod and they will provid the sound system for us. The only thing I am still unsure about is who will be manning the sound system during the cermony to que the right songs. I plan on sending her another email to get some more details. I hopes this helps to answer your question.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"181bb6b25aada97dcae48314181c4de0","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are getting married on 12\/10\/10 and I was having the same issue about ceremony music. We don&#039;t want to spend too much extra money if we don&#039;t have to. I emailed Yamina about if we could provide our own music\/playlist. She said that we could bring a pre-mixed CD or ipod and they will provid the sound system for us. The only thing I am still unsure about is who will be manning the sound system during the cermony to que the right songs. I plan on sending her another email to get some more details. I hopes this helps to answer your question.[\/quote] \n \n Hi there, \n I am also planning on bringing my own playlist for the dinner (we&#039;re have a guitarist for the ceremony), but I believe that if you use the resort&#039;s sound system there is a $500 charge... just wanted to make sure you were aware. Maybe there is no charge for the sound system for the ceremony but there is for the reception? Just wanted to make sure you aren&#039;t hit with an unexpected charge at the end of your stay... I am planning to bring my own ipod speakers to avoid that fee.","Attachments":[],"Id":1254687,"PostDate":1281963673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are getting married on 12\/10\/10 and I was having the same issue about ceremony music. We don't want to spend too much extra money if we don't have to. I emailed Yamina about if we could provide our own music\/playlist. She said that we could bring a pre-mixed CD or ipod and they will provid the sound system for us. The only thing I am still unsure about is who will be manning the sound system during the cermony to que the right songs. I plan on sending her another email to get some more details. I hopes this helps to answer your question.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Hi there,<\/p> <p> I am also planning on bringing my own playlist for the dinner (we're have a guitarist for the ceremony), but I believe that if you use the resort's sound system there is a $500 charge... just wanted to make sure you were aware. Maybe there is no charge for the sound system for the ceremony but there is for the reception? Just wanted to make sure you aren't hit with an unexpected charge at the end of your stay... I am planning to bring my own ipod speakers to avoid that fee.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34c0067dd61e99679a7348f218c9c881","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi! Thanks for the heads up. I emailed Yamina this morning about the sound system for the ceremony and it is free to use. They do charge you however to use it for the reception so I will definatly bring a good ipod speaker system with us for the reception. I am also hoping that there is going to be some sort of entertainment with a live band that night so that we can head over there after dinner\/reception. I have been reading these posts and I it is making me even more excited!! When is your wedding, is it on 10\/31?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Erin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1255766,"PostDate":1282010576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi! Thanks for the heads up. I emailed Yamina this morning about the sound system for the ceremony and it is free to use. They do charge you however to use it for the reception so I will definatly bring a good ipod speaker system with us for the reception. I am also hoping that there is going to be some sort of entertainment with a live band that night so that we can head over there after dinner\/reception. I have been reading these posts and I it is making me even more excited!! When is your wedding, is it on 10\/31?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Erin<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1feb85e3d975362b6f78ed9f8079f28d","RawContent":"Great clarification, thanks! Yes, 10\/31 at 5pm is my date - when is yours? \n   \n I am getting really excited -- 15 guests so far! (I was expecting 6 so that&#039;s a real shock for me!)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi! Thanks for the heads up. I emailed Yamina this morning about the sound system for the ceremony and it is free to use. They do charge you however to use it for the reception so I will definatly bring a good ipod speaker system with us for the reception. I am also hoping that there is going to be some sort of entertainment with a live band that night so that we can head over there after dinner\/reception. I have been reading these posts and I it is making me even more excited!! When is your wedding, is it on 10\/31?  \n Thanks! \n   \n Erin[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1257358,"PostDate":1282134941,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great clarification, thanks! Yes, 10\/31 at 5pm is my date - when is yours?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting really excited -- 15 guests so far! (I was expecting 6 so that's a real shock for me!)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi! Thanks for the heads up. I emailed Yamina this morning about the sound system for the ceremony and it is free to use. They do charge you however to use it for the reception so I will definatly bring a good ipod speaker system with us for the reception. I am also hoping that there is going to be some sort of entertainment with a live band that night so that we can head over there after dinner\/reception. I have been reading these posts and I it is making me even more excited!! When is your wedding, is it on 10\/31?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Erin<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6abc8bb5f435e397dcc7224e99f490cc","RawContent":"Houston...I am only expecting 15 as well.  Are you doing a cocktail hour or a reception?  Or both? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HoustonBride10\/31\/10[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Great clarification, thanks! Yes, 10\/31 at 5pm is my date - when is yours? \n   \n I am getting really excited -- 15 guests so far! (I was expecting 6 so that&#039;s a real shock for me!)\n   \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1258388,"PostDate":1282169151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Houston...I am only expecting 15 as well.\u00a0 Are you doing a cocktail hour or a reception?\u00a0 Or both?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HoustonBride10\/31\/10<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Great clarification, thanks! Yes, 10\/31 at 5pm is my date - when is yours?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am getting really excited -- 15 guests so far! (I was expecting 6 so that's a real shock for me!)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe0a96bda849c37964c84574e109886d","RawContent":"Hey Daisy! \n We are doing both the reception and cocktail hour -- the gold package -- I really wanted a mariachi band (at the cocktail hour) and all of these upgrades, so financially that was smarter than all of my add-on&#039;s. Haven&#039;t been able to nail down my flower, cake and location choices yet -- so many choices - eek! \n   \n Does anyone know what the evening shows are Fri-Sun? I know Thursday is the fabulous Michael Jackson impersonator... trying to get some options together for my guests - most will be there Thursday through Monday. \n   \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ncarolinadaisy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Houston...I am only expecting 15 as well.  Are you doing a cocktail hour or a reception?  Or both? \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1258431,"PostDate":1282173264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Daisy!<\/p> <p> We are doing both the reception and cocktail hour -- the gold package -- I really wanted a mariachi band (at the cocktail hour) and all of these upgrades, so financially that was smarter than all of my add-on's. Haven't been able to nail down my flower, cake and location choices yet -- so many choices - eek!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Does anyone know what the evening shows are Fri-Sun? I know Thursday is the fabulous Michael Jackson impersonator... trying to get some options together for my guests - most will be there Thursday through Monday.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Houston...I am only expecting 15 as well.\u00a0 Are you doing a cocktail hour or a reception?\u00a0 Or both?<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e85b827c6881dd25e62f3cc098d18fcb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies, I think I will also have around 15 guests (on 10\/15\/10) &amp;nbsp;and am doing a cocktail hour but then just making a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants that night.&amp;nbsp; We are on a really tight budget so I didn&#039;t want to pay for the upgrade...but I did kind of want the mariachi band!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also have most people coming in either Wed-Sun or Thurs-Sun so was wondering about the shows as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also - one of my fiancee&#039;s sisters has a 16 and 13 year old and was considering staying off resort and then coming over for the day...I have emailed Yamina but haven&#039;t heard back yet...does anyone know anything about the policies for this?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am also working on picking out music for the ceremony\/cocktail hour (we are just doing sound system\/ipod)...does anyone know how long of a walk it is from where ever we come from to the beach?&amp;nbsp; Don&#039;t want the song to drag on and just be standing there...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Are most people doing the gazebo or the beach? Just curious...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have just about everything else finished up and am getting so excited!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1258609,"PostDate":1282186134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies, I think I will also have around 15 guests (on 10\/15\/10) \u00a0and am doing a cocktail hour but then just making a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants that night.\u00a0 We are on a really tight budget so I didn't want to pay for the upgrade...but I did kind of want the mariachi band!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also have most people coming in either Wed-Sun or Thurs-Sun so was wondering about the shows as well.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also - one of my fiancee's sisters has a 16 and 13 year old and was considering staying off resort and then coming over for the day...I have emailed Yamina but haven't heard back yet...does anyone know anything about the policies for this?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am also working on picking out music for the ceremony\/cocktail hour (we are just doing sound system\/ipod)...does anyone know how long of a walk it is from where ever we come from to the beach?\u00a0 Don't want the song to drag on and just be standing there...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are most people doing the gazebo or the beach? Just curious...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have just about everything else finished up and am getting so excited!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb70527d949bcca4e4955c0f6d85327c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; No minors are allowed on the property at all.&amp;nbsp; If you even go on an excursion and a bus was to pick you up at the resort, they have to park outside and you will have to walk outside to get it.&amp;nbsp; They are very strict on adult only as that is the kind of guests they cater to there.&amp;nbsp; We only see children at the airport or on an excursion and that is the only time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am doing the gazebo and it is quite a long aisle to go down and I would also assume when you do a beach wedding you are at the far end of the property to so you can have privacy.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1259050,"PostDate":1282231647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> No minors are allowed on the property at all.\u00a0 If you even go on an excursion and a bus was to pick you up at the resort, they have to park outside and you will have to walk outside to get it.\u00a0 They are very strict on adult only as that is the kind of guests they cater to there.\u00a0 We only see children at the airport or on an excursion and that is the only time.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am doing the gazebo and it is quite a long aisle to go down and I would also assume when you do a beach wedding you are at the far end of the property to so you can have privacy.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2094f1e2c472012e4bc062cf889165b0","RawContent":"I am doing a beach wedding - just found some really cute flats to wear that I might just kick off when I hit the sand! \n   \n I really hope they make an exception for your wedding for the kids to come over...please keep me posted -- so far I&#039;ve told everyone that anyone under 18 isn&#039;t allowed on property.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]scrose[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies, I think I will also have around 15 guests (on 10\/15\/10)  and am doing a cocktail hour but then just making a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants that night.  We are on a really tight budget so I didn&#039;t want to pay for the upgrade...but I did kind of want the mariachi band!!  :) \n   \n I also have most people coming in either Wed-Sun or Thurs-Sun so was wondering about the shows as well.  \n   \n Also - one of my fiancee&#039;s sisters has a 16 and 13 year old and was considering staying off resort and then coming over for the day...I have emailed Yamina but haven&#039;t heard back yet...does anyone know anything about the policies for this?  \n   \n I am also working on picking out music for the ceremony\/cocktail hour (we are just doing sound system\/ipod)...does anyone know how long of a walk it is from where ever we come from to the beach?  Don&#039;t want the song to drag on and just be standing there... \n   \n Are most people doing the gazebo or the beach? Just curious... \n   \n I have just about everything else finished up and am getting so excited!!  :) \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1259334,"PostDate":1282241547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am doing a beach wedding - just found some really cute flats to wear that I might just kick off when I hit the sand!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I really hope they make an exception for your wedding for the kids to come over...please keep me posted -- so far I've told everyone that anyone under 18 isn't allowed on property.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>scrose<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies, I think I will also have around 15 guests (on 10\/15\/10) \u00a0and am doing a cocktail hour but then just making a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants that night.\u00a0 We are on a really tight budget so I didn't want to pay for the upgrade...but I did kind of want the mariachi band!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also have most people coming in either Wed-Sun or Thurs-Sun so was wondering about the shows as well.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also - one of my fiancee's sisters has a 16 and 13 year old and was considering staying off resort and then coming over for the day...I have emailed Yamina but haven't heard back yet...does anyone know anything about the policies for this?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am also working on picking out music for the ceremony\/cocktail hour (we are just doing sound system\/ipod)...does anyone know how long of a walk it is from where ever we come from to the beach?\u00a0 Don't want the song to drag on and just be standing there...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are most people doing the gazebo or the beach? Just curious...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have just about everything else finished up and am getting so excited!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":690,"NextPage":700,"PreviousPage":680,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
