> Time: 1453779313 / Tue, 26 Jan 2016 03:35:13 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=27268&start=700&SessionId=5044e21e2f320ff3d39914aabcaed5fc
> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01f05045008d00c59738b0123811695e","RawContent":"Kids are def. not allowed.  I asked about the same thing because I have a 15month old that I really wanted to take part in the ceremony and they said absolutely no way even if he was only there for an hour.  Bummer... \n   \n Houston- I would email Yamina and see what shows they are doing now.  I just heard about the Michael Jackson show from Trip Advison and she confirmed that yes it was on my wedding day.  So excited!  I think they also do a casino night.  That would be cool too!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Snickers[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n No minors are allowed on the property at all.  If you even go on an excursion and a bus was to pick you up at the resort, they have to park outside and you will have to walk outside to get it.  They are very strict on adult only as that is the kind of guests they cater to there.  We only see children at the airport or on an excursion and that is the only time. \n   \n I am doing the gazebo and it is quite a long aisle to go down and I would also assume when you do a beach wedding you are at the far end of the property to so you can have privacy.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1259368,"PostDate":1282242561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Kids are def. not allowed.\u00a0 I asked about the same thing because I have a 15month old that I really wanted to take part in the ceremony and they said absolutely no way even if he was only there for an hour.\u00a0 Bummer...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Houston- I would email Yamina and see what shows they are doing now.\u00a0 I just heard about the Michael Jackson show from Trip Advison and she confirmed that yes it was on my wedding day.\u00a0 So excited!\u00a0 I think they also do a casino night.\u00a0 That would be cool too!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> No minors are allowed on the property at all.\u00a0 If you even go on an excursion and a bus was to pick you up at the resort, they have to park outside and you will have to walk outside to get it.\u00a0 They are very strict on adult only as that is the kind of guests they cater to there.\u00a0 We only see children at the airport or on an excursion and that is the only time.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am doing the gazebo and it is quite a long aisle to go down and I would also assume when you do a beach wedding you are at the far end of the property to so you can have privacy.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"debe0d134fcbffe08cbb36f84042dc3c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Havent been on in a while was trying to finalize my wedding plans.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are confirmed for August 12, 2011 finally after waiting on travel agents and the hotel.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Now I feel like I can breathe...I have to say Yamina has been great, she responds to emails within a day or two.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I can confirm all parts of the wedding flowers, photos, menu etc. except for the venues, which she is telling me I can confirm only a month prior to the wedding. This makes us feel a little uneasy but we are trusting that any restaurant or location we choose for our cocktail hour and private dinner reception will be excellent. Anyone else feeling the same???&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am hearing all positive things girls about this resort, 2 people I know recently went there and raved about it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are going with the gold package, but we do not know how many guests to expect, we are hoping for 20 to 30.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyone else hear about the services of the hotel photographer and videographer?&amp;nbsp; Yamina sent me links to their websites.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lisa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1262646,"PostDate":1282570077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey,<\/p> <p> Havent been on in a while was trying to finalize my wedding plans.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are confirmed for August 12, 2011 finally after waiting on travel agents and the hotel.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now I feel like I can breathe...I have to say Yamina has been great, she responds to emails within a day or two.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I can confirm all parts of the wedding flowers, photos, menu etc. except for the venues, which she is telling me I can confirm only a month prior to the wedding. This makes us feel a little uneasy but we are trusting that any restaurant or location we choose for our cocktail hour and private dinner reception will be excellent. Anyone else feeling the same???<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am hearing all positive things girls about this resort, 2 people I know recently went there and raved about it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are going with the gold package, but we do not know how many guests to expect, we are hoping for 20 to 30.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyone else hear about the services of the hotel photographer and videographer?\u00a0 Yamina sent me links to their websites.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!<\/p> <p> Lisa<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c9b0a3a79b4cc6de13aaed5625d9adc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re playing our wedding for a Monday in May 2011 and Yamina gave us the choices of t&lt;span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: black;\"&gt;he Lobster House, Barcelona Terrace, and the Event Terrace for our reception. I&#039;m leaning towards the Event Terrace so we&#039;ll have more privacy, but it&#039;s hard to tell the configuration of the spaces from the photos she sent me. Has anyone had their reception on either the Barcelona Terrace or Event Terrace? We&#039;re expecting about 60 guests so I want to make sure we have room for everyone and space for a dance floor. Thanks! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1263249,"PostDate":1282588154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're playing our wedding for a Monday in May 2011 and Yamina gave us the choices of t<span lang=\"EN-US\"  style=\"font-size: 10pt;color: black\">he Lobster House, Barcelona Terrace, and the Event Terrace for our reception. I'm leaning towards the Event Terrace so we'll have more privacy, but it's hard to tell the configuration of the spaces from the photos she sent me. Has anyone had their reception on either the Barcelona Terrace or Event Terrace? We're expecting about 60 guests so I want to make sure we have room for everyone and space for a dance floor. Thanks! <\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.kenney@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1281315541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231155.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"grandstreet11","Id":231155,"Name":"grandstreet11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02ff29ebc4c676480e2a9b83d32bba92","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I haven&#039;t written on this blog yet too, but my wedding is booked for October 22nd :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1264901,"PostDate":1282684864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I haven't written on this blog yet too, but my wedding is booked for October 22nd <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anyakroupnik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282621348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231659.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnyaKr","Id":231659,"Name":"AnyaKr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47d667bb29dd1e2e687f8bf10a0cf1e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; A question that I haven&#039;t seen answered on this entire blog... and I have spent 3 days going through the entire thing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can anyone tell me about this romantic dinner cruise you get with the gold package?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1266120,"PostDate":1282757391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> A question that I haven't seen answered on this entire blog... and I have spent 3 days going through the entire thing!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can anyone tell me about this romantic dinner cruise you get with the gold package?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anyakroupnik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282621348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231659.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnyaKr","Id":231659,"Name":"AnyaKr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0da56c473037ba107a04b24572cc1dae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was told it was only for Excellence Riviera not at our hotel :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1266540,"PostDate":1282770802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was told it was only for Excellence Riviera not at our hotel <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e959b5f6e8aed513e6b72e4bfefd94fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting amrried at Excellence Riviera Cancun.&amp;nbsp; The Cruise is for Excellence Playa Mujeres not Excellence Riviera Cancun.&amp;nbsp; It used to be for ERC but they changed it to EPM.&amp;nbsp; Not sure why both places don&#039;t have it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1267871,"PostDate":1282849877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm getting amrried at Excellence Riviera Cancun.\u00a0 The Cruise is for Excellence Playa Mujeres not Excellence Riviera Cancun.\u00a0 It used to be for ERC but they changed it to EPM.\u00a0 Not sure why both places don't have it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;6\/st\/20101026\/e\/Ivi+%26amp%3B+Nu%27s+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/3117\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3117\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lyndencotton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1245775786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218705.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dimenzi","Id":218705,"Name":"Dimenzi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":fals