{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc78a06c16a066e72eba6f1c3d77300c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Who is the next to get married out of all of us on this thread?&amp;nbsp; I am Sept 17\/10.&amp;nbsp; 2 weeks today!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1277847,"PostDate":1283537868,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Who is the next to get married out of all of us on this thread?\u00a0 I am Sept 17\/10.\u00a0 2 weeks today!!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbf8316ba992509bf4c08d94668a4dd7","RawContent":"WOW! So soon!! Please come back here after and give us a detailed review! \n   \n How many guests are you having? Are you doing one of the packages? How exciting!!!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Snickers[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Who is the next to get married out of all of us on this thread?  I am Sept 17\/10.  2 weeks today!!!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1277858,"PostDate":1283538046,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW! So soon!! Please come back here after and give us a detailed review!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How many guests are you having? Are you doing one of the packages? How exciting!!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Snickers<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Who is the next to get married out of all of us on this thread?\u00a0 I am Sept 17\/10.\u00a0 2 weeks today!!!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pninamossman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275979867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228964.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","Id":228964,"Name":"HoustonBride10\/31\/10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"399fa046463501328c37ea85b6a6a616","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am only have 14 guests in Mexico but 50 at our at home reception.&amp;nbsp; We are doing the gold package cause the food put it over the top for us, plus all the little extras.&amp;nbsp; We are bumping up our photo package too.&amp;nbsp; When you think about it the gold package is quite worth considering all you get versus what you might have paid to do your wedding at home.&amp;nbsp; The only thing I really splurged on was for my Mexican wedding guests was personal embroidered beach towels, it cost me a fortune in Canada, but they are really nice.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1278130,"PostDate":1283546903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am only have 14 guests in Mexico but 50 at our at home reception.\u00a0 We are doing the gold package cause the food put it over the top for us, plus all the little extras.\u00a0 We are bumping up our photo package too.\u00a0 When you think about it the gold package is quite worth considering all you get versus what you might have paid to do your wedding at home.\u00a0 The only thing I really splurged on was for my Mexican wedding guests was personal embroidered beach towels, it cost me a fortune in Canada, but they are really nice.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268279554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7223f7df953ab476ebf28b2b594c35fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It has been awhile since I have posted anything. I have 3 months till the wedding. If anyone is planning on adding \"extras\" on to the packages? Like centerpieces or the ceremony arch or chair covers. I am not wanting to add to many extras but I also don&#039;t want the ceremony and dinner\/reception to look plain. Let me know what you guys are doing or if you think just the resort&#039;s ambience is enough. Thanks Ladies!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; P.s. @Snikers congrats on the big day coming up so soon, you must be so excited!! It would be great if you keep us in the loop of how everything went down!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Take care,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Erin&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1280291,"PostDate":1283881596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It has been awhile since I have posted anything. I have 3 months till the wedding. If anyone is planning on adding \"extras\" on to the packages? Like centerpieces or the ceremony arch or chair covers. I am not wanting to add to many extras but I also don't want the ceremony and dinner\/reception to look plain. Let me know what you guys are doing or if you think just the resort's ambience is enough. Thanks Ladies!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> P.s. @Snikers congrats on the big day coming up so soon, you must be so excited!! It would be great if you keep us in the loop of how everything went down!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Take care,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Erin<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc67d18b7367cb8551f18b7a9f0984df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ladies-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have 1 month and 1 week left until the wedding!!! VERY excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For those who already had their wedding- any feedback on the cake? &amp;nbsp;Since we are not able to taste them ahead of time I am having a hard time choosing. &amp;nbsp;Any feedback would be GREATLY appreciated. &amp;nbsp;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1282659,"PostDate":1284061531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ladies-<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have 1 month and 1 week left until the wedding!!! VERY excited!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For those who already had their wedding- any feedback on the cake? \u00a0Since we are not able to taste them ahead of time I am having a hard time choosing. \u00a0Any feedback would be GREATLY appreciated. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anyakroupnik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282621348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231659.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnyaKr","Id":231659,"Name":"AnyaKr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"444551e9244259cdcff5833effa88944","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been going back and forth with Yamina about the wedding menu and I&#039;m really confused. Based on past posts, it seems like people were able to offer at least two entree options plus a veggie option for their receptions, but then she emailed me today and said the sauces and the garnishes have to be the same for all the dishes. I don&#039;t want to be serving fish and beef with the same sauce. Please help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1283510,"PostDate":1284144828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've been going back and forth with Yamina about the wedding menu and I'm really confused. Based on past posts, it seems like people were able to offer at least two entree options plus a veggie option for their receptions, but then she emailed me today and said the sauces and the garnishes have to be the same for all the dishes. I don't want to be serving fish and beef with the same sauce. Please help!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.kenney@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1281315541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231155.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"grandstreet11","Id":231155,"Name":"grandstreet11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f5475bfe21707e614850a49739467cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies!!&amp;nbsp; I&amp;nbsp;will hopefully&amp;nbsp;be a EPM bride.&amp;nbsp; I am trying to decide between EPM &amp;amp; ERC.&amp;nbsp; I prefer EPM, but I don&#039;t know if the date I want is available (it is at ERC)&amp;nbsp; I have my TA checking on it.&amp;nbsp; This resort looks awesome &amp;amp; has had so many great reviews!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1284114,"PostDate":1284216340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies!!\u00a0 I\u00a0will hopefully\u00a0be a EPM bride.\u00a0 I am trying to decide between EPM & ERC.\u00a0 I prefer EPM, but I don't know if the date I want is available (it is at ERC)\u00a0 I have my TA checking on it.\u00a0 This resort looks awesome & has had so many great reviews!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krmiller47@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.197.161.118","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271868919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227529.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krmiller","Id":227529,"Name":"krmiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94809164e7c879508f3d3d082d110543","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everybody,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sorry that I&#039;ve been MIA for a while. It has been good to read your recent posts and catch up on your latest news. Well, here&#039;s the latest with me. I had a mini break down a few weeks ago! We hadn&#039;t yet booked our trip but had already finalized the plans in our head when future MIL decides to suggest that we do the wedding in Hawaii instead. I know, I know. It&#039;s not that big of a deal and I should probably expect a ton of questions and suggestions about our location. I guess it really pushed my buttons because about 6 months ago we talked to both families and apprehensively told them our plan to marry at EPM. We left room for suggestions. We talked it out. Everyone agreed with our plans! Why couldn&#039;t she bring this up 6 months ago?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Well that&#039;s all behind us now. We have booked our trip. I have pretty much completed our wedding website. I just ordered really cute Save the Date postcards. I&#039;m ready. The plan is set and there&#039;s no turning back now. I&#039;m just excited for those who DO show up because I know that they will fall head over heals with the location and they&#039;ll understand why we made the decision to marry there. Well... that&#039;s the latest with me!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1284208,"PostDate":1284228363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everybody,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorry that I've been MIA for a while. It has been good to read your recent posts and catch up on your latest news. Well, here's the latest with me. I had a mini break down a few weeks ago! We hadn't yet booked our trip but had already finalized the plans in our head when future MIL decides to suggest that we do the wedding in Hawaii instead. I know, I know. It's not that big of a deal and I should probably expect a ton of questions and suggestions about our location. I guess it really pushed my buttons because about 6 months ago we talked to both families and apprehensively told them our plan to marry at EPM. We left room for suggestions. We talked it out. Everyone agreed with our plans! Why couldn't she bring this up 6 months ago?<\/p> <p> Well that's all behind us now. We have booked our trip. I have pretty much completed our wedding website. I just ordered really cute Save the Date postcards. I'm ready. The plan is set and there's no turning back now. I'm just excited for those who DO show up because I know that they will fall head over heals with the location and they'll understand why we made the decision to marry there. Well... that's the latest with me!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile35.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Amanda & Marc<\/span><br><span>June 11th, 2011<\/span><br><span>EPM! Are you ready for us?<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aecottrell@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277337466,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229470.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aeluzu","Id":229470,"Name":"aeluzu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dea9c5f034177b83d269416174fa6fd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello all my fellow EPM Brides!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We just got back from our wedding-moon at EPM, it was just amazing!&amp;nbsp; Yamina is so great, she had every email that I had sent her and she got every detail that I had wanted, just perfect.&amp;nbsp; She is so sweet, so anyone that has any doubts, just know that you are in the best hands there.&amp;nbsp; It rained right as my guest sat down for the ceremony at 5:00, but I would not change it for the world, the air cooled and we had the most incredible rainbow, it made me cry as I walked down the sand to my future husband. Vincent from Del Sol Photography was just wonderful, I can not wait to see the images from him.&amp;nbsp; He even made my sweet husband comfortable in front of the camera, he HATES having his picture taken.&amp;nbsp; After the ceremony we went to the Villa next to the resort (this is one of the homes of the owner of the Excellence Resorts), you must get shots there with your hubby, it is just lovely.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope this helps give you lovely ladies a bit of insight to your upcoming weddings, if you have any questions, I am happy to answer.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I will post pictures as soon as I get them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Much Love and Happiness to you all.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Mrs. Baynton :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1284659,"PostDate":1284318991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello all my fellow EPM Brides!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just got back from our wedding-moon at EPM, it was just amazing!\u00a0 Yamina is so great, she had every email that I had sent her and she got every detail that I had wanted, just perfect.\u00a0 She is so sweet, so anyone that has any doubts, just know that you are in the best hands there.\u00a0 It rained right as my guest sat down for the ceremony at 5:00, but I would not change it for the world, the air cooled and we had the most incredible rainbow, it made me cry as I walked down the sand to my future husband. Vincent from Del Sol Photography was just wonderful, I can not wait to see the images from him.\u00a0 He even made my sweet husband comfortable in front of the camera, he HATES having his picture taken.\u00a0 After the ceremony we went to the Villa next to the resort (this is one of the homes of the owner of the Excellence Resorts), you must get shots there with your hubby, it is just lovely.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this helps give you lovely ladies a bit of insight to your upcoming weddings, if you have any questions, I am happy to answer.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I will post pictures as soon as I get them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Much Love and Happiness to you all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Mrs. Baynton :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c126403c4214d157cb58069eb4a5a4ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have decided to have my wedding at Excellence but have not picked which one yet. My parents happen to be staying at the Rivera Maya location the first week of October and will be also going to the Playa Mujeres for a day to do a site visit. I was wondering if anyone is having their wedding that week so they can take a look for me&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Jen&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1284891,"PostDate":1284340722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have decided to have my wedding at Excellence but have not picked which one yet. My parents happen to be staying at the Rivera Maya location the first week of October and will be also going to the Playa Mujeres for a day to do a site visit. I was wondering if anyone is having their wedding that week so they can take a look for me<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Jen<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jennifer.Brooks@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280201144,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230702.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenFL","Id":230702,"Name":"JenFL","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":710,"NextPage":720,"PreviousPage":700,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
