{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c9a54217a0dcd589bcdf42f45b2c7ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That&#039;s really great, congratulations!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What cake option did you choose and how was it?! &amp;nbsp;Also, what venue did you have your reception at (I am wondering, because I am choosing the restaurant location and decorations now)?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you have any pictures, please send them over to anyakroupnik@gmail.com. &amp;nbsp;For some reason on this site I can view pictures, but I am unable to download any of them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1285270,"PostDate":1284396280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That's really great, congratulations!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What cake option did you choose and how was it?! \u00a0Also, what venue did you have your reception at (I am wondering, because I am choosing the restaurant location and decorations now)?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you have any pictures, please send them over to anyakroupnik@gmail.com. \u00a0For some reason on this site I can view pictures, but I am unable to download any of them!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anyakroupnik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282621348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231659.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnyaKr","Id":231659,"Name":"AnyaKr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0eae57aa8e0966d4ac61f5443d6a4654","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;d love more details as well (from you and anyone else that has recently had their wedding! &amp;nbsp;I am getting down to the last month so am going to have to make final decisions on details like venues, cake, etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1285344,"PostDate":1284399946,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'd love more details as well (from you and anyone else that has recently had their wedding! \u00a0I am getting down to the last month so am going to have to make final decisions on details like venues, cake, etc. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfad3a45c5d7308d7696e28af28cf286","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Supersonic,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just saw some other shots on the del sol website that were taken at the villa next door. &amp;nbsp;(Not sure if there were yours or not) Fantastic! Do you need to get special permission to go over there? &amp;nbsp;How long did it take? &amp;nbsp;We are having a happy hour afterwards and didn&#039;t want to take too long with pictures and leave the guests waiting...then again, it&#039;s a happy hour, how upset can they be? &amp;nbsp;:) Just curious about the details of this...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1285849,"PostDate":1284432988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Supersonic,\u00a0<\/p> <p> I just saw some other shots on the del sol website that were taken at the villa next door. \u00a0(Not sure if there were yours or not) Fantastic! Do you need to get special permission to go over there? \u00a0How long did it take? \u00a0We are having a happy hour afterwards and didn't want to take too long with pictures and leave the guests waiting...then again, it's a happy hour, how upset can they be? \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Just curious about the details of this...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5f857ccfb8f87aafb302c19f262763a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The wedding date I wanted was booked, but I was told that I could get married on Thursday before &amp;amp; have the reception at the Spice terrace or Event terrace.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone know what the event terrace is?&amp;nbsp; If so, does anyone have pictures of it?&amp;nbsp; Yamina said that we could not have a DJ at the Spice terrace.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1286275,"PostDate":1284479690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The wedding date I wanted was booked, but I was told that I could get married on Thursday before & have the reception at the Spice terrace or Event terrace.\u00a0 Does anyone know what the event terrace is?\u00a0 If so, does anyone have pictures of it?\u00a0 Yamina said that we could not have a DJ at the Spice terrace.\u00a0 Thanks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krmiller47@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.197.161.118","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271868919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227529.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krmiller","Id":227529,"Name":"krmiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b4c65f3b9fab055091e9bb03b51c8fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The cakes are moist, they type of will depend on what you like.&amp;nbsp; They have a lot of options, including cakes filled with real fruit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1290146,"PostDate":1284821341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The cakes are moist, they type of will depend on what you like.\u00a0 They have a lot of options, including cakes filled with real fruit.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"duncancls4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280003362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cls2010","Id":230617,"Name":"cls2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b9c820d6c5e97cd6a26dd54bbdf6251","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What is everyone using for ceremony music?&amp;nbsp; I am stumped.   Oh...and please don&#039;t say \"Somewhere Over The Rainbow\"&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1290261,"PostDate":1284833502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> What is everyone using for ceremony music?\u00a0 I am stumped.\u00a0\u00a0 Oh...and please don't say \"Somewhere Over The Rainbow\"\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad140a8196aed1b0a840965b9cfb0b04","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are doing Spanish guitar for pre-ceremony and walk down the aisle...haven&#039;t picked a song to leave with yet though!! &amp;nbsp;I was a little worried to pick anything with words or that dragged on for a long time since I don&#039;t know who will be operating the sound system, how long the walk is, etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am down to just a month away!! &amp;nbsp;Finishing up details, out of town bags and working a little on the party we are having at home after we get back. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Am I just supposed to email Yamina pics of flowers and cake that are similar to what I want? &amp;nbsp;Guess I need to touch base with her!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1290708,"PostDate":1284921219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are doing Spanish guitar for pre-ceremony and walk down the aisle...haven't picked a song to leave with yet though!! \u00a0I was a little worried to pick anything with words or that dragged on for a long time since I don't know who will be operating the sound system, how long the walk is, etc. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am down to just a month away!! \u00a0Finishing up details, out of town bags and working a little on the party we are having at home after we get back. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Am I just supposed to email Yamina pics of flowers and cake that are similar to what I want? \u00a0Guess I need to touch base with her!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9912fec4d77406f0372241030a0bf1f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ncarolinadaisy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n What is everyone using for ceremony music?  I am stumped.   Oh...and please don&#039;t say \"Somewhere Over The Rainbow\"[\/quote] \n \n Haha, this is kind of funny as I was leaning towards this too.  I guess this song must be to beach weddings what Cannon in D is to church weddings.  I also tried listening to a few more of [i]I[\/i][i]srael Kamakawiwo[\/i]&#039;[i]ole&#039;s [\/i]songs but nothing has jumped out at me.  I&#039;d also be interested in knowing if anyone else has found something equally sweet beach-y.","Attachments":[],"Id":1291065,"PostDate":1284979666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> What is everyone using for ceremony music?\u00a0 I am stumped.\u00a0\u00a0 Oh...and please don't say \"Somewhere Over The Rainbow\"\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Haha, this is kind of funny as I was leaning towards this too.\u00a0 I guess this song must be to beach weddings what Cannon in D is to church weddings.\u00a0 I also tried listening to a few more of <em>I<\/em><em>srael Kamakawiwo<\/em>'<em>ole's <\/em>songs but nothing has jumped out at me.\u00a0 I'd also be interested in knowing if anyone else has found something equally sweet beach-y.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"voyager76@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258238890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christamh","Id":223302,"Name":"christamh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2856b40315781674002ea4cc01f30401","RawContent":"I just went to a wedding this weekend and they used \"Blue Sky\" by the Allman Brothers.  It was at a church and still super cute!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]christamh[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n   \n \n Haha, this is kind of funny as I was leaning towards this too.  I guess this song must be to beach weddings what Cannon in D is to church weddings.  I also tried listening to a few more of [i]I[\/i][i]srael Kamakawiwo[\/i]&#039;[i]ole&#039;s [\/i]songs but nothing has jumped out at me.  I&#039;d also be interested in knowing if anyone else has found something equally sweet beach-y.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1291531,"PostDate":1285009275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just went to a wedding this weekend and they used \"Blue Sky\" by the Allman Brothers.\u00a0 It was at a church and still super cute!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>christamh<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> Haha, this is kind of funny as I was leaning towards this too.\u00a0 I guess this song must be to beach weddings what Cannon in D is to church weddings.\u00a0 I also tried listening to a few more of <em>I<\/em><em>srael Kamakawiwo<\/em>'<em>ole's <\/em>songs but nothing has jumped out at me.\u00a0 I'd also be interested in knowing if anyone else has found something equally sweet beach-y.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f79d4b073fa068a6f4f08b4157f0c64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here we go and the winners are...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Wallace Courts Murron (from the Braveheart Soundtrack)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And I found an awesome Celtic version on Canon D&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1291693,"PostDate":1285016248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here we go and the winners are...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wallace Courts Murron (from the Braveheart Soundtrack)<\/p> <p> And I found an awesome Celtic version on Canon D<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":720,"NextPage":730,"PreviousPage":710,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
