{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"953555e93cdfb0f39f8c36c4f866ddff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Nice, I have to listen to the Celtic version of Canon D that sounds intresting!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are doing Ingrid Michaelson&#039;s verson of &lt;em&gt;Can&#039;t help falling in love&lt;\/em&gt; for the procession&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For the recession we are doing Beyonce&#039;s verson of &lt;em&gt;Ava Maria.&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1292563,"PostDate":1285093908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Nice, I have to listen to the Celtic version of Canon D that sounds intresting!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are doing Ingrid Michaelson's verson of <em>Can't help falling in love<\/em> for the procession<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the recession we are doing Beyonce's verson of <em>Ava Maria.<\/em><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b47080996693e58abc5ff4e7ecc983b8","RawContent":"You can find it on iTunes I believe.  Or if you google it it should come up too.  I thought those were my final choices but fiance put his foot down and told me that they were depressing.  Haha! \n   \n Soooooo I think we have decided to go with Clocks by: Coldplay and Use Somebody by: Kinks of Leon.  The instrumental versions. \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Nice, I have to listen to the Celtic version of Canon D that sounds intresting! \n   \n We are doing Ingrid Michaelson&#039;s verson of [i]Can&#039;t help falling in love[\/i] for the procession \n   \n For the recession we are doing Beyonce&#039;s verson of [i]Ava Maria.[\/i] \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1293669,"PostDate":1285178167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You can find it on iTunes I believe.\u00a0 Or if you google it it should come up too.\u00a0 I thought those were my final choices but fiance put his foot down and told me that they were depressing.\u00a0 Haha!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Soooooo I think we have decided to go with Clocks by: Coldplay and Use Somebody by: Kinks of Leon.\u00a0 The instrumental versions.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Nice, I have to listen to the Celtic version of Canon D that sounds intresting!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are doing Ingrid Michaelson's verson of <em>Can't help falling in love<\/em> for the procession<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the recession we are doing Beyonce's verson of <em>Ava Maria.<\/em><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d931557463a0ab3a5b6fc02962e3a78b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Anyone have any info about the yacht excersion at Playa?&amp;nbsp; Cost ect?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1295359,"PostDate":1285276304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Anyone have any info about the yacht excersion at Playa?\u00a0 Cost ect?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14095285d88d468ec4794b992f992a46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Are you talking about the one that comes with the Gold Package?&amp;nbsp; All I know about it is that it needs to be booked at least 2 days in advance and can be booked before you arrive.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1296022,"PostDate":1285351628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Are you talking about the one that comes with the Gold Package?\u00a0 All I know about it is that it needs to be booked at least 2 days in advance and can be booked before you arrive.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"voyager76@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258238890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christamh","Id":223302,"Name":"christamh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93a90a814b3fdbf3d9459c30adaa70d4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]christamh[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Are you talking about the one that comes with the Gold Package?  All I know about it is that it needs to be booked at least 2 days in advance and can be booked before you arrive.[\/quote] \n \n I didn&#039;t know that there was one that came with the gold package.  It is listed on the activities on the Excellence website.  I am not doing one of the packages, but i thought it would be a nice thing to do together with our guests.  Depending on cost ect.  I emailed Yamina and my TA but no word yet.","Attachments":[],"Id":1296633,"PostDate":1285437353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>christamh<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Are you talking about the one that comes with the Gold Package?\u00a0 All I know about it is that it needs to be booked at least 2 days in advance and can be booked before you arrive.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> I didn't know that there was one that came with the gold package.\u00a0 It is listed on the activities on the Excellence website.\u00a0 I am not doing one of the packages, but i thought it would be a nice thing to do together with our guests.\u00a0 Depending on cost ect.\u00a0 I emailed Yamina and my TA but no word yet.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"870673aa669df8e47fdb32e933bdf5c4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Scrose:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.&amp;nbsp; We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.&amp;nbsp; :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!&amp;nbsp; We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; they waited for us. No one cared at all.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Smiles,\n Shanna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1296739,"PostDate":1285452568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Scrose:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.\u00a0 We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next<\/p> <p> Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on,<\/p> <p> I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!\u00a0 We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while<\/p> <p> they waited for us. No one cared at all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...leries\/?gal=328<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ac49e7785da98a61c446aab61abeac5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Daisy-   I was referring to the \"Romantic cocktail cruise for bride and groom\" which comes with the package.&amp;nbsp; I am also interested in possibly hosting some sort of boat trip for my guests the day after the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Let me know if you find out anything interesting.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Supersonic-&amp;nbsp; Your photos look amazing. I have also hired Del Sol for my wedding, except I will be using Matt.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t wait!!&amp;nbsp; I will ask if I can sneak over to the villa as well for some shots.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can I ask what you guys used for ceremony music?&amp;nbsp; We are also thinking of skipping the gazebo and doing it on the beach.&amp;nbsp; I didnt see any speakers or anything in your setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1296904,"PostDate":1285505041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Daisy-\u00a0\u00a0 I was referring to the \"Romantic cocktail cruise for bride and groom\" which comes with the package.\u00a0 I am also interested in possibly hosting some sort of boat trip for my guests the day after the wedding.\u00a0 Let me know if you find out anything interesting.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Supersonic-\u00a0 Your photos look amazing. I have also hired Del Sol for my wedding, except I will be using Matt.\u00a0 I can't wait!!\u00a0 I will ask if I can sneak over to the villa as well for some shots.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can I ask what you guys used for ceremony music?\u00a0 We are also thinking of skipping the gazebo and doing it on the beach.\u00a0 I didnt see any speakers or anything in your setup.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"voyager76@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258238890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christamh","Id":223302,"Name":"christamh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c50179302d4f29f966bdfd761a03d9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Supersonic:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for responding!! &amp;nbsp;I am so glad I got to see your pics, as I am doing the same setup with a similar number of guests, etc. &amp;nbsp;Looks like the rain shower didn&#039;t ruin anything too much for you! &amp;nbsp;:) I was wondering about your music too - I was told we had use of a sound system on the beach, but didn&#039;t see it anywhere...or is it just out of the photos? &amp;nbsp;We are just bringing ipods with music to play before\/during ceremony and then during our happy hour. &amp;nbsp;I am going to send the link to your slide show to my photographer (citalli rico) to show her some of these great locations, I loved the way your pics turned out. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also - did the salon at the hotel do your hair and makeup? &amp;nbsp;I have a similar hairpiece and like the way yours looked! &amp;nbsp;I have been saving pics from online and magazines to show them, but am nervous about someone I&#039;ve never met doing my hair!! &amp;nbsp;:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck with your party! &amp;nbsp;We are doing ours about 3 weeks after our wedding and I am trying to get as much done as possible before we leave for Mexico!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1297031,"PostDate":1285523336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Supersonic:<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for responding!! \u00a0I am so glad I got to see your pics, as I am doing the same setup with a similar number of guests, etc. \u00a0Looks like the rain shower didn't ruin anything too much for you! \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I was wondering about your music too - I was told we had use of a sound system on the beach, but didn't see it anywhere...or is it just out of the photos? \u00a0We are just bringing ipods with music to play before\/during ceremony and then during our happy hour. \u00a0I am going to send the link to your slide show to my photographer (citalli rico) to show her some of these great locations, I loved the way your pics turned out. \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also - did the salon at the hotel do your hair and makeup? \u00a0I have a similar hairpiece and like the way yours looked! \u00a0I have been saving pics from online and magazines to show them, but am nervous about someone I've never met doing my hair!! \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck with your party! \u00a0We are doing ours about 3 weeks after our wedding and I am trying to get as much done as possible before we leave for Mexico!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18c19773c45d2b638de28dd93f4064f1","RawContent":"I got some info on the private excersion.  But it looks like the yacht only holds 8 people but I am waiting to hear back to confirm that.  I have the info if you would like me to forward it to you.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]christamh[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Daisy-   I was referring to the \"Romantic cocktail cruise for bride and groom\" which comes with the package.  I am also interested in possibly hosting some sort of boat trip for my guests the day after the wedding.  Let me know if you find out anything interesting. \n   \n Supersonic-  Your photos look amazing. I have also hired Del Sol for my wedding, except I will be using Matt.  I can&#039;t wait!!  I will ask if I can sneak over to the villa as well for some shots.  \n   \n Can I ask what you guys used for ceremony music?  We are also thinking of skipping the gazebo and doing it on the beach.  I didnt see any speakers or anything in your setup.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1297082,"PostDate":1285532998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I got some info on the private excersion.\u00a0 But it looks like the yacht only holds 8 people but I am waiting to hear back to confirm that.\u00a0 I have the info if you would like me to forward it to you.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>christamh<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Daisy-\u00a0\u00a0 I was referring to the \"Romantic cocktail cruise for bride and groom\" which comes with the package.\u00a0 I am also interested in possibly hosting some sort of boat trip for my guests the day after the wedding.\u00a0 Let me know if you find out anything interesting.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Supersonic-\u00a0 Your photos look amazing. I have also hired Del Sol for my wedding, except I will be using Matt.\u00a0 I can't wait!!\u00a0 I will ask if I can sneak over to the villa as well for some shots.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can I ask what you guys used for ceremony music?\u00a0 We are also thinking of skipping the gazebo and doing it on the beach.\u00a0 I didnt see any speakers or anything in your setup.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4593aaca5b6cc0e669ff969654bb2e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Scrose:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We did not want music, we just wanted to hear the sound of the waves hitting the shore, that was our music.&amp;nbsp; :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am so glad you like the photos, we were just amazed by them. Glad I could help give you some ideas.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I did not use the salon, one of my guest is an amazing hair and make-up artist, so she did it for me as a wedding gift.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have read that people have used the salon there and were very happy and if you have pictures of what you want then&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; they should be able to copy it for you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you, everything is coming together for the party here, doing some DIY things when I log off of here. I must&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; say that it is nice to have a reception at home as well, I am glad that we are doing that.&amp;nbsp; I will be wearing my dress again,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; for our party, I am having it cut off above the knee so now it will be a cocktail dress, then after the party I will dye it a dark&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; charcoal so I can keep using it later on.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck with all of your planning and let me know if you have any other questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Shanna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1297165,"PostDate":1285542131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Scrose:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We did not want music, we just wanted to hear the sound of the waves hitting the shore, that was our music.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> I am so glad you like the photos, we were just amazed by them. Glad I could help give you some ideas.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did not use the salon, one of my guest is an amazing hair and make-up artist, so she did it for me as a wedding gift.<\/p> <p> I have read that people have used the salon there and were very happy and if you have pictures of what you want then<\/p> <p> they should be able to copy it for you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you, everything is coming together for the party here, doing some DIY things when I log off of here. I must<\/p> <p> say that it is nice to have a reception at home as well, I am glad that we are doing that.\u00a0 I will be wearing my dress again,<\/p> <p> for our party, I am having it cut off above the knee so now it will be a cocktail dress, then after the party I will dye it a dark<\/p> <p> charcoal so I can keep using it later on.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck with all of your planning and let me know if you have any other questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Shanna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":730,"NextPage":740,"PreviousPage":720,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
