> Time: 1453779366 / Tue, 26 Jan 2016 03:36:06 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=27268&start=740&SessionId=5044e21e2f320ff3d39914aabcaed5fc
> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95316e2e1e664073e0882cac56ae1f9c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Supersonic[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Scrose: \n   \n Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.  We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next \n Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.  :-) \n   \n As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on, \n I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!  We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while \n they waited for us. No one cared at all. \n   \n Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them. \n   \n [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328[\/url] \n   \n Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help. \n   \n Smiles,\n Shanna[\/quote] \n \n Shanna, \n   \n Thank you so much for sharing. Your wedding looks like it was absolutely perfect. You looked gorgeous. The rain- I heard that it&#039;s good luck and WOW what a rainbow. I have a few questions if you don&#039;t mind. I love the maracas and that is the favor that I was thinking of using. May I ask where you found them? Did you paint them or were you able to order them hand painted? Also, the menus. Does the resort provide the menus or is this an extra kick that you added. It all looks so fantastic and gets me really excited for my big day!","Attachments":[],"Id":1297166,"PostDate":1285542177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Supersonic<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Scrose:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.\u00a0 We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next<\/p> <p> Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on,<\/p> <p> I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!\u00a0 We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while<\/p> <p> they waited for us. No one cared at all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...leries\/?gal=328<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Shanna,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for sharing. Your wedding looks like it was absolutely perfect. You looked gorgeous. The rain- I heard that it's good luck and WOW what a rainbow. I have a few questions if you don't mind. I love the maracas and that is the favor that I was thinking of using. May I ask where you found them? Did you paint them or were you able to order them hand painted? Also, the menus. Does the resort provide the menus or is this an extra kick that you added. It all looks so fantastic and gets me really excited for my big day!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Amanda & Marc<\/span><br><span>June 11th, 2011<\/span><br><span>EPM! Are you ready for us?<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aecottrell@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277337466,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229470.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aeluzu","Id":229470,"Name":"aeluzu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2a6859fc044d9cfd4b15f09262efba7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Chritamh:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you, Del Sol is incredible and I just love Matt, I talked with him right before we left for Mexico, your photos are going to be&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; amazing!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We just wanted to keep it all very beachy, natural, so we did not do any music since we both love the ocean so much, we just&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; wanted the sound of the waves in the back ground, it was perfect for us.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Are you getting so excited?&amp;nbsp; Your wedding is just weeks away, good luck with it all. Yamina will take such good care of you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Smiles,\n Shanna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1297168,"PostDate":1285542485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Chritamh:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you, Del Sol is incredible and I just love Matt, I talked with him right before we left for Mexico, your photos are going to be<\/p> <p> amazing!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just wanted to keep it all very beachy, natural, so we did not do any music since we both love the ocean so much, we just<\/p> <p> wanted the sound of the waves in the back ground, it was perfect for us.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are you getting so excited?\u00a0 Your wedding is just weeks away, good luck with it all. Yamina will take such good care of you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0504694978572049e9a696b415c74ce2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @nccarolinadaisy&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;. I am working with Allen Mason&amp;nbsp;and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:info@cancuncatamarans.com\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;info@cancuncatamarans.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\"&gt;Good luck. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\"&gt;Erin &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1297629,"PostDate":1285600727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @nccarolinadaisy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own <a href='http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/<\/a>. I am working with Allen Mason\u00a0and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\"><a href='mailto:info@cancuncatamarans.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma\"><span  style=\"color: #0000ff\">info@cancuncatamarans.com<\/span><\/span><\/a>\u00a0and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\">Good luck. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif\">Erin <\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93d2e2020189e77c6e77afdb2391176a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow thanks Erin..that&#039;s super helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1297667,"PostDate":1285603708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow thanks Erin..that's super helpful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"voyager76@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258238890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christamh","Id":223302,"Name":"christamh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"201f8919faf827fbc0a1268358a8f6ed","RawContent":"GREAT!!  Thanks so much for the info!  We have about 13 people and I would rather a catamaran anyway.  I think that yacht doubles as a fishing boat too.  Yuck!  Most of my guests didnt want to travel too far from the resort because it would become an all day thing which just sounds like a pain in the rear to me.  Again...thank you! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n @nccarolinadaisy \n   \n Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own [url=\"http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/[\/url]. I am working with Allen Mason and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and [size=2][font=tahoma][email=\"info@cancuncatamarans.com\"][font=tahoma][color=#0000FF]info@cancuncatamarans.com[\/color][\/font][\/email] and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! [\/font][\/size] \n   \n [size=2][font=tahoma]Good luck. [\/font][\/size] \n   \n [size=2][font=tahoma]Erin [\/font][\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1297767,"PostDate":1285609068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> GREAT!!\u00a0 Thanks so much for the info!\u00a0 We have about 13 people and I would rather a catamaran anyway.\u00a0 I think that yacht doubles as a fishing boat too.\u00a0 Yuck!\u00a0 Most of my guests didnt want to travel too far from the resort because it would become an all day thing which just sounds like a pain in the rear to me.\u00a0 Again...thank you!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> @nccarolinadaisy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own <a href='http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/<\/a>. I am working with Allen Mason\u00a0and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\"><a href='mailto:info@cancuncatamarans.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">info@cancuncatamarans.com<\/span><\/span><\/a>\u00a0and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\">Good luck. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\">Erin <\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f7758c072ba44edfeb7483f97c0d65b","RawContent":"Erin!  I just called Allen!  What a nice guy and the price is just right for a sunset cruise!  So excited!  Thanks SOOOOO much!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n @nccarolinadaisy \n   \n Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own [url=\"http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/[\/url]. I am working with Allen Mason and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and [size=2][font=tahoma][email=\"info@cancuncatamarans.com\"][font=tahoma][color=#0000FF]info@cancuncatamarans.com[\/color][\/font][\/email] and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! [\/font][\/size] \n   \n [size=2][font=tahoma]Good luck. [\/font][\/size] \n   \n [size=2][font=tahoma]Erin [\/font][\/size][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1297825,"PostDate":1285611045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Erin!\u00a0 I just called Allen!\u00a0 What a nice guy and the price is just right for a sunset cruise!\u00a0 So excited!\u00a0 Thanks SOOOOO much!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> @nccarolinadaisy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi, we are taking our guests out on a private boat cruise on Saturday the day afer our wedding. I emailed the resort and all I got back was the 8 person boat, that doesn;t work for us as we will have around 20 to 25 people that we want to take out. So I found this person on my own <a href='http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.cancuncatamarans.com\/<\/a>. I am working with Allen Mason\u00a0and he has put together a personlized quote for us that meets our needs and budgets. Email him and <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\"><a href='mailto:info@cancuncatamarans.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">info@cancuncatamarans.com<\/span><\/span><\/a>\u00a0and he should be able to take care of you. Also they are docked just a 5 minute walk from EMP! <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\">Good luck. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: tahoma,sans-serif\">Erin <\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4bb92947cfb7b98e80d871c1c1c0980","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;\/o:p&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;Many thanks,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;Erin &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1298018,"PostDate":1285618450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">We are\u00a0purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Many thanks,<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Erin <\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b75a335d64953328dbb7eef2db4e5a2","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]aeluzu[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n Shanna, \n   \n Thank you so much for sharing. Your wedding looks like it was absolutely perfect. You looked gorgeous. The rain- I heard that it&#039;s good luck and WOW what a rainbow. I have a few questions if you don&#039;t mind. I love the maracas and that is the favor that I was thinking of using. May I ask where you found them? Did you paint them or were you able to order them hand painted? Also, the menus. Does the resort provide the menus or is this an extra kick that you added. It all looks so fantastic and gets me really excited for my big day! \n  [\/quote] \n Hello Aeluzu: \n   \n This forum helped me so much, so I had to share to hopefully help out my fellow brides.  :-) It was just perfect, I would not change one thing, that rain brought me a rainbow, so yay for that! \n The maracas were hand painted my a dear friend of mine, but here is where I ordered them, they were so cheap, I ordered the large ones from amols.com, in case the link does not work: \n [url=\"http:\/\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/view?t=Fiesta%2C&amp;amp;ss=Maracas%2C&amp;amp;gclid=CPa8idzF8KACFQqF7Qod32cGGw\"]http:\/\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/view?t=Fiesta%2C&amp;amp;ss=Maracas%2C&amp;amp;gclid=CPa8idzF8KACFQqF7Qod32cGGw[\/url]\n   \n I did my own menus and programs, but I think that the resort will do menus for you, but I am not sure. \n Good luck with all of your planning and let me know if you have any other questions. \n   \n Smiles,\n Shanna","Attachments":[],"Id":1298143,"PostDate":1285621678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>aeluzu<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Shanna,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for sharing. Your wedding looks like it was absolutely perfect. You looked gorgeous. The rain- I heard that it's good luck and WOW what a rainbow. I have a few questions if you don't mind. I love the maracas and that is the favor that I was thinking of using. May I ask where you found them? Did you paint them or were you able to order them hand painted? Also, the menus. Does the resort provide the menus or is this an extra kick that you added. It all looks so fantastic and gets me really excited for my big day!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hello Aeluzu:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This forum helped me so much, so I had to share to hopefully help out my fellow brides.\u00a0 :-) It was just perfect, I would not change one thing, that rain brought me a rainbow, so yay for that!<\/p> <p> The maracas were hand painted my a dear friend of mine, but here is where I ordered them, they were so cheap, I ordered the large ones from amols.com, in case the link does not work:<\/p> <p> <a href='\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/view?t=Fiesta%2C&ss=Maracas%2C&gclid=CPa8idzF8KACFQqF7Qod32cGGw' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amols.com...CFQqF7Qod32cGGw<\/a><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did my own menus and programs, but I think that the resort will do menus for you, but I am not sure.<\/p> <p> Good luck with all of your planning and let me know if you have any other questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sinma2@jcpenney.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257930515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223217.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":167,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Supersonic","Id":223217,"Name":"Supersonic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4d10c0259f83bc0ad2d3c6d6d55e2ba","RawContent":"Hey everyone, I know some of you were looking for info from Yamina about the hotel photographer and videographer, DJ Here is what she sent me: Photos, Juan Navarro: www.juanphotos.com Video, Miguel Cantarell: www.cancunweddingvideo.com DJ Mannia Audiovisual: www.manniacancun.com.mx. I hope this helps everyone one!! We havent booked any of these vendors yet, trying to figure what packages we want etc. Plus we have alot of time to make final decisions. Happy Planning! Lisa &amp; Joe 8\/12\/2011","Attachments":[],"Id":1298376,"PostDate":1285636996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone, I know some of you were looking for info from Yamina about the hotel photographer and videographer, DJ Here is what she sent me: Photos, Juan Navarro: www.juanphotos.com Video, Miguel Cantarell: www.cancunweddingvideo.com DJ Mannia Audiovisual: www.manniacancun.com.mx. I hope this helps everyone one!! We havent booked any of these vendors yet, trying to figure what packages we want etc. Plus we have alot of time to make final decisions. Happy Planning! Lisa & Joe 8\/12\/2011\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"304c6e90890c34e1ea33928aa7d5bf89","RawContent":"Erin the above posting was for you lol, I just figured out how to reply back to a specific person....sorry \n   \n Hope this helps you!!!  Yamina included those websites, the vendors look good to me......Lisa [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [color=black][font=&#039;arial&#039;][size=2]We are purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! [\/size][\/font][\/color] \n [color=black][font=&#039;arial&#039;][\/font][\/color] \n [color=black][font=&#039;arial&#039;][size=2]Many thanks,[\/size][\/font][\/color] \n   \n [color=black][font=&#039;arial&#039;][size=2]Erin [\/size][\/font][\/color][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1298380,"PostDate":1285637147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Erin the above posting was for you lol, I just figured out how to reply back to a specific person....sorry<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this helps you!!!\u00a0 Yamina included those websites, the vendors look good to me......Lisa<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">We are\u00a0purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Many thanks,<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Erin <\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":740,"NextPage":750,"PreviousPage":730,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
