Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fe5706e726cd724c9a1f470e1ebf248","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ncarolinadaisy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Erin!  I just called Allen!  What a nice guy and the price is just right for a sunset cruise!  So excited!  Thanks SOOOOO much!\n   \n  [\/quote] \n \n   \n Yay!!! I am so glad it is working out. I have been researching different places for this boat thing for 2 weeks now and Allen has been amazing and he does have really great prices. You will be there before me so you have to let me know how it works out!! :) \n   \n Also how long are you taking the catamaran out for? We are doing a 4 hour trip but not sure if we should have them take us to Isla Mujeres?? Still debating. Let me know. \n   \n Erin","Attachments":[],"Id":1298959,"PostDate":1285696633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Erin!\u00a0 I just called Allen!\u00a0 What a nice guy and the price is just right for a sunset cruise!\u00a0 So excited!\u00a0 Thanks SOOOOO much!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yay!!! I am so glad it is working out. I have been researching different places for this boat thing for 2 weeks now and Allen has been amazing and he does have really great prices. You will be there before me so you have to let me know how it works out!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also how long are you taking the catamaran out for? We are doing a 4 hour trip but not sure if we should have them take us to Isla Mujeres?? Still debating. Let me know.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Erin<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdf8a2925406d85023851d7515c68ab4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LJ2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hey everyone, I know some of you were looking for info from Yamina about the hotel photographer and videographer, DJ Here is what she sent me: Photos, Juan Navarro: www.juanphotos.com Video, Miguel Cantarell: www.cancunweddingvideo.com DJ Mannia Audiovisual: www.manniacancun.com.mx. I hope this helps everyone one!! We havent booked any of these vendors yet, trying to figure what packages we want etc. Plus we have alot of time to make final decisions. Happy Planning! Lisa &amp;amp; Joe 8\/12\/2011[\/quote] \n \n Thank you!! Very helpful! So the the photographer and videographer these are the guys that come with the gold package?? \n   \n Thanks Erin","Attachments":[],"Id":1298989,"PostDate":1285697465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LJ2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hey everyone, I know some of you were looking for info from Yamina about the hotel photographer and videographer, DJ Here is what she sent me: Photos, Juan Navarro: www.juanphotos.com Video, Miguel Cantarell: www.cancunweddingvideo.com DJ Mannia Audiovisual: www.manniacancun.com.mx. I hope this helps everyone one!! We havent booked any of these vendors yet, trying to figure what packages we want etc. Plus we have alot of time to make final decisions. Happy Planning! Lisa & Joe 8\/12\/2011<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Thank you!! Very helpful! So the the photographer and videographer these are the guys that come with the gold package??<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks Erin<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aeec7aaca85071f1f5b9d31283e6d0e9","RawContent":"Well I am not sure that we are going to do the boat now.  He just sent me a picture of it and it looks as if there is a cabin but not much room for seating outside of that.  We were planning a sunset cruise for about 3 hours.  I wanted a catamaran, but when he sent me pictures it was not what I was thinking in terms of a catamaran.  I emailed him this afternoon so hopefully he will get back to me with another option.  Ill let you know! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ergalv31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n \n   \n Yay!!! I am so glad it is working out. I have been researching different places for this boat thing for 2 weeks now and Allen has been amazing and he does have really great prices. You will be there before me so you have to let me know how it works out!! :) \n   \n Also how long are you taking the catamaran out for? We are doing a 4 hour trip but not sure if we should have them take us to Isla Mujeres?? Still debating. Let me know. \n   \n Erin \n \n  [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1299055,"PostDate":1285699682,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Well I am not sure that we are going to do the boat now.\u00a0 He just sent me a picture of it and it looks as if there is a cabin but not much room for seating outside of that.\u00a0 We were planning a sunset cruise for about 3 hours.\u00a0 I wanted a catamaran, but when he sent me pictures it was not what I was thinking in terms of a catamaran.\u00a0 I emailed him this afternoon so hopefully he will get back to me with another option.\u00a0 Ill let you know!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ergalv31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yay!!! I am so glad it is working out. I have been researching different places for this boat thing for 2 weeks now and Allen has been amazing and he does have really great prices. You will be there before me so you have to let me know how it works out!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also how long are you taking the catamaran out for? We are doing a 4 hour trip but not sure if we should have them take us to Isla Mujeres?? Still debating. Let me know.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Erin<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c81de1269be1fe30c72ceac61d109d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n \n Hello!&amp;nbsp; Alex, Juan Navarro&#039;s associate did my wedding.  Juan and Alex did my&amp;nbsp;TTD pics.&amp;nbsp;I highly recommend both of them,&amp;nbsp;I love my pics.&amp;nbsp; If you or anyone else would like details about my experience or to see my pics please email me at &lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;\/o:p&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;Many thanks,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: &#039;arial&#039;, &#039;sans-serif&#039;; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"&gt;Erin &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n","Attachments":[],"Id":1300151,"PostDate":1285785135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Hello!\u00a0 Alex, Juan Navarro's associate did my wedding.\u00a0\u00a0Juan and Alex did my\u00a0TTD pics.\u00a0I highly recommend both of them,\u00a0I love my pics.\u00a0 If you or anyone else would like details about my experience or to see my pics please email me at <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">We are\u00a0purchasing the gold wedding package that includes a photo package. However I have not been able to see the work of the photographer that they use, even though I have asked Yamina a few times. Is anyone else using that package for their photos, if so have they seen the work? Or do you have any recommendations of other photographers?? Any suggestions are greatly appreciated!! <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\"><o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Many thanks,<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:'arial', 'sans-serif'; color: black; font-size: 10pt\">Erin <\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"duncancls4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280003362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cls2010","Id":230617,"Name":"cls2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93541771cbd1a73767a8281507a94e8a","RawContent":"Hi Shanna!  Did you guys have to pay extra to go over to the villas?  Do you know how that was set up?  Through Yamina?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Supersonic[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Scrose: \n \n Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.  We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next \n Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.  :-) \n \n As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on, \n I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!  We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while \n they waited for us. No one cared at all. \n \n Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them. \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328[\/url] \n \n Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help. \n \n Smiles,\n Shanna[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1300789,"PostDate":1285849948,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Shanna!\u00a0 Did you guys have to pay extra to go over to the villas?\u00a0 Do you know how that was set up?\u00a0 Through Yamina?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Supersonic<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Scrose:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorry I am just getting back with you, it has been a bit crazy here for us.\u00a0 We are having our local reception here for all those that could not make it to Mexico next<\/p> <p> Saturday, so I am running around getting everything in order, I could really use a wedding coordinator like Yamina right now.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the Villa next to EPM, our photographer, Vincent, had made arrangements to go over there, he just took us over right after the ceremony. From the ceremony on,<\/p> <p> I had no concept of time, sorry, but it did take a while, it was sooooo worth it!\u00a0 We did a cocktail hour for everyone, so they were fine eating some snacks and drinking while<\/p> <p> they waited for us. No one cared at all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is our slideshow from Del Sol, they are amazing, I am so very glad that I went with them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=328' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...leries\/?gal=328<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you have any other questions, I am happy to help.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Smiles,<br \/> Shanna<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a17a6ab16ee22b243a72d313897af55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey girls!&amp;nbsp; I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on October 23rd, 2010 at 4pm!&amp;nbsp; I have been reading this blog for the past few months and it has been so helpful!&amp;nbsp; Yamina just confirmed our venues for the cocktail hour and reception.&amp;nbsp; Cannot believe I am leaving in 19 days for Mexico!&amp;nbsp; We are having 36 people coming with us and I am so excited!&amp;nbsp; Question, how are you all getting your wedding dress down there?&amp;nbsp; Anyone heard of people having an issue carrying it on?&amp;nbsp; I have had a few girlfriends do destination weddings and have had no problems but I am just curious what everyone else is doing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1302678,"PostDate":1286030677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey girls!\u00a0 I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on October 23rd, 2010 at 4pm!\u00a0 I have been reading this blog for the past few months and it has been so helpful!\u00a0 Yamina just confirmed our venues for the cocktail hour and reception.\u00a0 Cannot believe I am leaving in 19 days for Mexico!\u00a0 We are having 36 people coming with us and I am so excited!\u00a0 Question, how are you all getting your wedding dress down there?\u00a0 Anyone heard of people having an issue carrying it on?\u00a0 I have had a few girlfriends do destination weddings and have had no problems but I am just curious what everyone else is doing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m.c.masington@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1285335775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mcc102310","Id":232617,"Name":"mcc102310","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4b9a90810f1e05d50f7da37767be61a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been reading this blog since I booked my wedding at EPM back in February, but haven&#039;t posted much. &amp;nbsp;Everyone has helped so much- thought I&#039;d post about my experience on my site visit. &amp;nbsp;We will be getting married there in January.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fiance and I went to Mexico (playa del carmen) for a last minute trip ( got a great deal at a little resort in playa) and had the opportunity to go up to EPM for a site visit one day this past week.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I met with Yamina, saw the property, and had dinner at one of the restaurants. &amp;nbsp;Yamina was the nicest person- so informative and really took time to show me everything... from an example of every room type available to every pool, bar, and restaurant on the property. &amp;nbsp;The property is gorgeous!! &amp;nbsp;She was so nice and really explained everything will happen between now and the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The food and wine was great- we had dinner at the French restaurant and were very impressed with both the quality of the food and wine and the service.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; After seeing the gazebo- we are torn between the gazebo and the beach... it will be a hard decision.... anyone have suggestions one way or another??&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Something to keep in mind... it&#039;s quite a drive from the airport and from Cancun. &amp;nbsp;We really didn&#039;t want to be that close to Cancun- but after hearing from my guests- some will be staying off property and thought it wouldn&#039;t be a problem to get to the resort from Cancun hotels. &amp;nbsp;However- it seems that it may be a pretty expensive (and long) cab ride from Cancun. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do any of you have guests staying off property? &amp;nbsp;How do you explain that it will cost a lot of money to bring them on to the property for events? &amp;nbsp;I feel bad asking them to pay for the $100 night pass and the $70 event pass- but we have a rehearsal\/welcome dinner planned for Friday and the ceremony on Saturday... that makes for a lot of additional expense for us if we pay for those events for those staying off property.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyway- thought I&#039;d share my experience. &amp;nbsp;If you have any suggestions about the off site guests- let me know!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1302697,"PostDate":1286033886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have been reading this blog since I booked my wedding at EPM back in February, but haven't posted much. \u00a0Everyone has helped so much- thought I'd post about my experience on my site visit. \u00a0We will be getting married there in January.<\/p> <p> My fiance and I went to Mexico (playa del carmen) for a last minute trip ( got a great deal at a little resort in playa) and had the opportunity to go up to EPM for a site visit one day this past week.<\/p> <p> I met with Yamina, saw the property, and had dinner at one of the restaurants. \u00a0Yamina was the nicest person- so informative and really took time to show me everything... from an example of every room type available to every pool, bar, and restaurant on the property. \u00a0The property is gorgeous!! \u00a0She was so nice and really explained everything will happen between now and the wedding.<\/p> <p> The food and wine was great- we had dinner at the French restaurant and were very impressed with both the quality of the food and wine and the service.<\/p> <p> After seeing the gazebo- we are torn between the gazebo and the beach... it will be a hard decision.... anyone have suggestions one way or another??<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Something to keep in mind... it's quite a drive from the airport and from Cancun. \u00a0We really didn't want to be that close to Cancun- but after hearing from my guests- some will be staying off property and thought it wouldn't be a problem to get to the resort from Cancun hotels. \u00a0However- it seems that it may be a pretty expensive (and long) cab ride from Cancun. \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do any of you have guests staying off property? \u00a0How do you explain that it will cost a lot of money to bring them on to the property for events? \u00a0I feel bad asking them to pay for the $100 night pass and the $70 event pass- but we have a rehearsal\/welcome dinner planned for Friday and the ceremony on Saturday... that makes for a lot of additional expense for us if we pay for those events for those staying off property.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway- thought I'd share my experience. \u00a0If you have any suggestions about the off site guests- let me know!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristin.dziadosz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262595463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kdziadosz","Id":224294,"Name":"kdziadosz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54c30c0fb93a3a56109952441928942a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am 5 days after you!&amp;nbsp; 10\/28\/10!&amp;nbsp; I plan on carrying on my wedding dress.&amp;nbsp; I have done it once before when I traveled to my best friends wedding.&amp;nbsp; I know baggage can get lost so I wanted to make sure that my bridesmaid dress and shoes got there safely!&amp;nbsp; I would check on the airline policy online.&amp;nbsp; Most will let you store it up in business class or in the attendant closet.   I am sure they will take good care of you!&amp;nbsp; Good luck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1302743,"PostDate":1286042459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am 5 days after you!\u00a0 10\/28\/10!\u00a0 I plan on carrying on my wedding dress.\u00a0 I have done it once before when I traveled to my best friends wedding.\u00a0 I know baggage can get lost so I wanted to make sure that my bridesmaid dress and shoes got there safely!\u00a0 I would check on the airline policy online.\u00a0 Most will let you store it up in business class or in the attendant closet.\u00a0\u00a0 I am sure they will take good care of you!\u00a0 Good luck!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f3c7bddc466b6402eee501f2d644413","RawContent":"\n Hi Ladies!!\n \n Has anyone used or heard any reviews on DJ Disco-Movil?? \n His prices are considerably lower than the rest of the DJs but I have not neen able to find any reviews on him. Any feed back would be great!! \n \n Thanks,\n \n Erin","Attachments":[],"Id":1302835,"PostDate":1286059101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br> Hi Ladies!!<br> <br> Has anyone used or heard any reviews on DJ Disco-Movil?? <br> His prices are considerably lower than the rest of the DJs but I have not neen able to find any reviews on him. Any feed back would be great!! <br> <br> Thanks,<br> <br> Erin\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ergalv31@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281918864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":152,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ergalv31","Id":231393,"Name":"ergalv31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f64bac55a7a34df1b38b963d102ba44f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For those still looking for a photographer, here is a link to some of my pictures taken by Juan Navarro.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Juan and Alex from Juan Navarro Photos are excellent photographers.&amp;nbsp; If you have any questions please feel free to contact me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:duncancls4@yahoo.com\/\"&gt;duncancls4@yahoo.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1302995,"PostDate":1286110770,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello<\/p> <p> For those still looking for a photographer, here is a link to some of my pictures taken by Juan Navarro.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.juanphoto...9\/corey-celita\/<\/a><\/p> <p> Juan and Alex from Juan Navarro Photos are excellent photographers.\u00a0 If you have any questions please feel free to contact me at <a href='mailto:duncancls4@yahoo.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>duncancls4@yahoo.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"duncancls4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280003362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cls2010","Id":230617,"Name":"cls2010","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":750,"NextPage":760,"PreviousPage":740,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
