{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05b196f9b55bc35025818542576ec8f6","RawContent":"cls2010, \n \n Thank you so much for the feedback, your pics are beautiful!!!  I am definitely going with him, and it will be easier because Yamina said he was the hotel photographer they recommended \n and gave his price packages.  Did you do video through him as well?  I saw a video camera in one of your pics.  \n Lisa\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cls2010[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello \n For those still looking for a photographer, here is a link to some of my pictures taken by Juan Navarro.  [url=\"http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/\"]http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/[\/url] \n Juan and Alex from Juan Navarro Photos are excellent photographers.  If you have any questions please feel free to contact me at [email=\"duncancls4@yahoo.com\/\"]duncancls4@yahoo.com\/[\/email] \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1303172,"PostDate":1286144944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> cls2010,<\/p> <p> <br \/> Thank you so much for the feedback, your pics are beautiful!!!\u00a0 I am definitely going with him, and it will be easier because Yamina said he was the hotel photographer they recommended<\/p> <p> and gave his price packages.\u00a0 Did you do video through him as well?\u00a0 I saw a video camera in one of your pics.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Lisa<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cls2010<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello<\/p> <p> For those still looking for a photographer, here is a link to some of my pictures taken by Juan Navarro.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.juanphotos.com\/galleries\/?\/page\/7a09\/corey-celita\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.juanphoto...9\/corey-celita\/<\/a><\/p> <p> Juan and Alex from Juan Navarro Photos are excellent photographers.\u00a0 If you have any questions please feel free to contact me at <a href='mailto:duncancls4@yahoo.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>duncancls4@yahoo.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c213f29b878a0b2138f41940e2658e4","RawContent":"mcc102310, \n \n Wow 36 people thats so exciting!!! Did you get the house dj and photo\/videographer through the hotel that Yamina recommended?  I heard you have to bring your dress on the plane and you \n can keep it up front in a closet where the flight attendants keep their things, people say its no problem and they steam your dress at the hotel the night before if you like, I saw that in wedding package.....curious, what are your favors and\/or welcome bags for your guests?  I am getting married August 12, 2011 and we are expecting the same amount if not more at our wedding.  We also wanted to extend the reception for an hour if thats possible.  What venues did you pick for your cocktail and reception? \n Thanks!! \n Lisa\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mcc102310[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey girls!  I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on October 23rd, 2010 at 4pm!  I have been reading this blog for the past few months and it has been so helpful!  Yamina just confirmed our venues for the cocktail hour and reception.  Cannot believe I am leaving in 19 days for Mexico!  We are having 36 people coming with us and I am so excited!  Question, how are you all getting your wedding dress down there?  Anyone heard of people having an issue carrying it on?  I have had a few girlfriends do destination weddings and have had no problems but I am just curious what everyone else is doing.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1303174,"PostDate":1286145331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> mcc102310,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wow 36 people thats so exciting!!! Did you get the house dj and photo\/videographer through the hotel that Yamina recommended?\u00a0 I heard you have to bring your dress on the plane and you<\/p> <p> can keep it up front in a closet where the flight attendants keep their things, people say its no problem and they steam your dress at the hotel the night before if you like, I saw that in wedding package.....curious, what are your favors and\/or welcome bags for your guests?\u00a0 I am getting married August 12, 2011 and we are expecting the same amount if not more at our wedding.\u00a0 We also wanted to extend the reception for an hour if thats possible.\u00a0 What venues did you pick for your cocktail and reception?<\/p> <p> Thanks!!<\/p> <p> Lisa<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mcc102310<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey girls!\u00a0 I am getting married at Excellence Playa Mujeres on October 23rd, 2010 at 4pm!\u00a0 I have been reading this blog for the past few months and it has been so helpful!\u00a0 Yamina just confirmed our venues for the cocktail hour and reception.\u00a0 Cannot believe I am leaving in 19 days for Mexico!\u00a0 We are having 36 people coming with us and I am so excited!\u00a0 Question, how are you all getting your wedding dress down there?\u00a0 Anyone heard of people having an issue carrying it on?\u00a0 I have had a few girlfriends do destination weddings and have had no problems but I am just curious what everyone else is doing.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmarsetti@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280944960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231018.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LJ2011","Id":231018,"Name":"LJ2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1575078b7dbbcc1ae5ea70c70a8716e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just returned from a site visit, and my mother(s) and I toured 4 different resorts for my wedding. Excellence Playa Mujeres was by far the BEST! The pictures on the website really short change the landscaping and the beauty of the overall resort. The new wedding coordinator, Yamina, gave us a 2 hour tour of the entire resort, guest rooms, all the restaurants, etc. She seems to be very good and reliable. As I continue to plan my wedding with her, I will keep you posted.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1303325,"PostDate":1286169582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just returned from a site visit, and my mother(s) and I toured 4 different resorts for my wedding. Excellence Playa Mujeres was by far the BEST! The pictures on the website really short change the landscaping and the beauty of the overall resort. The new wedding coordinator, Yamina, gave us a 2 hour tour of the entire resort, guest rooms, all the restaurants, etc. She seems to be very good and reliable. As I continue to plan my wedding with her, I will keep you posted.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mpettyowens@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1285718241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232755.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mpettyowens","Id":232755,"Name":"mpettyowens","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d47132a77c40a731ba8ef116852cc749","RawContent":"Lisa \n Thank you!  The v[size=1][font=calibri]ideographer was recommended by the hotel.  I have not watched the video, we are waiting to watch it with our family.  Once we watch it I will let you know how the video turned out.[\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=1][font=calibri]Celita[\/font][\/size]\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LJ2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n cls2010, \n \n Thank you so much for the feedback, your pics are beautiful!!!  I am definitely going with him, and it will be easier because Yamina said he was the hotel photographer they recommended \n and gave his price packages.  Did you do video through him as well?  I saw a video camera in one of your pics.  \n Lisa\n   \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1303885,"PostDate":1286217501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lisa<\/p> <p> Thank you!\u00a0 The\u00a0v<span  style=\"font-size: medium\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">ideographer\u00a0was recommended by the hotel.\u00a0 I have not watched the video, we are waiting to watch it with our family.\u00a0 Once we watch it I will let you know how the video turned out.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: medium\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Celita<\/span><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LJ2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> cls2010,<\/p> <p> <br \/> Thank you so much for the feedback, your pics are beautiful!!!\u00a0 I am definitely going with him, and it will be easier because Yamina said he was the hotel photographer they recommended<\/p> <p> and gave his price packages.\u00a0 Did you do video through him as well?\u00a0 I saw a video camera in one of your pics.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Lisa<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"duncancls4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280003362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cls2010","Id":230617,"Name":"cls2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7789f7cf1a5e042e16adf0f993c1127","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My wedding is in just a little over a week! &amp;nbsp;Argh! &amp;nbsp;For anyone who has been there:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants. &amp;nbsp;I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it&#039;s not open on Fridays. &amp;nbsp;I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1307060,"PostDate":1286484192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My wedding is in just a little over a week! \u00a0Argh! \u00a0For anyone who has been there:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants. \u00a0I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it's not open on Fridays. \u00a0I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions? \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2814820d41bae01c9e006bbeee08f62a","RawContent":"So exciting!  We expect a full report! \n \n Just a quick question...have you picked out your flowers?  I sent Yamina a picture of what I wanted and she said it wouldn&#039;t be a problem, but I kind of want to see what I am getting before the wedding day.  Do you know how that works?  Do you have any more details? \n \n Wedding in 18 days!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]scrose[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n My wedding is in just a little over a week!  Argh!  For anyone who has been there:  \n \n After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants.  I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it&#039;s not open on Fridays.  I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1307447,"PostDate":1286541482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So exciting!\u00a0 We expect a full report!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just a quick question...have you picked out your flowers?\u00a0 I sent Yamina a picture of what I wanted and she said it wouldn't be a problem, but I kind of want to see what I am getting before the wedding day.\u00a0 Do you know how that works?\u00a0 Do you have any more details?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wedding in 18 days!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>scrose<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> My wedding is in just a little over a week! \u00a0Argh! \u00a0For anyone who has been there:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants. \u00a0I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it's not open on Fridays. \u00a0I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions? \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c06c2f9c8a09094799743efce95e1e7","RawContent":"I sent her 3 or 4 pictures similar to what I am looking for...I am flexible on the type of flowers as long as the color (fuschia\/hot pink) is right, so didn&#039;t give super explicit instructions.  One of the pics I sent had peonies and she said those are really expensive there so I nixed those, but the rest she just said she would send to the florist.  I figured we would talk about it in more detail once we get there next Wednesday... \n \n Same with the cake...I just picked a flavor and sent her some pictures (just want a few flowers on there that will match bouguet, etc). \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ncarolinadaisy[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n So exciting!  We expect a full report! \n \n Just a quick question...have you picked out your flowers?  I sent Yamina a picture of what I wanted and she said it wouldn&#039;t be a problem, but I kind of want to see what I am getting before the wedding day.  Do you know how that works?  Do you have any more details? \n \n Wedding in 18 days!\n   \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1307498,"PostDate":1286546150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I sent her 3 or 4 pictures similar to what I am looking for...I am flexible on the type of flowers as long as the color (fuschia\/hot pink) is right, so didn't give super explicit instructions. \u00a0One of the pics I sent had peonies and she said those are really expensive there so I nixed those, but the rest she just said she would send to the florist. \u00a0I figured we would talk about it in more detail once we get there next Wednesday...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Same with the cake...I just picked a flavor and sent her some pictures (just want a few flowers on there that will match bouguet, etc).\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ncarolinadaisy<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> So exciting!\u00a0 We expect a full report!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just a quick question...have you picked out your flowers?\u00a0 I sent Yamina a picture of what I wanted and she said it wouldn't be a problem, but I kind of want to see what I am getting before the wedding day.\u00a0 Do you know how that works?\u00a0 Do you have any more details?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wedding in 18 days!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226496.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"scrose","Id":226496,"Name":"scrose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc385cb75848a370c8d2e4b688c464ba","RawContent":"Depending on the weather I would say the Lobster house would be my choice because of it&#039;s location.  Being outside and by the water has to be a big bonus. \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]scrose[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n My wedding is in just a little over a week!  Argh!  For anyone who has been there:  \n \n After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants.  I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it&#039;s not open on Fridays.  I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1308310,"PostDate":1286632476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Depending on the weather I would say the Lobster house would be my choice because of it's location.\u00a0 Being outside and by the water has to be a big bonus.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>scrose<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> My wedding is in just a little over a week! \u00a0Argh! \u00a0For anyone who has been there:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> After we wedding we are just doing a cocktail hour and then I was going to make a dinner reservation at one of the restaurants. \u00a0I had kind of planned on Agave, since my wedding has kind of a mexican kitsch theme, BUT, it's not open on Fridays. \u00a0I am debating between the Flavor Market and the Lobster House...any suggestions? \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"voyager76@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258238890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"christamh","Id":223302,"Name":"christamh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8827a1c625694648999057f8e51c2b60","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Any suggestions on decorating crutches?&amp;nbsp; I just tore my ACL on Saturday and my Playa wedding is in less than 2 weeks.&amp;nbsp; Uhhhh...be careful everyone!&amp;nbsp; Not the way I was planning on spending my wedding day...&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1310368,"PostDate":1286906139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Any suggestions on decorating crutches?\u00a0 I just tore my ACL on Saturday and my Playa wedding is in less than 2 weeks.\u00a0 Uhhhh...be careful everyone!\u00a0 Not the way I was planning on spending my wedding day...\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>October 28th 2010<\/span><br><span>EPM Here We Come!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/\">www.justproposed.com\/benandmelissa\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ncarolinadaisy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275538188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncarolinadaisy","Id":228794,"Name":"ncarolinadaisy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"481f59bbebc0226b28ed933559c00a67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hurricane Paula...NOOOOOOO!!!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Everyone say a prayer for me, we fly out in the morning...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1310798,"PostDate":1286927680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hurricane Paula...NOOOOOOO!!!!! \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Everyone say a prayer for me, we fly out in the morning...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.rose@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268776947,"Pho