  'operation' => 'addReply',
  'SessionId' => '9c435a38b031f21acc7ef9df4260bce9',
  'topicId' => '79893',
  'postContent' => 'I think they\'re gorgeous!!! Love the coral colour! Definitely something you\'ll be able to keep afterwards!! You did a beautiful job!! Oh and just as an FYI and for any other Canadian brides, you CAN bring back your bouquet. I\'ve done it twice. Customs says it\'s because they\'re cut and wrapped flowers, nit plants. When we came back from Mexico in October the customs officer told us they get asked all the time and in fact there was someone ahead of us in line for the exact same thing.',
  'follow' => 'False',
